DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robbie & Jesus 425-344-6997\n\n \n\nScope- 1 casemen
	t\, 1 ADA casement\, 1 horizontal slider\, & 1 fixed window. BEE will arri
	ve onsite at 8:30\, testing will begin at 9:30.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- Per
	 AMAA Ratings with 1/3 reduction. PG35 will be tested at 3.5 and PG 40 wil
	l be tested at 4.0. \n\n \n\nNote- All test locations must have interior a
	ir barrier sealant installed\, no siding installed\, Head flashing in plac
	e\, and WRB installed at a minimum of 6 ft around the locations.\n\n \n\nG
	C to invite window manufacturer to the testing.\n\n \n\nOnsite Contact- Er
	ic Sparks\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n\n\n\nEric Sparks | Senior Supe
	rintendent\n\nt. 503.646.0521 | d. 503.969.3279\n\nw. www.lmcconstruction.
	com <http://www.lmcconstruction.com/> \n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n
