CATEGORIES:Window Testing
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20240104T210718Z
DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robbie & Jesus 425-344-6997\n\n \n\nScope- Test one 
	of each operator type. Window Type A1 (Casement)\, D1(Casement Fixed Combo
	)\, C1 (Fixed Combo Window)\, A2 (Fixed Window)\, &  F2 (Sliding Glass Doo
	r)  5 locations total. \n\n \n\nGC to provide adequate access to the exter
	ior of each test specimen and provide an adequate water source to the outs
	ide of the test specimen.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 6.0 PSF\n\n \n\nNote- All
	 testing locations should have the interior air barrier sealant in place a
	nd visible\, No siding installed just primary waterproofing\, and head fla
	shing installed.\n\n \n\nOnsite Contact-\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\nJohn Perino\n\nS
	uperintendent\n\njohn@srmdevelopment.com <mailto:john@srmdevelopment.com> 
	 \n\n \n\nMobile:   (408) 722-0093\n\nMailing:  111 N. Post\, Suite 200\n\
	n                Spokane\, WA 99201\n\nJobsite:  SRM Construction – Nove
	lle Senior Living\n\n                3355 Almaden Expressway\n\n          
	      San Jose\, CA 95118\n\n \n\nwww.srmconstruction.net <http://www.srmc
	onstruction.net> \n\n \n\n \n\n
