	:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>Note- Test
	 locations must have interior air barrier sealant in place and visible\, h
	ead flashing installed\, and no siding.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoN
	ormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class
