DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robbie & Jesus\n\n \n\nNote- All locations should ha
	ve the interior air barrier installed and visible\, head flashing installe
	d\, and no siding. GC to invite window manufacturer.\n\n \n\nScope- \n\nFo
	r building A let’s test the following windows at L4’s South: - please 
	send out a meeting invite for 1/12/24.\n\n*	Window Types W13-R / W53-R / W
	53-L / W13-L\n\n\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 6.0 PSF\n\n \n\nContact-\n\n \n\n 
	\n\n <http://www.compass-gc.com/> \n\n\n\nKJ Holmes​\n\nProject Engineer
	\n\nCell: 206.953.2023 <tel:206.953.2023> \n\n11332 NE 122nd Way Ste. 350\
	n\n\, \n\nKirkland\, WA\n\n \n\n98034\n\nKJ.Holmes@compass-gc.com <mailto:
	KJ.Holmes@compass-gc.com> \n\n | \n\nwww.compass-gc.com <http://www.compas
	s-gc.com/> \n\n | \n\n <https://www.linkedin.com/company/compass-general-c
	onstruction/> \n\n <https://www.instagram.com/compassgc/> \n\n <https://ww
	w.facebook.com/compassgc/> \n\n​​This message contains confidential in
	formation and is intended only for the individual(s) addressed in the mess
	age. \n​If you are not the named addressee\, you should not disseminate\
	, distribute\, or copy this email. \n​If you are not the intended recipi
	ent\, you are notified that disclosing\, distributing\, or copying this em
	ail is strictly prohibited.  \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n
