DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robbie & Jesus\n\n \n\nNote- All locations should ha
	ve the interior air barrier installed and visible\, head flashing installe
	d\, and no siding. GC to invite window manufacturer.\n\n \n\nScope- \n\nPl
	ease see the alternate windows for testing at building B’s North perimet
	er – types W53-L / W53-R and W50-L. \n\n \n\n\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 6.0
	 PSF\n\n \n\nContact-\n\n \n\n \n\n <http://www.compass-gc.com/> \n\n\n\nK
	J Holmes​\n\nProject Engineer\n\nCell: 206.953.2023 <tel:206.953.2023> \
	n\n11332 NE 122nd Way Ste. 350\n\n\, \n\nKirkland\, WA\n\n \n\n98034\n\nKJ
	.Holmes@compass-gc.com <mailto:KJ.Holmes@compass-gc.com> \n\n | \n\nwww.co
	mpass-gc.com <http://www.compass-gc.com/> \n\n | \n\n <https://www.linkedi
	n.com/company/compass-general-construction/> \n\n <https://www.instagram.c
	om/compassgc/> \n\n <https://www.facebook.com/compassgc/> \n\n​​This m
	essage contains confidential information and is intended only for the indi
	vidual(s) addressed in the message. \n​If you are not the named addresse
	e\, you should not disseminate\, distribute\, or copy this email. \n​If 
	you are not the intended recipient\, you are notified that disclosing\, di
	stributing\, or copying this email is strictly prohibited.  \n\n \n\n \n\n
