	 PSF\n\n \n\nScope- Retest the 3 failed windows & the sliding glass door f
	rom the 11/01/23 trip. If time allows additional locations may be tested.\
	n\n \n\nNote: All test locations need interior air barrier sealant install
	ed. The sliding glass door should have the sill extender installed.\n\n \n
	\nGC Contact: Zac Nelson – 503-708-8609 \n\n \n\n
