	ope- \n\n \n\nFixed Window PG50 - A location of your choice preferably gro
	und level. Test with the 1/3 reduction at 5.0 PSF\n\n \n\nSliding Glass Do
	or PG50 - A location of your choice preferably ground level. Test with the
	 1/3 reduction at 5.0 PSF\n\n \n\nHorizontal Slider PG40 - A location of y
	our choice preferably ground level. Test with the 1/3 reduction at 4.0 PSF
	\n\n \n\nNote- GC will provide a vehicle\, lodging\, lumber\, & water hose
	.\n\n \n\nContact- \n\nAndrew Garsha\n\nProject Manager\n\n907-350-0186 (c
