DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Chris\, Robbie\, Jesus\, & Dave 425-599-8766\n\n \n\
	nScope- Air barrier testing \n\nThis is a Built Green project targeting 0.
	30CFM/SF. They have normal appliances (exhaust fans\, ducted range hoods\,
	 and also localized ERVs in the hallway). The project is 44 units\, 5 floo
	rs.\n\n \n\nBEE will be onsite at 8am\, test will begin at Noon. Duration 
	30 minutes to 1 hour.\n\n \n\nNote- All entryway glass needs to be install
	ed and missing glass in windows (3) should be installed at the time of the
	 testing. P traps must be filled with water. Door hardware should also be 
	installed.\n\n \n\nOnsite Contact-\n\nAlexandra \n\nACS\,LLC\n\nVolt Elect
	ric\, LLC\n\nEarth Movers\, LLC\n\nA&A Property Holding\n\n34008 9th AVE S
	#B-100\n\nFederal Way\, WA 98003\n\nOffice@BuiltbyACS.com <mailto:Office@B
	uiltbyACS.com> \n\n206-550-8855 cell\n\n253-344-1197 office\n\nwww.Builtby
	ACS.com <http://www.BuiltbyACS.com> \n\n \n\n
