	 traps full of water \n*	All exterior doors need to operable and latching 
	mechanism installed. \n\n \n\nOn site contact:\n\n \n\n <https://www.foush
	ee.com/>   \n\nJeremy Webb\, Project Manager\n\noffice: (425) 957-2114 | m
