CATEGORIES:ABT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20231212T230417Z
DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Chris\, Robbie\, Torin\, & Jesus.\n\n \n\nScope- Air
	 Barrier Testing `30k sqft warehouse.\n\n \n\nNotes-\n\n \n\nBEE will arri
	ve onsite at 8am to begin setting up equipment for the test\, the testing 
	will begin around 10am.\n\n \n\nAll HVAC should be off with the dampers in
	 the closed position\, BEE will cover any accessible ducting on the roof w
	ith blue grill mask.\n\n \n\nBEE will need 4 to 7 separate circuits of pre
	ferably 20 amp (15 amp usually works too) of non GFI power.\n\n \n\nContac
	t-\n\n \n\n\n\nDoug Lisser\n\nChad Fisher Construction\n\ndougl@cfishercon
	struction.com <mailto:dougl@cfisherconstruction.com>  | www.cfisherconstru
	ction.com <http://www.cfisherconstruction.com/> \n\nMobile 360.708.1164 | 
	Office 360.757.0580\n\n \n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20231120T143000
