DESCRIPTION:Hello Everyone\,\n\nThis marketing photoshoot will take place a
	ll around the inside of the Edmonds office.  .\n\n \n\nPlease be in the of
	fice if you can and come wearing business casual attire.\n\n \n\nLastly\, 
	please be sure to tidy up your workspace\, removing any items that you/we 
	wouldn’t want to end up in the background of photos\, clutter\, personal
	 items\, signs\, etc.\n\n \n\nThank you.\n\n
