DESCRIPTION:Robbie & Jesus\, W/ BEE 425-344-6997\n\n \n\nScope: We will be 
	testing the windows on the list in 312 instead of 212. In unit 310 the sca
	ffolding is in the way of that door being able to open so we might have to
	 test that at another time.\n\nPlease see windows that will be tested.\n\n
				\nUnit 212\n\nPicture\n\n			\nUnit 212\n\nCasement\n\n			\nUnit 212\n\n
	Sliding window\n\n			\nUnit 309\n\nSliding door\n\n			\nUnit 310 \n\nOut s
	wing door\n\n			\nUnit 314 \n\nAwning\n\n			\n					\n					\nCheck list \n\
	n1. Will need water. \n\n2. Interior sealant needs to be complete\n\n3. 4'
	 of WRB must be installed and window weaved in with window above\n\n      
	or along side if less than 4'\n\n4. VPI must be on site for inspection\n\n
	 \n\nOn site contact:\n\nJC Cunningham\n\n \n\n <http://stsconstructionser
	vices.com/> \n\nJohnC@stsconst.com <mailto:JohnC@stsconst.com> \n\n206.551
	.8683 Cell\n\n206.439.6343 Office\n\n \n\n \n\n
