DESCRIPTION:Chris\, Torin\, Robbie\, Jesus w/ BEE 206-409-3240\n\n \n\nScop
	e:\n\nBEE will be on site @ 8am to begin setting up. The GC will have the 
	building empty @ 12 noon.\n\n \n\nThings that need to finished:\n\n*	Curta
	in Wall needs to be complete.\n*	Hollow metal door needs to be installed w
	ith hardware.\n*	P1 & P2 elevator vestibules ( if they aren’t finished\,
	 we will tape the doors shut as discussed).\n*	There is a shaft running up
	 the building next to the elevator that is incomplete. If not complete we 
	will except a temporary finish if put in place by the general contractor. 
	\n*	L1 fire rated window installed. \n*	Missing cladding in multiple areas
	. If the cladding isn’t in place. we will need the fir stripping on to h
	old the paper down at the very least.\n*	All storefront and storefront doo
	rs installed and operable with locking mechanism.\n*	BEE will be issuing a
	dditional contact to Compass for the pretest prep.\n*	Trash shoot room nee
	d to be finished. \n\n \n\nOn site contact:\n\nJoe Bennett​\n\nAssistant
	 Superintendent\n\nCell: 425.923.3814 <tel:425.923.3814> \n\n11332 NE 122n
	d Way Ste. 350\n\n\, \n\nKirkland\, WA\n\n \n\n98034\n\njoe.bennett@compas
	s-gc.com <mailto:joe.bennett@compass-gc.com> \n\n | \n\nwww.compass-gc.com
	 <http://www.compass-gc.com/> \n\n | \n\n <https://www.linkedin.com/compan
	y/compass-general-construction/> \n\n <https://www.instagram.com/compassgc
	/> \n\n <https://www.facebook.com/compassgc/> \n\n \n\n \n\n
