	2 noon.</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in"><s
	pan style="font-size:10.5pt">Locate any louvers and or dampers that are no
	t closed or covered.\n</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="marg
	in-left:0in"><span style="font-size:10.5pt">Power – Adequate power to be
	 placed @ selected L1 entry doors associated with fan placement.\n</span><
	/li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in"><span style="font
	-size:10.5pt">Cargo elevator available for use.</span></li></ul>\n<p class
	="MsoNormal"><b><u><span style="font-size:10.5pt">BEE responsibility</span
	></u></b></p>\n<ul type="disc" style="margin-top:0in">\n<li class="MsoList
	Paragraph" style="margin-left:0in"><span style="font-size:10.5pt">Arrive o
	n site @ 7am to begin set up.</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" styl
	e="margin-left:0in"><span style="font-size:10.5pt">Prop all stair well doo
	rs open.</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in"><
	span style="font-size:10.5pt">Isolate any louvers and or dampers that are 
	not closed or covered.</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="marg
	in-left:0in"><span style="font-size:10.5pt">Begin testing @ 12 noon.</span
	></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in"><span style="fo
	nt-size:10.5pt">Finish testing no later than 2pm</span></li><li class="Mso
	ListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in"><span style="font-size:10.5pt">Pack
	 up equipment and get off site.</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" st
	yle="margin-left:0in"><span style="font-size:10.5pt">Fast turnaround on te
	st report or email of preliminary test results the day after the test.</sp
	an></li></ul>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><b><u><span style="font-size:10.5pt">F
	an Placement </span></u></b></p>\n<ul type="disc" style="margin-top:0in">\
	n<li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in"><span style="font-si
	ze:10.5pt">6 bank of fans in L1 loading dock double doors-\n<i><u>two temp
	 power boxes needed</u></i>.</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style
	="margin-left:0in"><span style="font-size:10.5pt">6 bank of fans in L1 lob
	by double doors -\n<i><u>two temp power boxes needed</u></i>.</span></li><
	li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in"><span style="font-size
	:10.5pt">3 bank of fans in L1 Stairwell B exterior door –<i><u> one temp
	 power boxes needed</u></i>.</span></li></ul>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span 
	style="font-size:10.5pt">&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span st
	yle="font-size:10.5pt\; background:yellow">Pass fail Criteria will be .25 
	cfms per square foot @ 75pa.</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt"></span><
	/p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.5pt">&nbsp\;</span></p
	>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.5pt">On site contact:</s
	pan></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><b>Greg Doughty</b>\, Assistant Superintend
	ent </p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">Sellen Construction <b><span style="color:#
	A1CD3A">//</span></b>\n<b>C</b> 206.450.1030</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><sp
	an style="font-size:10.5pt">&nbsp\;</span></p>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n
