	></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">Team\,<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">&n
	bsp\;<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">Per our pretest meeting last we
	ek. We will keep the current schedule of 11/29 &amp\; 11/30. The plan is t
	o isolate the building on the 29<sup>th</sup> and test on the 30<sup>th</s
	up>. On the test day BEE will arrive on site @ 7am to begin setting\n up. 
	We will be ready to test @ 2pm &nbsp\;the GC will need to have the buildin
	g empty @ 12 noon.\n<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp\;<o:p></o:
	p></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">BEE will be taking the responsibility of the 
	pretest prep\; the general contractor has agreed to remove the isolation m
	aterial after the test is finished.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">&
	nbsp\;<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">The retail portion of the buil
	ding will be done separately as ( Zone #2) due to lack of communication wi
	th the building. I will send out the calendar invitation shortly.<o:p></o:
	p></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp\;<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">
