CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20231212T230317Z
DESCRIPTION:Hello BEE\,\n\nOn December 1st\, BEE is hosting two workshops f
	or the company\, one in the morning and one in the afternoon.\n\n \n\nThe 
	Morning workshop is mandatory for all BEE Employees to attend. (9am to 1pm
	)\n\n \n\nThe Afternoon workshop is mandatory for Principals\, Operation M
	anager and Portland Branch Manager. (1:30pm-5pm)\n\n*	Whoever else would l
	ike to attend the afternoon workshop\, is more than welcome to.\n\n \n\nTh
	e morning workshop will be learning a practice called “The Triad” that
	 was developed by Tony Robbins.  \n\nThis practice is geared to strengthen
	 your mental and emotional state. From moment to moment\, how you interpre
	t situations and respond\, are affected by the state you’re in. By under
	standing the states you use on a consistent basis — both those that dise
	mpower you as well as those that support you in being your best — you ca
	n consciously direct your psychology and mindset to move toward what it is
	 you want most. \n\n*	Here is a video from a Ted Talk by Tony Robbins that
	 dives into this concept: https://www.ted.com/talks/tony_robbins_why_we_do
	_what_we_do?language=en <https://www.ted.com/talks/tony_robbins_why_we_do_
	what_we_do?language=en> \n\n \n\nThe afternoon workshop will cover Tony Ro
	bbins’ structure on the 7 Forces of business.\n\nHere is a video of Tony
	 Robbins discussing the 7 Forces of Business: https://core.tonyrobbins.com
	/BRT7Forces <https://core.tonyrobbins.com/BRT7Forces> \n\n \n\n \n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20231201T170000
