	\n<o:shapedefaults v:ext="edit" spidmax="1026" />\n</xml><![endif]--><!--[
	if gte mso 9]><xml>\n<o:shapelayout v:ext="edit">\n<o:idmap v:ext="edit" d
	ata="1" />\n</o:shapelayout></xml><![endif]--></head><body lang="EN-US" li
	nk="#0563C1" vlink="#954F72" style="word-wrap:break-word"><div class="Word
	Section1"><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt">Hello BEE\,<
	o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt">O
	n December 1<sup>st</sup>\, BEE is hosting two workshops for the company\,
	 one in the morning and one in the afternoon.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p clas
	s="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p>
	<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:14.0pt">The Morning worksho
	p is mandatory for all BEE Employees to attend. (9am to 1pm)<o:p></o:p></s
	pan></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp
	\;</o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:14.0pt">
	The Afternoon workshop is mandatory for Principals\, Operation Manager and
	 Portland Branch Manager. (1:30pm-5pm)<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><ul style=
	"margin-top:0in" type="disc"><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-le
	ft:-15.0pt\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:14.0pt">Whoeve
	r else would like to attend the afternoon workshop\, is more than welcome 
	to.<o:p></o:p></span></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size
	:14.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><u><span style=
	"font-size:16.0pt">The morning workshop will be learning a practice called
	 &#8220\;The Triad&#8221\; that was developed by Tony Robbins.&nbsp\; <o:p
	></o:p></span></u></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt">
	This practice is geared to strengthen your mental and emotional state. Fro
	m moment to moment\, how you interpret situations and respond\, are affect
	ed by the state you&#8217\;re in. By understanding the states you use on a
	 consistent basis &#8212\; both those that disempower you as well as those
	 that support you in being your best &#8212\; you can consciously direct y
	our psychology and mindset to move toward what it is you want most. <o:p><
	/o:p></span></p><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc"><li class="MsoListP
	aragraph" style="margin-left:-15.0pt\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><b><span st
	yle="font-size:14.0pt">Here is a video from a Ted Talk by Tony Robbins tha
	t dives into this concept</span></b><span style="font-size:14.0pt">:</span
	><span style="font-size:12.0pt\;color:black\;mso-ligatures:none"> <a href=
	"https://www.ted.com/talks/tony_robbins_why_we_do_what_we_do?language=en">
	<span style="color:blue">https://www.ted.com/talks/tony_robbins_why_we_do_
	what_we_do?language=en</span></a></span><span style="font-size:14.0pt"><o:
	p></o:p></span></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0p
	t"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><u><span style="font-
	size:16.0pt">The afternoon workshop will cover Tony Robbins&#8217\; struct
	ure on the 7 Forces of business.<o:p></o:p></span></u></p><p class="MsoNor
	mal"><b><span style="font-size:14.0pt">Here is a video of Tony Robbins dis
	cussing the 7 Forces of Business</span></b><span style="font-size:14.0pt">
	: </span><span style="font-size:12.0pt\;color:black\;mso-ligatures:none"><
	a href="https://core.tonyrobbins.com/BRT7Forces"><span style="color:blue">
	https://core.tonyrobbins.com/BRT7Forces</span></a><o:p></o:p></span></p><p
	 class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt\;color:black\;mso-ligatur
	es:none"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o
	:p></p></div></body></html>
