DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin & Jesus\n\n \n\nScope- Retest failed window lo
	cation plus three additional locations & failed sliding glass door plus th
	ree additional locations. Additional locations to be selected by the GC\, 
	they should have no cladding if possible\, have interior air barrier seala
	nt installed\, head flashings in place\, and no drywall installed on the i
	nterior around the opening.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 6.0 PSF\, if the slidin
	g glass doors cannot pass 6.0 PSF reduce to 4.5 and record results.\n\n \n
	\nOn site contact: \n\nMARK CARTON\n\nProject Superintendent\n\ne: mcarton
	@therushcompanies.com <mailto:mcarton@therushcompanies.com> \n\no: (253) 8
	58-3636 / c: (206) 465-3421\n\n \n\n
