DESCRIPTION:Torin\, Chris Robbie & Jesus W/ BEE 2006-409-3240\n\n \n\nTeam\
	,\n\n \n\nPer our pretest meeting last week. We will keep the current sche
	dule of 11/29 & 11/30. The plan is to isolate the building on the 29th and
	 test on the 30th. On the test day BEE will arrive on site @ 7am to begin 
	setting up. We will be ready to test @ 2pm the GC will need to have the bu
	ilding empty @ 12 noon. \n\n \n\nBEE will be taking the responsibility of 
	the pretest prep\; the general contractor has agreed to remove the isolati
	on material after the test is finished.\n\n \n\nThe retail portion of the 
	building will be done separately as ( Zone #2) due to lack of communicatio
	n with the building. I will send out the calendar invitation shortly.\n\n 
	\n\nOn site contact:\n\nShawn Milligan\n\nSr. Project Manager\n\nGenCap Co
	nstruction Corp.\n\n			\n\n425-949-9801\n\n\n\nshawnm@gencapgc.com <mailto
	:shawnm@gencapgc.com> \n\n\n\ngencapgc.com <https://nam12.safelinks.protec
	tion.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgencapgc.com%2F&data=05%7C01%7Cshawnm%
	40gencapgc.com%7Ce4c9f68cd0f0475bc4f508dbe0aaf09d%7C76e5026673554b6faf7e68
	02db413756%7C0%7C0%7C638350797042959774%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC
	4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&s
	data=Ayef%2BUWZFoCqvU0cMkdMf%2F%2FfO8tzp1ozh0DdLlZuJBM%3D&reserved=0> \n\n
	\n\n5808 Lake Washington Blvd NE\, Suite 203\n\nKirkland\, WA 98033\n\n \n
	\n
