CREATED:20231212T230459Z
DESCRIPTION:Chris\, Torin\, Robbie\, Jesus W/ BEE 425-599-8766\n\n \n\nAt t
	he pretest meeting we discussed the following:\n\n*	All exterior doors mus
	t be in with operating hardware.\n*	Check air barrier sealant at bottom pl
	ate fix any voids in the sealant \n*	Complete the sealing up of all pipe a
	nd electrical penetrations.\n*	Complete the sealant around the perimeter o
	f the louvers.\n*	HVAC off the day of the test and all electronic dampers 
	in the closed position\n*	6 fans will be placed in the elevator lobby doub
	le doors.\n*	BEE will mask off all accessible ventilation including the ro
	of return air louvers.\n\n \n\nOn the test day BEE will arrive on site @ 8
	am to begin the pretest prep and set up the test equipment. That test will
	 begin @ 12 NOON.\n\nThe building will need to empty for one hour to compl
	ete the test. No one in or out. \n\n \n\nOn site contact:\n\n \n\nThe on-s
	ite contact is Andy Schwartz 214-931-9924 aschwartz@arcomurray.com <mailto
	:aschwartz@arcomurray.com> \n\n \n\nMatt Brewer\n\nProject Manager\n\nARCO
	/Murray\n\n972-816-8074\n\nwww.arcomurray.com <http://www.arcomurray.com/>
	 \n\n \n\n
