	aph style='margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3'><span style='font-siz
	e:12.0pt\;font-family:"Arial"\,sans-serif'>Complete the sealing up of all 
	pipe and electrical penetrations.</span><o:p></o:p></li><li class=MsoListP
	aragraph style='margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3'><span style='fon
	t-size:12.0pt\;font-family:"Arial"\,sans-serif'>Complete the sealant aroun
	d the perimeter of the louvers.</span><o:p></o:p></li><li class=MsoListPar
	agraph style='margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3'><span style='font-
	size:12.0pt\;font-family:"Arial"\,sans-serif'>HVAC off the day of the test
	 and all electronic dampers in the closed position</span><o:p></o:p></li><
	li class=MsoListParagraph style='margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3'
	><span style='font-size:12.0pt\;font-family:"Arial"\,sans-serif'>6 fans wi
	ll be placed in the elevator lobby double doors.</span><o:p></o:p></li><li
	 class=MsoListParagraph style='margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3'><
	span style='font-size:12.0pt\;font-family:"Arial"\,sans-serif'>BEE will ma
	sk off all accessible ventilation including the roof return air louvers.</
	span><o:p></o:p></li></ul><p class=MsoListParagraph>&nbsp\;<o:p></o:p></p>
	<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt\;font-family:"Arial"\,san
	s-serif'>On the test day BEE will arrive on site @ 8am to begin the pretes
	t prep and set up the test equipment. That test will begin @ 12 NOON.</spa
	n><o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt\;font-fa
	mily:"Arial"\,sans-serif'>The building will need to empty for one hour to 
	complete the test. No one in or out. </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNor
	mal><span style='font-size:12.0pt\;font-family:"Arial"\,sans-serif'>&nbsp\
	;</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt\;f
