	e- Air barrier testing Phase 2\, Building to be cleared of all personnel b
	y 12pm. noon Testing completed by 2:30pm.\n\n \n\nContractor responsibilit
	y:\n\n*	Complete all exterior door hardware.\n*	Complete exterior glass in
	 elevator vestibule.\n*	Complete all missing storefront glass.\n*	Make sur
	e all doors & hollow metal doors leading to the exterior and or parking ga
	rage are installed. \n*	Have the HVAC shut off and all electronic louvers 
	in the closed position the day of the test. 10/5\n*	Have the building empt
	y of all personal by 12 noon. the test will begin @ 12\n\n \n\nBEE respons
	ibility:\n\n*	Bee will be providing the pretest prep. It will be done on 1
	0/3 & 10/4\n*	On site @ 7am\n*	Set up equipment.\n*	Fan placement will be 
	in both courtyard doors and north stair well entry this is a 9-fan test.\n
	*	Test ready by 12 noon\n*	BEE will complete the removal of the isolation 
	material when the test is complete. \n\n \n\n*	 \n\n \n\nContact- \n\nOn s
	ite contact:\n\nMatt Sinkula\n\nSenior Project Manager\n\n \n\nW.G. CLARK 
