	 of each operator type minimum 5 locations.\n\n \n\n(#1) The below windows
	 located at the Southeast corner of L4 building C will be water tested on 
	Thursday 9/14. NWEC will install head flashings / ensure proper Tyvek wrap
	ping\, and NW Insulation will install the backer rod and caulk. As discuss
	ed\, the hose bib is located at the East – along 1st Ave North. (5) wind
	ows will be included in this test. \n\n \n\n                          \n\n
