CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20231212T230502Z
DESCRIPTION:Rob Donkey & Nate\n\nGood Morning WGA 2023 Golf Captains and pl
	ayers\,\n\n \n\nAre you ready for a great day of golf?  It is the perfect 
	work week with the holiday on Monday and golf on Friday!  \n\n \n\nWe sold
	 out again this year with 160 registered golfers.  Rick Koeller\, Oldcastl
	e Building Envelope\, Golf Tournament Chair\, the WGA Golf Committee and B
	oard thank you for supporting the Washington Glass Association 38th Annual
	 Golf Tournament by entering the tournament and by sponsoring. Thank you t
	o our 86 Hole Sponsors and Designated Sponsors.  \n\nHere is everything yo
	u need to know to be “game face ready” on Friday. Be sure everyone on 
	your team gets this information as I did not receive email addresses for e
	very golfer.  \n\n*	The tournament will be held at Twin Lakes Golf & Count
	ry Club in Federal Way\, WA this Friday\, September 8\, 2023.\n*	Registrat
	ion begins at 10:00 am. \n*	Lunch begins at 10:15 am.\n*	Shot gun start at
	 noon.\n*	Outdoor Awards Dinner Banquet follows play.\n*	Bring cash to pur
	chase mulligans and to donate at the hole-in-one.  100% of the donations c
	ollected fund the 2024 WGA Golf Tournament Scholarship.\n\nWhen you arrive
	\, check-in at the registration table. You will receive the following:\n\n
	*	Your starting hole number.  Use this number to locate your golf cart. \n
	*	Two complimentary beverage tickets for a beer\, pop\, or water.\n*	Your 
	lunch and awards dinner ticket.\n*	Munch bag for each golfer sponsored by 
	Bryce Given\, Chris Fronsoe and Jim Waites with Vitro Architectural Glass.
	  \n*	Golf balls sponsored by Kawneer/Bud Henson and Nolan Ernotte\, Windo
	w Tech.\, Inc.\, and Autumn Busick\, Vetrotech Saint-Gobain.\n\nSome impor
	tant reminders:\n\n*	Twin Lakes Golf & Country Club have a dress code.  Pl
	ease see attached. \n*	No alcohol to be brought on the course that is not 
	purchased from the course.  Think ahead and plan for a designated driver. 
	\n*	We will be awarding most door prizes prior to the shot gun start.  Arr
	ive early for the best chance to win.  If donating door prize swag\, pleas
	e bring it to the door prize table. \n*	Return your score cards in a timel
	y manner to the Pro Shop following play. \n\nThank you to Rick Koeller\, B
	ryan Blume\, and Steve Dow with Oldcastle Building Envelope – Fife for s
	ponsoring official team photos.\n\nThank you to Brad Rains with Design9/Pu
	lp Studios for sponsoring Low Gross Trophies.\n\nThank you to Pat Zollars\
	, Hartung Glass Industries and Scott Steckler\, Solar Art Window Film & Gr
	aphics for sponsoring the two beverage carts this year. \n\nFinally\, any 
	golfer changes can be made the day of the tournament at the registration t
	able.  \n\n \n\nI look forward to a great day of golf and meeting you all!
	 See you on the green! \n\n \n\nShirley Walsh\n\nWashington Glass Associat
	ion\n\n1733 H Street\, Suite 450 – Box 246\n\nBlaine\, WA 98230\n\n206.4
	59.4029\n\nshirley.walsh@wg-a.org <mailto:shirley.walsh@wg-a.org> \n\nwww.
	wg-a.org <https://linkprotect.cudasvc.com/url?a=http%3a%2f%2fwww.wg-a.org%
	2f&c=E\,1\,ytX_49y8lI_qwFStvb8_2XZywFd5vfGQ30AhAKOAN9K8HKUO14JVNHOvisLhYJD
	xgfztqttCJxqZ5K_t6-43DIJWkWQnoNUF5GVB_ZV74UmV&typo=1> \n\n\n\n \n\n_______
	_________________________________________________________________________ 
	\n\nMicrosoft Teams meeting \n\nJoin on your computer\, mobile app or room
	 device \n\nClick here to join the meeting <https://teams.microsoft.com/l/
	meetup-join/19%3ameeting_NTM4Njg0YmItMGJlNS00NDk0LWExNjktM2U2MDhlODQ2NDQ1%
	40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%22819874e4-0ad2-4c6a-8b1c-0f3bbb31b6
	da%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%2245a73a81-cffa-4994-96b9-81ca01567e10%22%7d>  \n\nMe
	eting ID: 246 664 219 245 \nPasscode: z4R7qh \n\nDownload Teams <https://w
	ww.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-teams/download-app>  | Join on the web <h
	ttps://www.microsoft.com/microsoft-teams/join-a-meeting> \n\nOr call in (a
	udio only) \n\n+1 323-694-9885\,\,827059236# <tel:+13236949885\,\,82705923
	6#>    United States\, Los Angeles \n\nPhone Conference ID: 827 059 236# \
	n\nFind a local number <https://dialin.teams.microsoft.com/fbc8ed71-2cf6-4
	abc-985b-858f4254827f?id=827059236>  | Reset PIN <https://dialin.teams.mic
	rosoft.com/usp/pstnconferencing>  \n\nLearn More <https://aka.ms/JoinTeams
	Meeting>  | Meeting options <https://teams.microsoft.com/meetingOptions/?o
	rganizerId=45a73a81-cffa-4994-96b9-81ca01567e10&tenantId=819874e4-0ad2-4c6
	a-8b1c-0f3bbb31b6da&threadId=19_meeting_NTM4Njg0YmItMGJlNS00NDk0LWExNjktM2
	U2MDhlODQ2NDQ1@thread.v2&messageId=0&language=en-US>  \n\n________________
	________________________________________________________________ \n\n \n\n
