	]--><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml>\n<o:shapelayout v:ext="edit">\n<o:idmap v:ext
	="edit" data="1" />\n</o:shapelayout></xml><![endif]--></head><body lang=E
	N-US link="#0563C1" vlink="#954F72" style='word-wrap:break-word'><div clas
	s=WordSection1><div><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt\;font
	-family:"Arial"\,sans-serif'>Rob Donkey &amp\; Nate</span><o:p></o:p></p><
	p class=MsoNormal>Good Morning WGA 2023 Golf Captains and players\,<o:p></
	o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp\;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal>Are yo
	u ready for a great day of golf?&nbsp\; It is the perfect work week with t
	he holiday on Monday and golf on Friday!&nbsp\; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=Ms
	oNormal>&nbsp\;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:12.0
	pt'>We sold out again this year with 160 registered golfers.&nbsp\; Rick K
	oeller\, Oldcastle Building Envelope\, Golf Tournament Chair\, the WGA Gol
	f Committee and Board thank you for supporting the Washington Glass Associ
	ation 38<sup>th</sup> Annual Golf Tournament by entering the tournament an
	d by sponsoring. Thank you to our 86 Hole Sponsors and Designated Sponsors
	.&nbsp\; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:12.0pt'>He
	re is everything you need to know to be “game face ready” on Friday. <
	b>Be sure everyone on your team gets this information as I did not receive
	 email addresses for every golfer.&nbsp\; </b><o:p></o:p></p><ul style='ma
	rgin-top:0in' type=disc><li class=MsoListParagraph style='margin-left:0in\
	;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo3'>The tournament will be held at Twin Lakes Golf &
	amp\; Country Club in Federal Way\, WA this Friday\, September 8\, 2023.<o
	:p></o:p></li><li class=MsoListParagraph style='margin-left:0in\;mso-list:
	l5 level1 lfo3'>Registration begins at 10:00 am. <o:p></o:p></li><li class
	=MsoListParagraph style='margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo3'>Lunch b
	egins at 10:15 am.<o:p></o:p></li><li class=MsoListParagraph style='margin
	-left:0in\;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo3'>Shot gun start at noon.<o:p></o:p></li
	><li class=MsoListParagraph style='margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo
	3'>Outdoor Awards Dinner Banquet follows play.<o:p></o:p></li><li class=Ms
	oListParagraph style='margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo3'>Bring cash
	 to purchase mulligans and to donate at the hole-in-one.&nbsp\; 100% of th
	e donations collected fund the 2024 WGA Golf Tournament Scholarship.<o:p><
	/o:p></li></ul><p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:12.0pt'>When you ar
	rive\, check-in at the registration table. You will receive the following:
	<o:p></o:p></p><ul style='margin-top:0in' type=disc><li class=MsoListParag
	raph style='margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo6'>Your starting hole n
	umber.&nbsp\; Use this number to locate your golf cart. <o:p></o:p></li><l
	i class=MsoListParagraph style='margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo6'>
	Two complimentary beverage tickets for a beer\, pop\, or water.<o:p></o:p>
	</li><li class=MsoListParagraph style='margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l3 level1
	 lfo6'>Your lunch and awards dinner ticket.<o:p></o:p></li><li class=MsoLi
	stParagraph style='margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo6'>Munch bag for
	 each golfer sponsored by Bryce Given\, Chris Fronsoe and Jim Waites with 
	Vitro Architectural Glass.&nbsp\; <o:p></o:p></li><li class=MsoListParagra
	ph style='margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo6'>Golf balls sponsored b
	y Kawneer/Bud Henson and Nolan Ernotte\, Window Tech.\, Inc.\, and Autumn 
	Busick\, Vetrotech Saint-Gobain.<o:p></o:p></li></ul><p class=MsoNormal st
	yle='margin-bottom:12.0pt'>Some important reminders:<o:p></o:p></p><ul sty
	le='margin-top:0in' type=disc><li class=MsoListParagraph style='margin-lef
	t:0in\;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo9'>Twin Lakes Golf &amp\; Country Club have a
	 dress code.&nbsp\; Please see attached. <o:p></o:p></li><li class=MsoList
	Paragraph style='margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo9'>No alcohol to b
	e brought on the course that is not purchased from the course.&nbsp\; Thin
	k ahead and plan for a designated driver. <o:p></o:p></li><li class=MsoLis
	tParagraph style='margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo9'>We will be awa
	rding most door prizes prior to the shot gun start.&nbsp\; Arrive early fo
	r the best chance to win.&nbsp\; If donating door prize swag\, please brin
	g it to the door prize table. <o:p></o:p></li><li class=MsoListParagraph s
	tyle='margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo9'>Return your score cards in
	 a timely manner to the Pro Shop following play. <o:p></o:p></li></ul><p c
	lass=MsoNormal>Thank you to Rick Koeller\, Bryan Blume\, and Steve Dow wit
	h Oldcastle Building Envelope – Fife for sponsoring official team photos
	.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:12.0pt'>Thank you 
	to Brad Rains with Design9/Pulp Studios for sponsoring Low Gross Trophies.
	<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:12.0pt'>Thank you t
	o Pat Zollars\, Hartung Glass Industries and Scott Steckler\, Solar Art Wi
	ndow Film &amp\; Graphics for sponsoring the two beverage carts this year.
	 <o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><b>Finally\, any golfer changes can be 
	made the day of the tournament at the registration table.</b>&nbsp\; <o:p>
	</o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp\;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal>I lo
	ok forward to a great day of golf and meeting you all! See you on the gree
	n! <o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp\;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNor
	mal><span style='font-size:16.0pt\;font-family:"Script MT Bold"'>Shirley W
	alsh</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt
	'>Washington Glass Association</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><sp
	an style='font-size:12.0pt'>1733 H Street\, Suite 450 – Box 246</span><o
	:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt'>Blaine\, WA
	 98230</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0
	pt'>206.459.4029</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><a href="mailto:s
	hirley.walsh@wg-a.org">shirley.walsh@wg-a.org</a><o:p></o:p></p><p class=M
	soNormal><a href="https://linkprotect.cudasvc.com/url?a=http%3a%2f%2fwww.w
	g-a.org%2f&amp\;c=E\,1\,ytX_49y8lI_qwFStvb8_2XZywFd5vfGQ30AhAKOAN9K8HKUO14
	JVNHOvisLhYJDxgfztqttCJxqZ5K_t6-43DIJWkWQnoNUF5GVB_ZV74UmV&amp\;typo=1">ww
	w.wg-a.org</a><o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='color:#2114EB
