	 NE elevation:\n\n*	Sliding Glass door\n*	Fixed\n*	X/O Casement \n*	OX/XX 
	Horizontal slider\n*	XOX/OOO double horizontal slider\n\n \n\nContractor r
	esponsibility:\n\n*	Finnish exterior primary weather proofing\n*	SAM on Ja
	mbs\n*	Head Flashing\n*	Interior air barrier sealant \n*	Invite the window
	 rep to test.\n\n \n\nNote:  \n\n*	The water source is mid-way on the BLDG
	 North Elevation \n*	The access is scaffolding.\n*	BEE has agreed to isola
	te the L1 to L2 transition under the window w/ Vis queen   \n\n \n\n \n\nO
	nsite Contact- Eric Cyzner 908-208-2650\n\n \n\n
