CREATED:20231212T230505Z
DESCRIPTION:Robbie & Jesus w/ BEE 425-344-6997 \n\n \n\nScope:\n\n5 window 
	products:\n\n*	One large tilt turn - 201\n*	Picture window - 201\n*	Narrow
	 tilt turn - 201\n*	5’ by 5’ tilt turn – 223\n*	Sliding Glass Door -
	 TBD\n*	BEE will be test ready @ 10am\n\n \n\n \n\n*	The head flashing nee
	ds to be installed above all locations.\n*	WRB installed around all locati
	ons.\n*	Windows and doors need weep covers installed.\n*	The interior air 
	barrier sealant needs to be in place around all test locations. \n*	The GC
	 will invite the window representative. \n*	The window test protocol is at
	tached.\n\n \n\nOn site contact:\n\nCharles Landert @ 360-572-7427\n\n
