DESCRIPTION:Robbie & Torin w/ BEE 425-344-6997 \n\n \n\nOrientation at 7:15
	 at Job Office located at 8151 164th Ave NE Redmond WA\n\n \n\nEquipment h
	as to be dropped off at the loading zone and parking will be at the office
	 off-site\n\n \n\nScope: As many windows as you can do in 8 hours onsite i
	ncluding the below windows. If it appears a selected location is not ready
	 confer with Denin.\n\n \n\n5 window products:\n\n*	Sliding glass door\n*	
	Picture window\n*	3 casement configurations\n*	BEE will be test ready @ 10
	am\n\n \n\nWindows are in units - 214\, 219\, 314. \n\n*	The head flashing
	 needs to be installed above the sliding glass door.\n*	The interior air b
	arrier sealant needs to be in place around all test locations. \n*	The GC 
	will invite the window representative. \n*	The window test protocol is att
	ached.\n\n \n\nOn site contact: \n\nMARK CARTON\n\nProject Superintendent\
	n\ne: mcarton@therushcompanies.com <mailto:mcarton@therushcompanies.com> \
	n\no: (253) 858-3636 / c: (206) 465-3421\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n
