	on that you are going to need window testing performed soon for the Redmon
	d Sunrise project. Please let me know when you would like to have the test
	ing performed\, we do a pretest walk prior to the testing date to select l
	ocations\, ensure they are ready\, we have adequate access\, and discuss t
	he requirements of the test. It is also highly recommended to invite a win
	dow manufacturer’s representative to the testing so they can witness the
	 test and make any necessary remediation in the case of a product failure.
	\n\n \n\nRegards\,\n\n \n\n <https://bee-engineers.com/> \n\nChris Shafer\
	, FAPC\n\nTesting Supervisor\nD: 425 678-1728 | C: 425 599-8766 | O: 425 6
