	ies.com</a>&gt\;\;\n Mitch Hawver &lt\;<a href="mailto:mhawver@therushcomp
	anies.com">mhawver@therushcompanies.com</a>&gt\;<br>\n<b>Cc:</b> Kip Johns
	on &lt\;<a href="mailto:Kip@bee-engineers.com">Kip@bee-engineers.com</a>&g
	t\;\; Denin Dazey &lt\;<a href="mailto:Denin@bee-engineers.com">Denin@bee-
	engineers.com</a>&gt\;\; Nate Van Voorst &lt\;<a href="mailto:Nate@bee-eng
	ineers.com">Nate@bee-engineers.com</a>&gt\;<br>\n<b>Subject:</b> Redmond S
	unrise Window Testing<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class="Mso
	Normal"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-siz
	e:10.5pt">Rush Team\,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span st
	yle="font-size:10.5pt"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"
	><span style="font-size:10.5pt">It has been brought to my attention that y
	ou are going to need window testing performed soon for the Redmond Sunrise
	 project. Please let me know when you would like to have the testing perfo
	rmed\, we do a pretest\n walk prior to the testing date to select location
	s\, ensure they are ready\, we have adequate access\, and discuss the requ
	irements of the test. It is also highly recommended to invite a window man
	ufacturer’s representative to the testing so they can witness\n the test
	 and make any necessary remediation in the case of a product failure.<o:p>
	</o:p></span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><o:
	p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10
	.5pt">Regards\,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style
	="font-size:10.0pt\;color:black"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></b></p>\n<table
	 class="MsoNormalTable" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="
