CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20231212T230331Z
DESCRIPTION:Hello Everyone\, \n\nI’ve attached the official invitation to
	 this event\, so take a look.  Our theme this year is Movie Night! \n\nDre
	ss up as a character from your favorite movie\, or in the theme of a movie
	\, or just pretend it’s Oscar Night and wear your fancy threads!!! (No p
	ressure\, of course.)\n\n \n\nYou and a guest are invited to come\, and if
	 you haven’t already\, PLEASE reply to the invitation for me.\n\n \n\nSe
	condly\, here is how to play the White Elephant game for those of you who 
	have never played and/or need a refresher course...\n\n \n\nFor many years
	 at the BEE Holiday party we have played the “White Elephant” gift exc
	hange game. Here is how BEE does it:\n\n  \n\n*	You buy a gift that costs 
	any amount up to\, but no more than $30\, and wrap it with no name on it.\
	n\nor\n\n*	You can re-gift something that was given to you!!!\n\n \n\nIn t
	he past we’ve seen some really funny joke gifts\, some nice gifts\, and 
	everything in between.\n\n \n\nJust have fun with it people…it’s all a
	bout having fun and no expectations of grandeur!\n\n \n\nBring your gift t
	o the holiday party with you and after we eat\, we will play the game.  (B
	ecause of time constraints\, we need to stick to one gift per couple.)\n\n
	 \n\nEach person who is playing the game draws a number out of a hat and t
	hen we open the gifts starting with #1.  After whoever has the last number
	 turn has ended\, whatever person has #1 gets the chance to steal any gift
	 they want!\n\n \n\nWe do limit stealing of the any one gift to 3 times.  
	Please don’t feel obligated to take part but I’m telling you\, it’s 
	lots of fun!!!\n\n \n\nCheers!\n\n \n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20231208T220000
