	;}\n--></style><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml>\n<o:shapedefaults v:ext="edit" spi
	dmax="1026" />\n</xml><![endif]--><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml>\n<o:shapelayout
	 v:ext="edit">\n<o:idmap v:ext="edit" data="1" />\n</o:shapelayout></xml><
	![endif]--></head><body lang="EN-US" link="#0563C1" vlink="#954F72" style=
	"word-wrap:break-word"><div class="WordSection1"><p class="MsoNormal"><b><
	span style="font-size:14.0pt\;color:red\;mso-ligatures:none">Hello Everyon
	e\, <o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:
	14.0pt\;color:red\;mso-ligatures:none">I&#8217\;ve attached the official i
	nvitation to this event\, so take a look.&nbsp\; Our theme this year is <b
	>Movie Night!</b> <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span styl
	e="font-size:16.0pt\;color:red\;mso-ligatures:none">Dress up as a characte
	r from your favorite movie\, or in the theme of a movie\, or just pretend 
	it&#8217\;s Oscar Night and wear your fancy threads!!!</span></b><span sty
	le="font-size:16.0pt\;color:red\;mso-ligatures:none"> (</span><span style=
	"font-size:14.0pt\;color:red\;mso-ligatures:none">No pressure\, of course.
	)</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt\;color:red\;mso-ligatures:none"><o:p
	></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt\;colo
	r:red\;mso-ligatures:none"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNorma
	l"><span style="font-size:14.0pt\;color:red\;mso-ligatures:none">You and a
	 guest are invited to come\, and if you haven&#8217\;t already\, <u>PLEASE
	 reply to the invitation for me.</u><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNor
	mal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt\;mso-ligatures:none"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p>
	</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:14.0pt\;color:gr
	een\;mso-ligatures:none">Secondly\, here is how to play the White Elephant
	 game for those of you who have never played and/or need a refresher cours
	e...<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:
	14.0pt\;color:black\;mso-ligatures:none"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p c
	lass="MsoNormal"><u><span style="font-size:14.0pt\;color:black\;mso-ligatu
	res:none">For many years at the BEE Holiday party we have played the &#822
	0\;White Elephant&#8221\; gift exchange game. Here is how BEE does it:<o:p
	></o:p></span></u></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt\;
	color:black\;mso-ligatures:none">&nbsp\; <o:p></o:p></span></p><ul style="
	margin-top:0in" type="disc"><li class="MsoNormal" style="color:black\;mso-
	list:l2 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:14.0pt\;mso-ligatures:none">Yo
	u buy a gift that costs any amount up to\, but no more than <b>$30</b>\, a
	nd wrap it with <b><u>no name on it</u></b>.<o:p></o:p></span></li></ul><p
	 class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in"><u><span style="font-size:14.0
	pt\;color:black\;mso-ligatures:none">or<o:p></o:p></span></u></p><ul style
	="margin-top:0in" type="disc"><li class="MsoNormal" style="color:black\;ms
	o-list:l2 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:14.0pt\;mso-ligatures:none">
	You can re-gift something that was given to you!!!<o:p></o:p></span></li><
	/ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt\;color:black\;mso-l
	igatures:none"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span sty
	le="font-size:14.0pt\;color:black\;mso-ligatures:none">In the past we&#821
	7\;ve seen some really funny joke gifts\, some nice gifts\, and everything
	 in between.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-s
	ize:14.0pt\;color:black\;mso-ligatures:none"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p>
	<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:14.0pt\;color:black\;mso-li
	gatures:none">Just have fun with it people&#8230\;it&#8217\;s all about ha
	ving fun and no expectations of grandeur!<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p clas
	s="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt\;color:black\;mso-ligatures:no
	ne"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-si
	ze:14.0pt\;color:black\;mso-ligatures:none">Bring your gift to the holiday
	 party with you and after we eat\, we will play the game.&nbsp\; (<i>Becau
	se of time constraints\, we need to stick to one gift per couple.)</i><o:p
	></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt\;colo
	r:black\;mso-ligatures:none"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNor
	mal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt\;color:black\;mso-ligatures:none">Each 
	person who is playing the game draws a number out of a hat and then we ope
	n the gifts starting with #1.&nbsp\; After whoever has the last number tur
	n has ended\, whatever person has #1 gets the chance to steal any gift the
	y want!<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:1
	4.0pt\;color:black\;mso-ligatures:none"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p cl
	ass="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt\;color:black\;mso-ligatures:
	none">We do limit stealing of the any one gift to 3 times.&nbsp\; Please d
	on&#8217\;t feel obligated to take part but I&#8217\;m telling you\, it&#8
	217\;s lots of fun!!!<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span styl
	e="font-size:14.0pt\;color:black\;mso-ligatures:none"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></
	span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt\;color:red\;ms
	o-ligatures:none">Cheers!<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&
	nbsp\;</o:p></p></div></body></html>
