	\n\nBEE will be on site @ 7am to set up equipment. The test will begin @ n
	oon.\n\n \n\nContractor responsibility:\n\n*	HVAC shut Off\n*	Electronic d
	ampers in the closed position\n*	Empty the building @ noon for one hour.\n
	*	Let us know about anything that is or will not shut either manually or e
	lectronically and we will mask it off.\n\n \n\nOn site contact:\n\nGerard 
	Boulanger  |  Project Manager \n\nC: 206.484.4136  |  O: 425.481.7460  |  
	GerardB@CornerstoneGCI.com <mailto:GerardB@CornerstoneGCI.com> \n\n\n <htt
	ps://cornerstonegci.com/> Cornerstone General Contractors\, Inc.\n\n11805 
