	________________________________________</span>\n<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class
	="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">Thank you for yo
	ur reply\, Nate. We’d like to review with BEE the project’s plan for W
