	f work and the plan. We do have the documents you’ve furnished pertainin
	g to pretest\n conditions and test procedure.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class="Ms
	oNormal"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">Considering current 
	work in place\, and plan for remaining work\, DPR anticipates completing w
	hole building air leakage testing August 7-8\, 2023. Our current path to e
	nclosure completion enables this\, though we also are requesting to put\n 
	a “hold” for potential testing August 14-15\, should it be required.<o
	:p></o:p></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p>\n<p class="MsoN
	ormal">We look forward to discussing with you then.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p cla
