	ilding is empty.\n*	The duration of the test will be up to 1.5 hours. \n\n
	 \n\nOn site contact:\n\nDaniel Behl\n\nDP Incorporated\n\nGeneral Contrac
	tors\n\n19936 Ballinger Way NE\n\nSeattle\, WA  98155\n\n(206) 743-4937 - 
