DESCRIPTION:Nate Torin Robbie & Chris w/ BEE 206-409-3240\n\n \n\nMeeting n
	otes:\n\nPer our pretest meeting on 4/18/23 the game plan is to prep every
	thing above the PT including the 8-unit corridor on phase 1 on 7/6/23. We 
	will test the BLDG. on 7/7/23 @ 12 noon the GC will need to empty the buil
	ding of all subs @ noon for a 1.5-hour duration.\n\n \n\n*	BEE will be res
	ponsible for all building pretest prep and removal. \n\n \n\n*	The GC will
	 need to have the HVAC off and all electronic Dampers in the closed positi
	on. \n\n \n\n*	The air barrier calculations & Boundaries will need to be r
	evised reflecting separate Zones for phase 1. \n\n \n\nOn site contact:\n\
	nMatt Sinkula\n\nSenior Project Manager\n\n \n\nW.G. CLARK CONSTRUCTION CO
	.  | P (206) 340-6665  C (206) 678-7875 | www.wgclark.com <http://www.wgcl
	ark.com/> \n\n \n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20230728T163000
