	v class="WordSection1">\n<div>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-siz
	e:12.0pt\;font-family:&quot\;Arial&quot\;\,sans-serif">Nate Torin Robbie &
	amp\; Chris w/ BEE 206-409-3240</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal
	"><span style="font-size:12.0pt\;font-family:&quot\;Arial&quot\;\,sans-ser
	if">&nbsp\;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-
	size:12.0pt\;font-family:&quot\;Arial&quot\;\,sans-serif">Meeting notes:</
	span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt\;
	font-family:&quot\;Arial&quot\;\,sans-serif">Per our pretest meeting on 4/
	18/23 the game plan is to prep everything above the PT including the 8-uni
	t corridor on phase 1 on 7/6/23. We will test the BLDG. on 7/7/23 @ 12\n n
	oon the GC will need to empty the building of all subs @ noon for a 1.5-ho
	ur duration.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font
	-size:12.0pt\;font-family:&quot\;Arial&quot\;\,sans-serif">&nbsp\;</span><
	o:p></o:p></p>\n<ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">\n<li class="MsoLis
	tParagraph" style="margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo3"><span style="
	font-size:12.0pt\;font-family:&quot\;Arial&quot\;\,sans-serif">BEE will be
	 responsible for all building pretest prep and removal.\n</span><o:p></o:p
	></li></ul>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt\;font-fami
	ly:&quot\;Arial&quot\;\,sans-serif">&nbsp\;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<ul sty
	le="margin-top:0in" type="disc">\n<li class="MsoListParagraph" style="marg
	in-left:0in\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo6"><span style="font-size:12.0pt\;font-
	family:&quot\;Arial&quot\;\,sans-serif">The GC will need to have the HVAC 
	off and all electronic Dampers in the closed position.\n</span><o:p></o:p>
	</li></ul>\n<p class="MsoListParagraph"><span style="font-size:12.0pt\;fon
	t-family:&quot\;Arial&quot\;\,sans-serif">&nbsp\;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<
	ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">\n<li class="MsoListParagraph" style
	="margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo9"><span style="font-size:12.0pt\
	;font-family:&quot\;Arial&quot\;\,sans-serif">The air barrier calculations
