CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20231212T230638Z
DESCRIPTION: Hi Nate\, thanks for talking with me today.\n\n \n\nThe slidin
	g door that I installed last summer is located at 10023 NE South Beach Dr\
	, Bainbridge Island\, WA.\n\n \n\nTo reiterate our conversation:\n\n \n\nT
	he customer has reported air leaks from the bottom left inside corner. The
	 door manufacturer has claimed that the leak is coming from under the door
	 and I suspect that the leak may be coming from between the door frame and
	 the fixed panel. This is a large slider with two fixed and two movable pa
	nels\, about 10' wide by about 8.5' tall. Please see the images and order 
	sheet for the door at this link <https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-
	mnXY7AV2IfHZ1KgxvonGqJepVKZaYiQ?usp=share_link>  for more information.\n\n
	 \n\nI'm interested in finding the air leak so that it can be properly add
	ressed\, the project closed\, and the customer satisfied. I am open to wha
	tever testing methods best determine this\, with preference to the least i
	nvasive methods first.\n\n \n\nI look forward to seeing your proposal and 
	potentially seeing you on site on April 7th\, 2023.\n\nThanks\,\n\n \n\nNi
	ck Duval\n\n203 535 7842\n\n \n\nNICKDDL851NG\n\n \n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20230331T150000
DTSTAMP:20230329T201028Z
DTSTART;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20230331T070000
