CREATED:20231212T230702Z
DESCRIPTION:Nate W/ BEE 206-409-3240\n\n \n\nScope:\n\nPretalk for window t
	esting \n\n \n\nLocations:\n\n \n\nExact water infiltration testing locati
	ons are still a bit open-ended. Please confirm the exact desired floors fo
	r testing so we can schedule BEE:\n\n*	North\n\n	*	CDC suggested levels 2\
	, 3\, or 4 for chamber testing. Level 2 would allow for the easiest and sa
	fest access. Is this acceptable?\n\n*	West\n\n	*	CDC suggested Levels 5\, 
	6\, 8\, or 9 for chamber testing. Level 5 would allow for the easiest and 
	safest access. Is this acceptable?\n\n*	East\n\n	*	CDC did not recommend a
	 level for chamber testing on this elevation. Level 4 would allow for the 
	easiest and safest access. Is this acceptable?\n\n*	SW Corner (2 tests her
	e requested)\n\n	*	On the lower levels\, CDC recommended testing levels 5 
	or 6. Level 5 would be easiest and safest to access\, is this acceptable f
	or testing the SW corner?\n	*	On the upper levels\, CDC recommended testin
	g levels 8 or 9. Access for both floors would be similar. Is testing Level
	 8 acceptable in the SW corner?\n\nContact:\n\nWilliam Jefferson | DPR Con
	struction\n1000 1st Ave S. Suite 400| Seattle\, WA |98134\n\nm: 206-638-64
	31\nWe Exist to Build Great Things.®\n\n \n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20230118T113000
