	2\,560.00\n\n \n\nSuvad did not bill- 1/4/24\, 1912-1011\, Shoreline 147th
	 Apts. WT Cancellation Fee = $1\,000.00\n\n \n\nBoth projects are active a
	nd will be added to the February Testing Prebilling Worksheet to be billed
	 in February.\n\n \n\n
