DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robbie & Jesus 425-344-6997\n\n \n\nScope- See attac
	hed.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 6.0 PSF\n\n \n\nNote- GC to invite window manu
	facturer to the testing. All test locations should have interior air barri
	er sealant in place\, head flashing installed\, and a completed field of W
	RB surrounding the test locations at least 6’ in all directions.\n\n \n\
	nContact-\n\nEvan Stewart |Sr. Project Engineer (He/Him)\nc: 206.724.3619 
	  \nestewart@ventureseattle.com <mailto:estewart@ventureseattle.com>  \n <
	http://www.ventureseattle.com/> \n1518 1st Ave S\, #400\, Seattle\, WA 981
	34\nVentureSeattle.com <http://www.ventureseattle.com/> \n\n
