	"#0563C1" vlink="#954F72" style='word-wrap:break-word'><div class=WordSect
	ion1><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>Billing Reconciliat
	ion as follows:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-
	size:10.5pt'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='
	font-size:10.5pt'>Original Prebilling Total = 89\,451.77<o:p></o:p></span>
	</p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>Adjusted Prebilling 
	Total = 80\, 871.14<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='f
	ont-size:10.5pt'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span sty
	le='font-size:10.5pt'>Tyler Smith- Total on prebilling sheet 15\,550.87\, 
	total billed 11\,350.00<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span styl
	e='font-size:10.5pt'>adjusted for items billed on March 1<sup>st</sup> or 
	billed incorrectly for February = 6\,850.00 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class
	=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>Billed 2108-1002 Traditions at H
	azel Wood Energy Star MFNC Performance Testing = 4\,500.00<o:p></o:p></spa
	n></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p>
	</span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>(Note) Billed
	 on March 1<sup>st</sup> tested in February SRM San Jose Assisted Living =
	 6\,000.00<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:
	10.5pt'>(Note) Billed on March 1<sup>st</sup> tested in February San Jose 
	Assisted Living Expenses +%20 = 2\,700.87<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=Ms
	oNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p cla
	ss=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>Chris Shafer- <o:p></o:p></spa
	n></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>adjusted for diffe
	rence in expenses = 14\,363.14<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><sp
	an style='font-size:10.5pt'>Billed salmonid conservation expense line 1\,6
	80.24 instead of 1\,500.00 as itemized expenses were requested from the cl
	ient.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5p
	t'>Total amount in prebilling worksheet was off by 30 dollars as well<o:p>
	</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p>&n
	bsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>Pa
	trick McMahon- <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-
	size:10.5pt'>adjusted for error = 5\,160.00<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=
