BEGIN:VEVENT
ATTENDEE;CN="Dave Luxmore";RSVP=TRUE:mailto:dluxmore@bee-engineers.com
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20240308T044600Z
DESCRIPTION:\n2024 Virtual Accredited Laboratories Annual Workshop\n\n\nPle
	ase make plans to attend the Annual Workshop of the AAMA Accredited Indepe
	ndent Laboratories on Tuesday\, March 26\, 2023\, from 11:00 am - 3:00 pm 
	ET via GoToMeeting. There is no registration fee for this workshop.\n\nThi
	s webinar fulfills the requirements of Section 6.6 in the AAMA LAP-1 and L
	AP-3.  Each accredited full-service laboratory and field test agency must 
	have at least one representative from each accredited location on the webi
	nar. The webinar will also be recorded for those who cannot attend. Howeve
	r\, attendance is not limited to AAMA accredited laboratories. Any FGIA me
	mber interested in the subject matter may be able to attend.\n\nThere is n
	o registration fee for this workshop.\n\n \n\nADD TO YOUR CALENDAR <https:
	//aama-public.s3.amazonaws.com/mp/3-7_LabWorkshop.ics> \n\n \n\n\nThe curr
	ent agenda for the workshop meeting includes:\n\n\n*	Update on AAMA 515-19
	\,  Voluntary Procedure for Determination of Fenestration Surface Temperat
	ures by THERM Finite Element Modeling - Steve Fronek (Apogee)\n*	Update on
	 AAMA 501.9-19\, Surface Temperature Assessment for Condensation Evaluatio
	n of Exterior Wall Systems - Robert Jutras UL Canada)\n*	IGU testing and t
	he use of the rapid assessment chamber - AMS staff\n*	Applicability of lab
	oratory testing as compared to field performance - John Medina (Miami Curt
	ain Wall Consultants Corp.)\n\nFenestrationMaster Credits \nParticipation 
	in this workshop counts for two Industry Engagement Credits toward your Fe
	nestrationMaster recertification <https://aamanet.org/pages/recertificatio
	n> . Certified professionals may track elective requirement fulfillments i
	n the Industry Engagement Credit Tracking Matrix <https://s3.amazonaws.com
	/aama-public/mp/FM/Industry_Engagement_Credit_Tracking_Matrix.xlsx> . \n\n
	FenestrationMaster certified professionals must complete up to 25 credits 
	of industry engagement requirements during the recertification cycle\, bas
	ed on their certification expiration date.\n\nPlease join my meeting from 
	your computer\, tablet or smartphone.\n\nhttps://meet.goto.com/768134365 <
	https://meet.goto.com/768134365> \n\nYou can also dial in using your phone
	.\n\nAccess Code:\n\n768-134-365\n\nUnited States:\n\n+1 (646) 749-3129 <t
	el:+16467493129\,\,768134365> \n\nMore phone numbers\n\nCanada:\n\n+1 (647
	) 497-9391 <tel:+16474979391\,\,768134365> \n\nThanks\,\nJason\n\n \n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20240326T120000
