CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20240327T181537Z
DESCRIPTION:Hello Team\,\n\nI would like to invite you to a presentation we
	 are having next Monday in the large conference room to host Peter Viertha
	ler of NW Partners in a discussion of his new window system offerings\, as
	 well as a primer on new V-Shield products and other lines he currently ha
	s.\n\n \n\nI am regrettably getting this out a tad late so I would appreci
	ate a swift response to this and\, if you can attend\, a confirmation of w
	hether it is in person or via TEAMS. \n\n \n\nI am asking that these all b
	e in by Thursday EoD so I can get the headcount over to Peter for Catering
	.\n\n \n\nRespectfully\,\n\nC\n\n_________________________________________
	_______________________________________ \n\nMicrosoft Teams meeting \n\nJo
	in on your computer\, mobile app or room device \n\nClick here to join the
	 meeting <https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_NDFhOGVhN
	zUtNWMwNi00YTFmLWFkNjEtNWFkNzQwYjY4ZGRm%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22
	%3a%22819874e4-0ad2-4c6a-8b1c-0f3bbb31b6da%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22c87e0514-e9
	b1-48f2-b90d-81954e230f86%22%7d>  \n\nMeeting ID: 237 573 257 490 \nPassco
	de: GcHL9Q \n\nDownload Teams <https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-t
	eams/download-app>  | Join on the web <https://www.microsoft.com/microsoft
