	class="MsoNormal">Hello Team\,<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal">I would 
	like to invite you to a presentation we are having next Monday in the larg
	e conference room to host Peter Vierthaler of NW Partners in a discussion 
	of his new window system offerings\, as well as a primer on new V-Shield p
	roducts and other lines he currently has.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNorma
	l"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal">I am regrettably getting thi
	s out a tad late so I would appreciate a swift response to this and\, if y
	ou can attend\, a confirmation of whether it is in person or via TEAMS. <o
	:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNorma
	l">I am asking that these all be in by Thursday EoD so I can get the headc
	ount over to Peter for Catering.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&
	nbsp\;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal">Respectfully\,<o:p></o:p></p><p class
