DESCRIPTION:Pre-Billing Total = 100\,003.24\n\n \n\nAjera Total = 98\,953.0
	0\n\n \n\nDifferences in totals as follows:\n\n \n\nTylers SRM Expenses +2
	0% went to Consulting = -3\,677.74\n\n \n\nSim Billed 21\,908 and not 21\,
	210.50 = +697.50\n\n \n\nThe Following Sustainability ABT was mistakenly l
	isted for Testing Department in Ajera\n\nCT\, 2312-2017 = +760.00\n\nCT\, 
	2403-2007 = +390.00\n\nC Shep\, 2306-2138 = +390.00\n\nJE\, 2306-2327 = +3
	90.00\n\n \n\n100\,003.74 (Prebilling Total) – 3677.74 + 697.5 +760.00 +
	 390.00 + 390.00 +390.00 = 98\,953.00 (Ajera Total)\n\n \n\nOnce Sustainab
	ility ABT is removed total should be\, 98\,953.00 – 1\,930.00 = 97\,023.
	00\n\n \n\n
