DESCRIPTION:Attendees: Robbie & Jesus w/ BEE 425-344-6997 \n\n \n\nProject 
	#: 2110-1014\n\n \n\nTest Pressure: 6.0 PSF for windows.\n\n \n\nScope: Re
	test the 2 failed locations and 6 additional locations of the same type.\n
	\n \n\nNote: GC shall invite window manufacturer to the test. All test loc
	ations should have interior air barrier sealant installed\, head flashing 
	in place\, and a completed field of WRB surrounding the test locations.\n\
	n \n\nOnsite contact:\n\nPatrick Griffin\n\nAsst. Superintendent\n\nGenCap
	 Construction Corp.\n\n			\n\n425-404-1484\n\n\n\npatrickg@gencapgc.com <m
	ailto:patrickg@gencapgc.com> \n\n\n\ngencapgc.com <https://gencapgc.com/> 
	\n\n\n\n5808 Lake Washington Blvd NE\, Suite 203\n\nKirkland\, WA 98033\n\
	n \n\n
