CREATED:20240416T184708Z
DESCRIPTION:Attendees: Torin\, Robbie\, Jesus\, Dave\, & Chris 425-595-7654
	\n\nScope: Air barrier testing 210-unit building. Test to start at 1pm\, a
	ll personnel to exit the building for the duration of the testing ~1-1.5 h
	ours.\n\nNote: The building envelope and any areas leading to an unconditi
	oned space must be completed prior to testing. This includes all walls int
	o the parking garage\, exterior doors being sealed around the perimeter\, 
	hardware and gaskets installed\, all sliding glass door panels in place\, 
	all penetrations sealed\, all temporary cords removed from the building th
	at prevent the doors and windows from closing\, and any other items may ef
	fect the overall air leakage of the building.\n\nProject Number- 2207-1011
	\n\nOn site contact:\n\nCharles Landert @ 360-572-7427\n\n \n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20240627T160000
