	g. BEE will arrive onsite at 7am to begin setting up test equipment\, perf
	orm rooftop & louver isolations\, & prop unit doors open. Testing will beg
	in at 11am at which time all personnel shall exit the building for the dur
	ation of the testing ~ 1 hour. \n\n  \n\nOnsite Contact- Stefan w/Blueprin
	t 206-476-8757\n\n
