	soNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p cl
	ass=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>Scope- Air barrier testing on
	 78-unit apartment building. BEE will arrive onsite at 7am to begin settin
	g up test equipment\, perform rooftop &amp\; louver isolations\, &amp\; pr
	op unit doors open. Testing will begin at 11am at which time all personnel
	 shall exit the building for the duration of the testing ~ 1 hour. </span>
	<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>&nbsp\;&n
	bsp\;</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5p
	t'>Onsite Contact- Stefan w/Blueprint 206-476-8757</span><span style='font
