	95-7654\n\n \n\nScope- Air barrier testing. BEE will arrive onsite at 7am 
	and begin setting up test equipment and preparing the building for the tes
	ting that will commence at Noon. All personnel shall exit the building for
	 the duration of the testing ~1 hour.\n\n \n\nOnsite Contact-\n\nHayden Ha
	nna\nMarpac Construction LLC | Project Manager |\n1225 South Weller Street
	 | suite 500 | Seattle\, WA 98144 |\nOffice 206.329.4992 | Direct (206) 95
	7-9877 | Mobile 206-697-8685 |\nhaydenh@marpac.net <mailto:haydenh@marpac.
	net> \n\n \n\n
