	hich point all personnel must exit the building for the duration of the te
	st ~ 1hour. GC will notify all subs/trades of the testing. \n\n \n\nContac
	t-\n\n \n\n \n\n <http://www.compass-gc.com/> \n\n\n\nKJ Holmes​\n\nProj
	ect Engineer\n\nCell: 206.953.2023 <tel:206.953.2023> \n\n11332 NE 122nd W
	ay Ste. 350\n\n\, \n\nKirkland\, WA\n\n \n\n98034\n\nKJ.Holmes@compass-gc.
	com <mailto:KJ.Holmes@compass-gc.com> \n\n | \n\nwww.compass-gc.com <http:
	//www.compass-gc.com/> \n\n | \n\n <https://www.linkedin.com/company/compa
	ss-general-construction/> \n\n <https://www.instagram.com/compassgc/> \n\n
	 <https://www.facebook.com/compassgc/> \n\n​​This message contains con
	fidential information and is intended only for the individual(s) addressed
