DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin\, Robbie\, & Jesus\, 425-595-7654\n\n \n\nScop
	e- Air barrier testing the Safeway building. Bee will arrive onsite at 11:
	00 am and begin prepping/isolating the building and setting up test equipm
	ent. Testing to be performed at 3pm at which point all personnel must exit
	 the building for the duration of the test ~ 1hour. GC will notify all sub
	s/trades of the testing. All penetrations to be sealed by GC prior to the 
	testing date.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\n \n\n \n\n <http://www.compass-gc.com/> 
	\n\n\n\nKJ Holmes​\n\nProject Engineer\n\nCell: 206.953.2023 <tel:206.95
	3.2023> \n\n11332 NE 122nd Way Ste. 350\n\n\, \n\nKirkland\, WA\n\n \n\n98
	034\n\nKJ.Holmes@compass-gc.com <mailto:KJ.Holmes@compass-gc.com> \n\n | \
	n\nwww.compass-gc.com <http://www.compass-gc.com/> \n\n | \n\n <https://ww
	w.linkedin.com/company/compass-general-construction/> \n\n <https://www.in
	stagram.com/compassgc/> \n\n <https://www.facebook.com/compassgc/> \n\n​
	​This message contains confidential information and is intended only for
	 the individual(s) addressed in the message. \n​If you are not the named
	 addressee\, you should not disseminate\, distribute\, or copy this email.
	 \n​If you are not the intended recipient\, you are notified that disclo
