DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin\, Robbie\, Jesus\, Dave\, & Chris 425-595-7654
	\n\n \n\nScope- Air barrier testing on a 47-unit building. BEE will arrive
	 onsite at 7am and begin isolating the building and setting up test equipm
	ent. The testing will start at 10:30am at which point the building must be
	 emptied of all personnel. Additional testing will occur on a two 12 unit 
	buildings as well. 12-unit buildings will need to be empty of personnel at
	 the time of testing.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\n \n\nJason Covey\n\nAsst. Superi
	ntendent\n\nGenCap Construction Corp.\n\n			\n\n206-384-9501 <tel:555-555-
	5555> \n\n\n\njasonc@gencapgc.com <mailto:jasonc@gencapgc.com> \n\n\n\ngen
	capgc.com <https://gencapgc.com/> \n\n\n\n5808 Lake Washington Blvd NE\, S
	uite 203\n\nKirkland\, WA 98033\n\n	\n	\n	\n\n\n \n\n
