DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin\, Robbie\, Jesus\, Dave\, & Chris 425-595-7654
	\n\n \n\nScope- Air barrier testing on a 47-unit building. BEE will arrive
	 onsite at 7am and begin isolating the building and setting up test equipm
	ent. The testing will start at 10:30am at which point the building must be
	 emptied of all personnel. Additional testing will occur on a 12 unit buil
	ding as time allows after the 47-unit building is completed. 12-unit build
	ings will need to be empty of personnel at the time of testing.\n\n \n\nCo
	ntact-\n\n \n\nJason Covey\n\nAsst. Superintendent\n\nGenCap Construction 
	Corp.\n\n			\n\n206-384-9501 <tel:555-555-5555> \n\n\n\njasonc@gencapgc.co
