DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin\, Chris\, Dave\, Robbie\, Jack\, & Jesus w/ BE
	E 424-595-7654\n\n \n\nScope- Air barrier testing. BEE will arrive onsite 
	at 8am and begin setting up test equipment and preparing the building for 
	the testing that will commence at Noon. All personnel shall exit the build
	ing for the duration of the testing ~1 hour.\n\n \n\nOnsite Contact-\n\nTo
	dd Howem|Senior Superintendent\n\nRobertson & Olson Construction\, Inc\n\n
	4857 NW Lake Road | Suite 320 | Camas\, WA  98607 <https://maps.google.com
	/maps?hl=en&q=4600+NW+Camas+Meadows+Dr\,+Camas\,+WA&ie=UTF-8&ei=8PB1UNzUNu
	e8iwL03IGQCA&ved=0CAgQ_AUoAg> \n\nO 360.699.4724 <tel:360.699.4724>  |M 36
	0.450.8691| F 360.737.6799 <tel:360.737.6799>  | Website <http://www.rocon
	struction.com/>  | Follow Us <http://www.facebook.com/pages/Robertson-Olso
	n-Construction-Inc/134094989999458>  \n\nWashington . Oregon . California 
	. Idaho . Montana . New Mexico . Nevada . Alaska . Arizona\n\n \n\n
