ATTENDEE;CN="Dave Luxmore";RSVP=TRUE:mailto:dluxmore@bee-engineers.com
ATTENDEE;CN="John Westerfield";RSVP=TRUE:mailto:johnw@crystaliteinc.com
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20240828T214717Z
DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Dave & Chris 425-599-8766\n\n \n\nScope- Witnessing 
	below testing.\n\n*	Glass Railing mounted on I-beam\n\n	*	800# on the glas
	s infill portion to meet the 400% safety factor requirement in the code\n	
	*	200# & 400# pressure at all the other locations\n\n*	Cable Railing mount
	ed on I-beam\n\n	*	200# & 400# pressure at all the locations\n\n*	Picket R
	ailing mounted on I-beam\n\n	*	200# & 400# pressure at all the locations\n
	\n*	No-Infill Railing deck mounted on to wood test buck with field fastene
	rs\n\n	*	just going to pull to validate fastener strength\n	*	200# & 400# 
	pressure\n\n*	No-Infill Railing side mounted on to wood test buck with fie
	ld fasteners\n\n	*	just going to pull to validate fastener strength\n	*	20
	0# & 400# pressure\n\n \n\nContact-\n\nJohn Westerfield\nCrystaLite\, Inc.
	\n3307 Cedar Street\, Everett\, WA 98201\np: 425-259-6000   |   f: 425-257
	-0232\nwww.CrystaLiteInc.com <http://www.CrystaLiteInc.com> \n\n \n\n
