DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Chris\, Jesus\, & Dave. 425-599-8766\n\n \n\nScope- 
	Building Prep & HVAC isolation for air barrier testing a conference room a
	ddition in an existing warehouse. BEE will arrive onsite at 9:00 am and be
	gin setting up test equipment and prepping the building. Testing to be per
	formed at 11:00am at which point all personnel must exit the building for 
	the duration of the test ~ 1hour. GC will notify all subs/trades of the te
	sting. \n\n \n\nNote- GC to have HVAC shut down the day of the test.\n\n \
	n\nContact-\n\n \n\n \n\n <https://www.ameresco.com/images/ameresco.png> \
	n\n \n\nNatasha Coats​​ CoaCoats\n\n \n\n \n\nSenior Construction Proj
	ect Manager\n\nC:+1 801 358 5260 \nncoats@ameresco.com <mailto:ncoats@amer
	esco.com>  \n\n9700 SW Capitol Highway\, Suite 110\nPortland\, OR 97219\nh
	ttp://www.ameresco.com <http://www.ameresco.com/> \n\n \n\n
