DESCRIPTION:Attendees: Torin & Jesus w/ BEE 425-595-7654 \n\n \n\nProject #
	: 2110-1014\n\n \n\nTest Pressure: 6.0 PSF \n\n \n\nScope: Test three ~10
	’x10’ sections of storefront.\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\nNote: GC shall invite s
	torefront installer to the test. All test locations should have interior a
	ir barrier sealant installed\, head flashing in place\, and a completed fi
	eld of WRB surrounding the test locations.\n\n \n\nOnsite contact:\n\nPatr
	ick Griffin\n\nAsst. Superintendent\n\nGenCap Construction Corp.\n\n			\n\
	n425-404-1484\n\n\n\npatrickg@gencapgc.com <mailto:patrickg@gencapgc.com> 
	\n\n\n\ngencapgc.com <https://gencapgc.com/> \n\n\n\n5808 Lake Washington 
	Blvd NE\, Suite 203\n\nKirkland\, WA 98033\n\n \n\n \n\n
