DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robbie & Jesus 425-344-6997\n\nScope- 2 Awnings\, 2 
	Fixed windows\, and 1 Sliding glass Door in L4 Courtyard.\n\nTest Pressure
	- 6.0 PSF\n\nNote- GC to invite window manufacturer to testing date. Pleas
	e ensure that the items below have been completed prior to the testing dat
	e.\n\n*	Detailing\n\n	*	Window/door head flashing is required for the test
	\, which has not been installed at this time.\n\n		*	Advised the installer
	s of this requirement.\n\n	*	Ensure Primary WRB extends from the specimen 
	6-10 feet.\n	*	Ensure interior rod and sealant have been installed at the 
	L4 courtyard.\n	*	For the purposes of testing\, it is preferred to not ins
	tall cladding at selected locations.\n\n*	Water & Electrical\n\n	*	Located
	 NE Corner of the project and in building.\n	*	Electrical located througho
	ut the building.\n\nContact-\n\nGeorge Goff w/ Jody Miller Construction 
	– 253-906-4150\n\n \n\n
