	span style='font-size:10.5pt'>Attendees- Torin\, Robbie\, Jesus\, Dave &am
	p\; Chris 425-595-7654<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style
	='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span 
	style='font-size:10.5pt'>Scope- Air barrier testing on 22-unit building\, 
	two test zones. BEE will arrive at 8am and begin setting up equipment and 
	prepping the building by sealing off HVAC penetrations in units and roofto
	p. Testing will be done in two parts. All personnel must exit the test are
	as for 1 hour during the test. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><s
	pan style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNorm
	al><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>Contact- <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=
