	lding for approximately 1 hour for the duration of the testing.\n\n \n\nBE
	E #- 2105-1002\n\n \n\nNote- GC to seal off the new building from the old 
	building as much as possible prior to the testing as discussed on the site
	 walk. Hallways will need temp walls sealed in place to perform the testin
	g.\n\n \n\nContact- \n\nAl Goers\nMarpac Construction LLC | Superintendent
	 |\n1225 South Weller Street | suite 500 | Seattle\, WA 98144 |\nOffice 20
	6.329.4992 | Direct | Mobile 206-229-9231 |\n\n \n\n
