DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin\, Robbie\, & Jesus 425-595-7654\n\n \n\nScope-
	 Air barrier testing a Taco Bell. BEE will arrive onsite by 9am and begin 
	setting up equipment and sealing off the HVAC. Testing will begin at 11am 
	at which point all personnel must exit the building for approximately 1 ho
	ur for the duration of the testing.\n\n \n\nNote- HVAC must be off the day
	 of the test with dampers closed if possible. Water must be in all P-traps
	.\n\n \n\nBEE Project #- 2411-1003\n\n \n\nOnsite Contact- Josh B 360-470-
	2555\n\n \n\n
