CREATED:20240925T171919Z
DESCRIPTION:Hello Everyone\,\n\nLet’s all get together to give thanks to 
	our fellow team members and co-workers by sitting down and sharing a meal.
	\n\n \n\nEveryone contributes by bringing a dish to share…\n\n…maybe i
	t’s a special dish from your family/country\, or just something you’ve
	 mastered\, or maybe something you want to try your hand at? (Practice on 
	us!)\n\n \n\nFood is good and so let’s eat!\n\n \n\nMore details to come
	.\n\n \n\nTHANKS!\n\n \n\n\n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20241118T140000
DTSTAMP:20240905T214444Z
DTSTART;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20241118T120000
