CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20240925T171921Z
DESCRIPTION:Calling all Ghouls & Boos\,\n\nWhether you’re a creepy creatu
	re\, a silly superhero\, or a wicked wizard\, do you think your costume ca
	n “scare” up enough votes to win???\n\n*	Wear a costume to work on Hal
	loween. (You may not recognize a single soul…or are there any souls left
	???) Mwah ah ah!!! \n*	Feast on some pizza\, cause\, we all gotta eat.\n*	
	Enter the contest to win a prize…IF YOU DARE!\n\n \n\nBe sure to RSVP or
	 risk a visit from THE REAPER!\n\n\n\n \n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20241031T130000
DTSTAMP:20240905T211811Z
