	8.0pt\;font-family:Chiller\;color:#FF6600">Calling all Ghouls &amp\; Boos\
	,<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:24.0pt\
	;font-family:Chiller">Whether you&#8217\;re a creepy creature\, a silly su
	perhero\, or a wicked wizard\, do you think your costume can &#8220\;scare
	&#8221\; up enough votes to win???<o:p></o:p></span></p><ul style="margin-
	top:0in" type="disc"><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in\;
	mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:24.0pt\;font-family:Chille
	r">Wear a costume to work on Halloween. (You may not recognize a single so
	ul&#8230\;or are there any souls left???) </span><b><span style="font-size
	:26.0pt\;font-family:Chiller">Mwah ah ah!!! </span></b><span style="font-s
	ize:24.0pt\;font-family:Chiller"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoList
	Paragraph" style="margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3"><span style="f
	ont-size:24.0pt\;font-family:Chiller">Feast on some pizza\, cause\, we all
	 gotta eat.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="colo
	r:#C00000\;margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-siz
	e:24.0pt\;font-family:Chiller\;color:windowtext">Enter the contest to win 
	a prize&#8230\;</span><span style="font-size:24.0pt\;font-family:Chiller\;
	color:#9900FF">IF YOU DARE!</span><span style="font-size:24.0pt\;font-fami
	ly:Chiller"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ul><p class="MsoListParagraph"><span 
	style="font-size:22.0pt\;font-family:Chiller\;color:#C00000"><o:p>&nbsp\;<
	/o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:28.0pt\;font-f
	amily:Chiller\;color:#C00000">Be sure to RSVP or risk a visit from THE REA
	PER!<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:28.0
	pt\;font-family:Chiller\;color:#C00000\;mso-ligatures:none"><img width="27
