DESCRIPTION:Average Monthly Schedule:\n\nBilling\n\nMarketing\n\nTraining \
	n\nProposals\n\nOH Expansions\n\n \n\n____________________________________
	____________________________________________ \n\nMicrosoft Teams meeting \
	n\nJoin on your computer or mobile app \n\nClick here to join the meeting 
	<https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_YjZhNDViMTItNTNmNC
	00OWMyLWJkZDEtY2JlYTczYmY4NWYx%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%22819
	874e4-0ad2-4c6a-8b1c-0f3bbb31b6da%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22834c87fb-a19a-4c15-9
	b9f-8cfe665ad519%22%7d>  \n\nOr call in (audio only) \n\n+1 323-694-9885\,
	\,596828990# <tel:+13236949885\,\,596828990#>    United States\, Los Angel
	es \n\nPhone Conference ID: 596 828 990# \n\nFind a local number <https://
	dialin.teams.microsoft.com/fbc8ed71-2cf6-4abc-985b-858f4254827f?id=5968289
	90>  | Reset PIN <https://mysettings.lync.com/pstnconferencing>  \n\nLearn
	 More <https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting>  | Meeting options <https://teams.
	microsoft.com/meetingOptions/?organizerId=834c87fb-a19a-4c15-9b9f-8cfe665a
	d519&tenantId=819874e4-0ad2-4c6a-8b1c-0f3bbb31b6da&threadId=19_meeting_YjZ
	hNDViMTItNTNmNC00OWMyLWJkZDEtY2JlYTczYmY4NWYx@thread.v2&messageId=0&langua
	ge=en-US>  \n\n___________________________________________________________
	_____________________ \n\nCurrent Action Item:\n\nTransfer Excel Spreadshe
	et of Active Projects to Widget on Ajera (Dave to send Chad link to curren
	t spreadsheet)\n\nTrack emails sent out and how many contracts signed per 
	week. Separate signed contracts into groups associated with marketing (Lin
	kedIn\, Emails\, Word of Mouth)\n\nConnect with Architects on Current List
	 on LinkedIn – (25-30 Connections per Week)\n\nCreate 1 Post/ 2 Weeks on
	 LinkedIn. First post on Attending NFRC Meeting [Tag Each other in Posts (
	@ symbol followed by name)]\n\nEmails: Create Email Batch Script. Check CA
	N Spam Act for Business guidelines on email marketing distribution. If we 
	can’t find anything then send IT request on what quantity and frequency 
	of emails to send without getting listed as SPAM.\n\n                Artic
	le on Email Marketing Services: https://www.quicksprout.com/best-email-mar
	keting-services/\n\n \n\nMarketing Schedule\n\n                Monday – 
	1 hour Marketing Meeting within Department\n\n     Post One Item on Linked
	In\n\n                Tuesday – One hour creating connections on LinkedI
	n\n\n                Thursday – 1-2 hours for Emails\n\n \n\nContinued A
	ction Items:\n\nSend Marketing Email to Client List every 3 months\n\n    
	            Last list sent out on September 23rd\n\nCreate list of keyword
	s for SEO to place on our website with Google Analytics\n\nAcquire Passive
	 House Certification\n\n \n\n
