DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robbie & Torin 425-344-6997\n\n \n\nScope- Window wa
	ter penetration testing in accordance with AAMA 502-21. Retest 7 failed lo
	cations (Reference report on server) and 21 additional locations will be a
	t the direction of the GC. 28 windows to be tested in 4 days after remedia
	tions have been applied.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 15% of the DP with a 1/3 r
	eduction.\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\nOnsite Contacts-\n\nCamille Ferrara\, Greystar 
	Property Manager\, 650-575-5913\n\nKris Wolfe\, Greystar Property Maintena
	nce\, 808-990-8119\n\n
