DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Dave & Jesus 425-345-9656\n\n \n\nScope- Window Test
	ing ASTM E1105. One fixed window\, one casement\, one horizontal slider\, 
	one sliding glass door\, & one swing door.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 6.0 PSF\
	n\n \n\nNote- GC to invite window manufacturer to testing date. All test l
	ocations should be installed to detail\, have a completed field of WRB sur
	rounding them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barrier sealant
	 in place.\n\n \n\nIan Powell Ianp@stsconst.com <mailto:Ianp@stsconst.com>
	 \; Luke Thrasher luket@stsconst.com <mailto:luket@stsconst.com> \; Suvad 
	Tanjo Suvad@bee-engineers.com <mailto:Suvad@bee-engineers.com> \n\n \n\nOn
	site Contact-\n\n \n\nIan Powell\n\nSuperintendent\n\nIanp@stsconst.com <m
	ailto:Ianp@stsconst.com> \n\n206.718.4407 m\n\n206.439.6343 o\n\n9049 20th
	 Ave SW\n\nSeattle\, WA 98106\n\n \n\n
