DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robbie & Jesus 425-344-6997\n\n \n\nScope- Day 1 of 
	ASTM E1105 on vinyl windows. At least one of each operator type & a slidin
	g glass door each day\, 5-7 locations total.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 6.0 PS
	F\n\n \n\nNote- GC to invite window manufacturer to the testing date. Wind
	ows should be installed to detail with interior air barrier sealant in pla
	ce\, a completed field of WRB surrounding the test locations\, and head fl
	ashing installed. Adequate access to the exterior testing areas for the sp
	ray rack to be provided by the GC (third floor locations may need a lift o
	r rack may be suspended from the rooftop by BEE if there is no scaffolding
	\, TBD at pretest meeting).\n\n \n\nContact-\n\n <http://www.srmdevelopmen
	t.com/> \n\n \n\nJames Wilkins\nGeneral Superintendent\nM:   (425) 772-010
	7\n\nJobsite: 14343 15th Ave. NE\, Seattle\, WA 98125\n\nMain Office: 111 
	N. Post Street\, Ste. 200\, Spokane\, WA 99201\n\n \n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20250220T153000
