	05 testing a fixed\, fixed/awning\, casement\, XO horizontal slider\, XOX 
	horizontal slider\, single swing door\, and a three lite sliding glass doo
	r with transom. 7 locations total.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 4.5 PSF\n\n \n\n
	Note- GC to invite window manufacturer to the testing date. Windows should
	 be installed to detail with interior air barrier sealant in place\, a com
	pleted field of WRB surrounding the test locations\, and head flashing ins
	talled. Adequate access to the exterior testing areas for the spray rack t
	o be provided by the GC (third floor locations may need a lift or rack may
	 be suspended from the rooftop by BEE if there is no scaffolding\, TBD at 
	pretest meeting).\n\n \n\nContact- Kyle Skow (Intracorp) 206-619-7311\n\n 
	\n\n
