DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robbie & Jesus 425-344-6997 \n\nScope- ASTM E1105\, 
	four ~10’x10’ sections of storefront windows. Site walk to address pot
	ential areas of concern as it pertains to building completion in advance o
	f the air barrier testing currently scheduled for 4/18.\n\n \n\nTest Press
	ure- 6.0 PSF\n\n \n\nNote- GC to invite storefront installer to the testin
	g date. Ensure windows are installed to detail and all waterproofing of th
	e openings has been completed prior to the testing date.\n\n \n\nContact-\
	n\nEddie Polevoy\nEpic Construction Management\n206-573-8882\nepolevoy@epi
	ccm.com <mailto:epolevoy@epiccm.com> \n\n \n\n
