	is \n\n \n\nScope- ASTM-E779 air barrier testing a 207-unit building. BEE 
	will arrive onsite at 7am and begin setting up test equipment\, testing wi
	ll begin at 1pm at which time all personnel must leave the building for th
	e duration of the testing ~ 1-1.5 hours.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\nPatrick Griff
	in \nAssistant Superintendent \nP: +1 (425) 404-1484 | E: patrickg@gencapg
	c.com <mailto:patrickg@gencapgc.com> \n\n \n\n
