CREATED:20241206T233330Z
DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin\, Robbie\, Dave\, & Chris 425-595-7654\n\n \n\
	nScope- Air barrier testing a 28-unit mixed use building with 4 retail spa
	ces. BEE will arrive onsite at 8am and begin sealing off all HVAC and sett
	ing up test equipment. Testing will begin at Noon\, the building must be c
	leared of all personnel for the duration of the testing ~ 1 hour.\n\n \n\n
	Note- GC air barrier testing checklist attached. All HVAC in the building 
	will need to be off the day of the test. All drain P-traps should have wat
	er in them prior to the testing date. All exterior doors shall have hardwa
	re\, thresholds\, and gaskets installed prior to the testing date.\n\n \n\
	nContact-\n\n \n\nJani Snell\n\n \n\n\n\n1211 Granary Ave #601B <https://g
	oo.gl/maps/mtvA5LygvPKK8FhaA> \n\nBellingham\, WA 98225 <https://goo.gl/ma
	ps/mtvA5LygvPKK8FhaA> \n\nC:  360-927-1006\n\n \n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20241227T160000
