	    425-344-6997\n\n \n\nScope:\n\n3 – Fixed Windows (required after pro
	duct failure on test date 11/18/24)\n\n4 – Horizontal Sliders (1 retest 
	of Bldg. 2 Unit #10 Livingroom failure on test date 11/18/24\, and 3 addit
	ional tests)\n\n \n\nTest Specification:\n\nTest Pressure – 4.5psf\n\n \
	n\nNote - GC to invite the window manufacturer to this testing date.\n\n \
	n\nOn-Site Contact:\n\nDavante - (253) 326-6730\n\n
