DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Dave (425-345-9656) & Jesus \n\n \n\nScope- Day 2 of
	 ASTM E1105 on vinyl windows on bump out conditions (L1/L2). 4 locations t
	otal.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 6.0 PSF\n\n \n\nNote- GC to invite window man
	ufacturer to the testing date. Windows should be installed to detail with 
	interior air barrier sealant in place\, a completed field of WRB surroundi
	ng the test locations\, and head flashing installed. \n\n \n\nContact-\n\n
	 <http://www.srmdevelopment.com/> \n\n \n\nJames Wilkins\nGeneral Superint
	endent\nM:   (425) 772-0107\n\nJobsite: 14343 15th Ave. NE\, Seattle\, WA 
	98125\n\nMain Office: 111 N. Post Street\, Ste. 200\, Spokane\, WA 99201\n
	\n \n\n
