DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robbie (425-344-6997) & Jesus \n\n \n\nScope- Window
	 Testing ASTM E1105. Retesting the failed swing door plus three additional
	 & three ~10x10’ sections of storefront. Doors will be tested in the mor
	ning and storefront in the afternoon.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 6.0 PSF\n\n \
	n\nNote- GC to invite window manufacturer and storefront installer to test
	ing date. All test locations should be installed to detail\, have a comple
	ted field of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing installed\, and interior
	 air barrier sealant in place.\n\n \n\nOnsite Contact-\n\n \n\nIan Powell\
	n\nSuperintendent\n\nIanp@stsconst.com <mailto:Ianp@stsconst.com> \n\n206.
	718.4407 m\n\n206.439.6343 o\n\n9049 20th Ave SW\n\nSeattle\, WA 98106\n\n
	 \n\n
