DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Jack (503-679-5147) & Robbie\n\n \n\nScope- ASTM E11
	05 on vinyl windows. 2 horizontal sliders\, casement\, fixed\, sliding gla
	ss door\, & a single hung. 6 locations total.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 2/3 o
	f DP Rating.\n\n \n\nNote- GC to invite window manufacturer to the testing
	 date. Windows should be installed to detail with interior air barrier sea
	lant in place\, a completed field of WRB surrounding the test locations\, 
	and head flashing installed. \n\n \n\nContact-\n\nTom Tullis | Superintend
	ent | LMC Construction | 503.855.9663\n\n \n\n
