DESCRIPTION:Hi Team\,\n\n \n\nJill Chen and Todd Johnson with Facades North
	west are hosting a Mitrex lunch and learn on Tuesday 02/04 at 12pm. Please
	 accept or decline by Thursday 01/30\, so I can provide a headcount and di
	etary restrictions to arrange for catering.\n\nSee below for the course de
	scription (more info on the attachment):\n\n \n\nMitrex pioneers sustainab
	le solutions by seamlessly integrating solar\n\ntechnology with architectu
	ral innovation. Our Building-Integrated\n\nPhotovoltaic (BIPV) systems off
	er architects\, builders\, and visionaries the\n\nchance to harness the su
	n’s power without sacrificing aesthetics\, effectively\n\nturning a buil
	ding’s facade into a micro power plant.\n\n \n\nWe’re redefining the n
	arrative of solar energy\, proving that it can be both\n\nefficient and el
	egant. From Solar Facades to Solar Glass\, and from Solar\n\nRailings to h
	ighway Solar Noise Barriers\, our range is as limitless as your\n\nimagina
	tion.\n\n \n\nOur lightweight Claditized system (Unitized Wall System)\, C
	ladifab System\n\n(Pre-fab Wall Wystem)\, Cladishield System (Rainscreen S
	ystem) and\n\nSolaRailTM System (Solar Railing Systems) are designed to ex
	pedite\n\nconstruction schedules\, reduce costs\, improve building perform
	ance and\n\nare suitable for new construction and retrofits. Other benefit
	s include:\n\n• Offset energy loads and provide on-site energy generatio
	n\n\n• Customizable in design\n\n• Building and fire code certified\n\
	n• Can achieve LEED points\, meet ESGs and renewable building\n\nregulat
	ions\n\n• Eligible for federal tax incentives\n\n \n\nThank you\,\n\nKyl
	ie Grogg\n\n______________________________________________________________
	__________________\n\nMicrosoft Teams Need help? <https://aka.ms/JoinTeams
	Meeting?omkt=en-US>  \n\nJoin the meeting now <https://teams.microsoft.com
	/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_MWZjZDBjZjEtNWY4NS00ZDA0LWJiM2UtMzY2ZjE5MmVlYj
	U2%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%22819874e4-0ad2-4c6a-8b1c-0f3bbb3
	1b6da%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22bcf33cce-bb14-4001-a478-06957ed1638a%22%7d>  \n\
	nMeeting ID: 263 340 318 081 \n\nPasscode: oC2vz9Va \n\n__________________
	______________\n\nDial in by phone \n\n+1 323-694-9885\,\,353831088# <tel:
	+13236949885\,\,353831088>  United States\, Los Angeles \n\nFind a local n
	umber <https://dialin.teams.microsoft.com/fbc8ed71-2cf6-4abc-985b-858f4254
	827f?id=353831088>  \n\nPhone conference ID: 353 831 088# \n\nFor organize
	rs: Meeting options <https://teams.microsoft.com/meetingOptions/?organizer
	Id=bcf33cce-bb14-4001-a478-06957ed1638a&tenantId=819874e4-0ad2-4c6a-8b1c-0
	f3bbb31b6da&threadId=19_meeting_MWZjZDBjZjEtNWY4NS00ZDA0LWJiM2UtMzY2ZjE5Mm
	VlYjU2@thread.v2&messageId=0&language=en-US>  | Reset dial-in PIN <https:/
	/dialin.teams.microsoft.com/usp/pstnconferencing>  \n\n___________________
	_____________________________________________________________\n\n \n\n
