DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin\, Chris\, Dave\, Robbie\, & Jesus 425-595-7654
	\n\n \n\nScope- ASTM E779 Air barrier testing per WSEC 2018 Commercial on 
	a Winco. BEE will arrive onsite at 8am and begin prepping the building and
	 setting up test equipment. Testing will begin at Noon at which time all p
	ersonnel must leave the building for the duration of the testing ~ 1 hour.
	 \n\n \n\nNote- All HVAC will need to be turned off with the dampers in th
	e closed position (if possible)\, all drain P-traps filled with water\, al
	l exterior doors in place\, and adequate power sources available for the f
	ans (10 plugs on individual circuits/breakers within 100’). If there are
	 HVAC louvers that require a lift to access one will need to be provided.\
	n\n \n\nContact-\n\nJARED PULLAN\n\nDTL Builders\n\nC:801-916-2141\n\n \n\
	n
