DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin (425-595-7654)\, Chris\, Robbie\, Dave\, & Jes
	us \n\n \n\nScope- Building prep & HVAC isolations on a 329-unit building.
	 Seal each units HVAC (bath fans\, range hood\, ac ports\, dryers\, ect.)\
	, shut windows\, turn each unit’s bath fan breakers off\, props doors\, 
	seal rooftop HVAC units\, and test retail spaces.\n\n \n\nNote- GC to noti
	fy subcontractors and cleaners to not remove isolation materials\, open wi
	ndows\, or turn breakers on for bath fans during this time.\n\n \n\nContac
	t-\n\nJason Brown (Venture) 206-635-8249\n\n \n\n
