DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robbie (425-344-6997) & Jesus \n\n \n\nScope- ASTM E
	1105 window testing. Building 2272 Unit 101.  5 locations\, exact location
	s TBD at pretest meeting with Benjamin.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 4.5 PSF\, G
	arden Window 4.0 PSF\, French Door Limited Water Test 0.0 PSF 15 mins.\n\n
	 \n\nNote- GC to invite window manufacturer to testing date. All test loca
	tions to have interior air barrier sealant installed\, head flashing in pl
	ace\, & a completed field of WRB surrounding the locations.\n\n \n\nContac
	t- Matthew (McLeod Construction) 206-786-7413\n\n \n\n
