DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654) & Dave Luxmore\n\n \n\nS
	cope- ASTM E1105. 6 Locations at least one of each operator type. Proposed
	 locations below to be confirmed at pretest meeting with Ben Pederson.\n\n
	 \n\nProposed locations- w1.08 XOX Casement/Fixed\, w2.08 Fixed\, w1.07 OX
	 Casement/Fixed\, d2.05 Sliding glass Door\, w5.06 O/X Awning/Fixed & w5.0
	8 OOO Fixed Window.  \n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 4.5 PSF\n\n \n\nNote- GC to i
	nvite window manufacturer to the testing date. There should be a completed
	 field of WRB surrounding the test locations\, interior air barrier sealan
	t in place\, head flashing installed\, a power source (standard outlet)\, 
	a water source\, and interior/exterior access to the test locations.\n\n \
	n\nContact-\n\nDean Gorby | Carrig Construction | C. 425.628.8162 | www.ca
	rrigconstruction.com <http://www.carrigconstruction.com/> \n\n \n\n
