	n\nScope- ASTM E1105 (Procedure B 15 minute cycle). Test locations are AS1
	-001 Fixed/Fixed/Awning (3’4”x 9’)\, AS1-003 Fixed/Fixed/Fixed (3’
	4”x 9’)\, AS2-108 Fixed (3’4” x 3’4”) and AS1-203 4 lite Fixed
	 (6’4” x 8’). \n\n \n\nBenjamin Pederson to confirm the actual test 
	locations are installed and accessible at a pretest meeting to be held dur
	ing one of his upcoming inspection site visits.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 4.5
	 PSF\n\n \n\nNote- GC to invite window installer and /or manufacturer to t
	esting date. GC to ensure all test locations are accessible on the interio
	r and exterior. Higher locations may need a lift to place the spray rack o
	n exterior\, to be confirmed at pretest meeting.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\nRoger
	 Farrens\nMarpac Construction LLC | Superintendent |\n1225 South Weller St
	reet | suite 500 | Seattle\, WA 98144 |\nOffice 206.329.4992 | Direct | Mo
	bile 206-670-8463 |\n\n
