CREATED:20250225T170811Z
DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robbie (425-344-6997) & Chris\n\n \n\nScope- ASTM E1
	105.\n\n4/07- Two ~8’x10’ lower corner sections of curtain wall (Highl
	ighted in Red) and two ~4’x10’ upper corner sections section of curtai
	n wall (Highlighted in Yellow). The entire jamb condition will be tested b
	oth sides of the system after the four tests are completed.\n\n\n\n4/08- T
	wo ~8’x10’ lower corner sections of curtain wall (Highlighted in Red) 
	and two ~4’x10’ upper corner sections section of curtain wall (Highlig
	hted in Yellow). The entire jamb condition will be tested both sides of th
	e system after the four tests are completed.\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\nTest Pressur
	e- 6.0 PSF\n\n \n\nBEE #- 2010-1008\n\n \n\nNote- GC to invite window inst
	aller to the testing date. Scissor lift will be provided on the interior o
	f the test locations for access to the upper locations. A boom lift will b
	e provided on the exterior of the test locations for the spray rack on the
	 upper locations.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\n <http://www.compass-gc.com/> \n\n\n
	\nForrest Martin​​​​\n\nSr. Project Engineer\n\nOffice: 206-320-87
	41 <tel:206-320-8741> \n\n | \n\nCell: 425-765-8719 <tel:425-765-8719> \n\
	n11332 NE 122nd Way Ste. 350\n\n\, \n\nKirkland\, WA\n\n \n\n98034\n\nforr
	est.martin@compass-gc.com <mailto:forrest.martin@compass-gc.com> \n\n | \n
	\nwww.compass-gc.com <http://www.compass-gc.com/> \n\n | \n\n <https://www
	.linkedin.com/company/compass-general-construction/> \n\n <https://www.ins
	tagram.com/compassgc/> \n\n <https://www.facebook.com/compassgc/> \n\n \n\
	n
