DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin (425-595-7654)\, Chris\, Robbie\, Dave\, & Jes
	us \n\n \n\nScope- Building prep & HVAC isolations on a 207-unit building.
	 Seal each units HVAC (bath fans\, range hood\, ac ports\, dryers\, ect.)\
	, shut windows\, turn each unit’s bath fan breakers off\, & seal rooftop
	 HVAC units.\n\n \n\nNote- GC to notify subcontractors and cleaners to not
	 remove isolation materials\, do not open windows\, not to turn breakers o
	n.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\nPatrick Griffin \nAssistant Superintendent \nP: +1 
	(425) 404-1484 | E: patrickg@gencapgc.com <mailto:patrickg@gencapgc.com> \
	n\n \n\n
