DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Dave (425-345-9656) & Jesus \n\n \n\nScope- ASTM E11
	05 testing a fixed\, fixed/awning\, casement\, XO horizontal slider\, XOX 
	horizontal slider\, and a sliding glass door. 6 locations total.\n\n \n\nT
	est Pressure- 4.5 PSF\n\n \n\nNote- GC to invite window manufacturer to th
	e testing date. Windows should be installed to detail with interior air ba
	rrier sealant in place\, a completed field of WRB surrounding the test loc
	ations\, and head flashing installed. Adequate access to the exterior test
	ing areas for the spray rack to be provided by the GC.\n\n \n\nContact- Ky
	le Skow (Intracorp) 206-619-7311\n\n \n\n
