CREATED:20250331T193117Z
DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robbie Smith (425-344-6997) & Jesus Betancourt\n\n \
	n\nScope- ASTM E1105 Water Penetration Resistance Testing. 4 locations on 
	the House.\n\n1 Casement/Fixed combination (Type 1K\, 9’4” x 5’10”
	)\n\n1 section (sill to top of tilt turn\, full width)  of the Tilt Turn/F
	ixed combination ( Type 1N\, 6’9” x ~6’)\n\n1 Awning (Type 1H\, 4’
	5” x 2’8”) (This is above a door)\n\n1 Fixed combination window (Typ
	e 1 Q\, 7’ x 8’9”)\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 4.5 PSF\n\n \n\nNote- All 
	locations should have a completed installation. Water and power source wil
	l be available onsite. GC recommended to invite window manufacturer to the
	 testing date.\n\n \n\nUse the highlighted road to get to the jobsite.\n\n
	 \n\n\n\n \n\nContact-\n\nJared Horrocks\n\nProject Manager/Superintendent
	\n\nTown & Country Homes\n\njared@tandchomes.net <mailto:jared@tandchomes.
	net> \n\n(509) 929-3006\n\n \n\n \n\n
