DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654)\, Chris Shafer\, Robert 
	Smith\, Jesus Betancourt\, & Dave Luxmore\n\n \n\nScope- Air barrier testi
	ng a Residence. BEE will arrive at 8am and begin prepping the building and
	 setting up test equipment\, at 10am all personnel not involved with the t
	est must exit the building for the duration of the testing ~45 mins.\n\n \
	n\nNote- All doors should have gaskets and hardware installed\, all penetr
	ations into the air barrier should be sealed\, water should be in all drai
	ns\, & the building envelope should be completed prior to the testing date
	. All HVAC in the building should be shut off upon BEE’s arrival.\n\n \n
	\nContact- Delton Horst 360-509-3187\n\n \n\n
