DESCRIPTION:Attendees:\n\nBEE Engineers\n\nTorin Garner 425-595-7654 \n\nDa
	ve Luxmore\n\n \n\nScope:\n\nASTM E1105 Window testing on W01 (Fixed/Casem
	ent Combo)\, W03 (Fixed/Casement Combo)\, W05 (Fixed/Casement Combo)\, W06
	 (Fixed)\, W19 (Casement/Casement)\, & a sliding glass door. See attached 
	for window types. Fixed casement combo windows types can be swapped out fo
	r similar if needed.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure:\n\n6.0 PSF\n\n \n\nNote:\n\nGC
	 to invite window manufacturer to testing date. Test locations to have a c
	ompleted field of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing installed\, and int
	erior air barrier sealant in place. No drywall or siding surrounding the t
	est locations.\n\n \n\nOnsite Contact:\n\nKari Brianne\n\nProject Engineer
	\n\n <http://stsconstructionservices.com/> \n\nKariB@stsconst.com <mailto:
	KariB@stsconst.com> \n\n206.439.6343 Office\n\n206.635.8600 Cell \n\n9049 
	20th Ave SW STE A\n\nSeattle\, WA 98106\n\n \n\n \n\n
