DESCRIPTION:Attendees:\n\nBEE Engineers\n\nRobbie Smith 425-344-6997\n\nJes
	us Betancourt\n\n \n\nScope:\n\nASTM E1105 Window testing on 2 horizontal 
	sliders\, 1 fixed window\, 2 sliding glass doors\, & 2 swing doors.\n\n \n
	\nTest Pressure:\n\n4.5 PSF\, 0.00 Limited water test on swing doors if AD
	A/ less than ½” low profile sill (confirm with window rep/look for gold
	 sticker)\n\n \n\nNote:\n\nGC to invite window manufacturer to testing dat
	e. Test locations to have a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, head
	 flashing installed\, and interior air barrier sealant in place. No drywal
	l or siding surrounding the test locations.\n\n \n\nOnsite Contact:\n\nNat
	e Sinner\n\nWindsor Construction Company\n\nOffice: (425) 882-3151\n\nCell
	: (425) 281-8758\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\n
