DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robert Smith (425-344-6997) & Torin\n\n \n\nScope- A
	STM E1105 (Procedure B 15 minute cycle). Test locations are AS1-003 Fixed/
	Fixed/Fixed (3’4”x 9’) [re-test\, inconclusive result from testing o
	n 4/14/25]\, AS2-108 Fixed\, section of curtain wall\, & a Folding Nana Wi
	ndow.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 4.5 PSF\n\n \n\nNote- GC to invite window ins
	taller and /or manufacturer to testing date. GC to ensure all test locatio
	ns are accessible on the interior and exterior. Higher locations may need 
	a lift to place the spray rack on exterior.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\nRoger Farr
	ens\nMarpac Construction LLC | Superintendent |\n1225 South Weller Street 
	| suite 500 | Seattle\, WA 98144 |\nOffice 206.329.4992 | Direct | Mobile 
	206-670-8463 |\n\n \n\n \n\n
