DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin (425-595-7654)\, Chris\, Robbie\, Dave\, & Jes
	us \n\n \n\nScope- Building prep & HVAC isolations on a 288-unit building.
	 Seal each units HVAC (bath fans\, range hood\, ac ports\, dryers\, ect.)\
	, shut windows\, turn each unit’s bath fan breakers off\, and seal rooft
	op HVAC units.\n\n \n\nNote- GC to notify subcontractors and cleaners to n
	ot remove isolation materials\, do not open windows\, not to turn breakers
	 on.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\n \n\n <http://www.compass-gc.com/> \n\n\n\nForres
	t Martin​​​​\n\nSr. Project Engineer\n\nOffice: 206-320-8741 <tel:
	206-320-8741> \n\n | \n\nCell: 425-765-8719 <tel:425-765-8719> \n\n11332 N
	E 122nd Way Ste. 350\n\n\, \n\nKirkland\, WA\n\n \n\n98034\n\nforrest.mart
	in@compass-gc.com <mailto:forrest.martin@compass-gc.com> \n\n | \n\nwww.co
	mpass-gc.com <http://www.compass-gc.com/> \n\n | \n\n <https://www.linkedi
	n.com/company/compass-general-construction/> \n\n <https://www.instagram.c
	om/compassgc/> \n\n <https://www.facebook.com/compassgc/> \n\n \n\n
