CREATED:20250325T192151Z
DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Jesus Garcia & Dave Luxmore (425-345-9656)\n\n \n\nS
	cope: ASTM E1105 testing on 3 Casement Windows and 3 Sliding Glass Doors (
	or amount left on project if less than three).\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 4.5 
	PSF\n\n \n\nNote- GC to invite window manufacturer to the testing date. Th
	ere should be a completed field of WRB surrounding the test locations\, in
	terior air barrier sealant in place\, head flashing installed\, a power so
	urce (standard outlet)\, a water source\, and interior/exterior access to 
	the test locations.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\nDean Gorby | Carrig Construction |
	 C. 425.628.8162 | www.carrigconstruction.com\n\n
