	sp\;</o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal>Note- GC to notify subcontractors and cle
	aners to not remove isolation materials\, to not open windows\, and to not
	 turn breakers on.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p>
	<p class=MsoNormal>Contact-<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><b><span styl
	e='font-family:"Fieldwork 04 Geo Regular"'>Scott Wyatt&nbsp\;</span></b><o
	:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-family:"Fieldwork 04 Geo
	 Regular"'>Project Manager</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><span s
	tyle='font-family:"Fieldwork 04 Geo Regular"'>503.828.8957 Mobile&nbsp\;<o
	:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p
	>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p></div></body></html>
