DESCRIPTION:Attendees: \n\nBEE Engineers\n\nTorin Garner 425-595-7654\n\nCh
	ris Shafer\n\n \n\nScope: \n\nAt this meeting we will discuss the air barr
	ier testing procedure\, building readiness\, power sources for the fans\, 
	building isolations procedure & responsibility\, and the timeline of event
	s as it pertains to the testing. The attached document has most of the ite
	ms we will go over in the meeting.\n\n \n\nNote:\n\n2015 WSEC with C406.9 
	reduced air infiltration credit\, 0.25 CFM/SQFT at 75 Pa allowable per pag
	e G0.04\n\n \n\n \n\nOnsite Contact:\n\n <https://www.baldwingeneral.com/>
	 \n\n
