DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin (425-595-7654) & Dave\n\n \n\nScope- ASTM E110
	5. Retesting the two failed sections of storefront plus three additional. 
	\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 6.0 PSF\n\n \n\nNote- GC to invite the storefront 
	installer to the testing date. All test locations should be installed to d
	etail\, have a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing ins
	talled\, and interior air barrier sealant in place.\n\n \n\nOnsite Contact
	-\n\n \n\nIan Powell\n\nSuperintendent\n\nIanp@stsconst.com <mailto:Ianp@s
