DESCRIPTION:Attendees: \n\nBEE Engineers\n\nRobbie Smith 425-344-6997\n\nJe
	sus Betancourt\n\n \n\nScope: \n\nASTM E1105 Window testing on failed test
	 sample from 5/2/2025\, and up to 3 additional sections if available.\n\n 
	\n\nTest Pressure: \n\n6.0 PSF\n\n \n\nNote: \n\nGC to invite window insta
	ller to testing date. Test locations to have a completed field of WRB surr
	ounding them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barrier sealant 
	in place. No drywall or siding (unless necessary for primary seal) surroun
	ding the test locations.\n\n \n\nOnsite Contact:\n\n  <https://www.baldwin
	general.com/> \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n
