DESCRIPTION:Attendees: BEE Engineers\, Torin Garner 425-595-7654 & Jesus Be
	tancourt\n\n Scope: ASTM E1105. 6 locations\, North elevation. A4 (XOO) Fi
	xed Casement\, A4a (OOX) Fixed/Casement\, B3a (OX) Fixed/Casement\, B6a (O
	X) Fixed Casement\, C2 (O) Fixed\, & a non-ADA (X) Swing Door.\n\n Test Pr
	essure: 6.0 PSF on all products.\n\n Note: GC to invite window manufacture
	r to testing date. Test locations to have a completed field of WRB surroun
	ding them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barrier sealant in 
	place. No drywall or siding surrounding the test locations.\n\n Onsite Con
	tact:\n\nEvan Stewart\n\nAssistant Project Manager\n\nAmerican Home Builde
	rs\, Inc\n\np: 206.794.1248 e: estewart@acg.com <mailto:estewart@acg.com> 
	\n\n \n\n
