	ave Luxmore\n\nScope: \n\nASTM E1105 Window testing on 3 horizontal slider
	s\, 1 fixed window\,  & 2 sliding glass doors.\n\nTest Pressure: \n\n6.0 P
	SF on all products.\n\nNote: GC recommended to invite window manufacturer 
