	ng them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barrier sealant in pl
	ace. No drywall or siding surrounding the test locations.\n\nOnsite Contac
	t:\n\nOscar Salas\nSuperintendent\n\n\nC / 253-508-1069\nE / oscar@acgbuil
	ds.com <mailto:oscar@acgbuilds.com> \n\n	\n\n\n \n\n
