DESCRIPTION:Attendees: BEE Engineers\, Robert Smith 425-344-6997 & Jesus Be
	tancourt\n\n Scope: ASTM E1105 on 5 locations. 2 swing doors\, a tilt turn
	 (B6)\, fixed window (C4)\, & multiple lite fixed window (F4)\n\n Test Pre
	ssure: 6.0 PSF on all products.\n\n Note: GC to invite window manufacturer
	 to testing date. Test locations to have a completed field of WRB surround
	ing them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barrier sealant in p
	lace. No drywall or siding surrounding the test locations.\n\n Onsite Cont
	act:\n\nEvan Stewart\n\nAssistant Project Manager\n\nAmerican Home Builder
	s\, Inc\n\np: 206.794.1248 e: estewart@acg.com <mailto:estewart@acg.com> \
	n\n \n\n
