DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robbie (425-344-6997) & Jesus\n\n Scope- ASTM E1105.
	 Retesting the 2 failed swing doors plus three additional.\n\n Test Pressu
	re- 6.0 PSF\n\n Note- GC to invite window manufacturer to testing date. Al
	l test locations should be installed to detail\, have a completed field of
	 WRB surrounding them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barrier
	 sealant in place.\n\n Onsite Contact-\n\n Ian Powell\, Superintendent\n\n
