	ass=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>Attendee- Torin Garner (425-5
	95-7654)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10
	.5pt'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-si
	ze:10.5pt'>Scope- At this meeting we will discuss the air barrier testing 
	procedure\, building readiness\, power sources for the fans\, building iso
	lations procedure &amp\; responsibility\, and the timeline of events as it
	 pertains to the testing. The attached document has most of the items we w
	ill go over in the meeting. </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt'><o:p></o
	:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p>&nbsp
