	ier testing on 71 unit Apodment Building. BEE arrive onsite at 8am and beg
	in setting up test equipment & propping doors\, testing will begin at 11am
	 at which time all personnel must leave the building for the duration of t
	he testing ~ 1 hour.\n\n \n\nNote- Final Touch will be performing exterior
	 HVAC isolations.\n\n \n\nOnsite Contact- \n\nCameron\n\n206-518-0630\n\n 
	\n\nMike Mcauslan  \n\n206-391-4152\n\n \n\n
