DESCRIPTION:Attendees: BEE Engineers\, Robbie Smith 425-344-6997 Jesus Beta
	ncourt\n\n Scope: ASTM E1105. 3 additional horizontal sliders & 3 addition
	al sliding glass doors will be tested on building 2.\n\n Test Pressure: 4.
	5 PSF.\n\n Note: GC to invite window manufacturer to testing date. Test lo
	cations to have a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing 
	installed\, and interior air barrier sealant in place. No drywall or sidin
	g surrounding the additional test locations.\n\n Onsite Contact:\n\nNate S
	inner\n\nWindsor Construction Company\n\nOffice: (425) 882-3151\n\nCell: (
	425) 281-8758\n\n \n\n
