DESCRIPTION:Attendees: BEE Engineers\, Robbie Smith (425-344-6997) & Jesus 
	Betancourt\n\n Scope: AAMA 502. 4 Casement Windows. (Line 17 & 61 windows 
	PG25 Line 63 & 76 PG35). GC to confirm corresponding Line #s to windows. B
	EE will suspend spray rack from roof deck.\n\n\n\n Test Pressure: PG Ratin
	g with 1/3 reduction per AAMA 502. Line 17 & 61 windows PG25 = 2.50 PSF (0
	.48 INWC) Line 63 & 76 PG35 = 3.06 PSF (0.59 INWC)\n\n Note: GC to invite 
	window manufacturer to testing date. \n\n Onsite Contact:\n\nNathan Parker
	\nVP of Field Operations  <https://i.imgur.com/T6qvN2p.png> \n\n\n(206) 70
	7-1797\nnathan@blackwoodbuilders.com <mailto:nathan@blackwoodbuilders.com>
	 \nwww.blackwoodbuilders.com <http://www.blackwoodbuilders.com>  \n118 SE 
	Everett Mall Way Everett\n\n \n\n \n\n
