DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin (425-595-7654)\, Robbie\, Dave\, & Jesus \n\n 
	\n\nScope- Building prep & HVAC isolations on a 77-unit building. Seal eac
	h units HVAC (bath fans\, range hood\, ac ports\, dryers\, ect.)\, shut wi
	ndows\, turn each unit’s bath fan breakers off\, and seal rooftop HVAC u
	nits.\n\n \n\nNote- GC to notify subcontractors and cleaners to not remove
	 isolation materials\, do not open windows\, not to turn breakers on.\n\n 
	\n\nContact-\n\nLuke Thrasher\n\nProject Manager\n\nLuket@stsconst.com <ma
	ilto:Luket@stsconst.com> \n\nCell (206)-396-7709\n\n \n\n Ian Powell\, Sup
	erintendent\n\nIanp@stsconst.com <mailto:Ianp@stsconst.com> \n\n206.718.44
	07 m\n\n \n\n \n\n
