CREATED:20250806T173931Z
DESCRIPTION:\nAttendees: \n\n\nBEE Engineers\, Dave Luxmore 425-345-9656\, 
	& Jesus Betancourt\n\n\nScope: \n\n\n(3) days of ASTM E1105 Window testing
	. (19) horizontal sliding windows (6-7 windows per day).\n\n\nTest Pressur
	e: \n\n\nWindows = 4.5 PSF.\n\n\nNote: \n\n\nGC recommended to invite wind
	ow manufacturer to testing date. Test locations to have a completed field 
	of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barri
	er sealant in place. No drywall or siding surrounding the test locations.\
	n\n\nOnsite Contact:\n\n\nOscar Salas\nSuperintendent\nC / 253-508-1069\nE
	 / oscar@acgbuilds.com <mailto:oscar@acgbuilds.com> \n\n \n\n
