DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin (425-595-7654)\, Chirs\, Jesus\, & Robbie \n\n
	 \n\nScope- Air barrier testing on an industrial building. BEE will arrive
	 at 7:30am and start setting up test equipment. Testing to take place at 1
