DESCRIPTION:Hello\, The BEE offices are getting their annual carpet and flo
	or cleanings this next Monday and Tuesday\, August 4th and 5th. For ease t
	his year\, we split it into two days.\n\n \n\nThe first day\, Monday Augus
	t 4th\, is the Large Conference Room/Breakroom side of our floor.\n\n \n\n
	The second day\, Tuesday August 5th\, is the Annex side\, with the small c
	onference room\, Testing\, Inspection & Drafting departments.\n\n \n\nWhat
	 you need to do on your side on your day:\n\nALL ITEMS in your workspace/o
	ffice need to be moved up off the floor and placed on your desk or side ta
	bles.  This includes garbage and recycling bins.\n\nEach person is respons
	ible for doing this for their own workspace. If you are out of the office 
	on Monday\, then please do it Friday the 27th before you leave.\n\nImporta
	nt Note: Chairs and chair mats must be moved to one of the following place
	s: \n\nChairs: out in the hallway along one side (do not put in conference
	 rooms)\n\nMats: \n\nOn top of spare desks in your area\n\nthe large confe
	rence room table\n\nthe small conference room table\n\nhallway outside the
	 suite\n\n \n\n*You can mark your chair and chair mat with your name on it
	 to make it easy to distinguish for when you go to put it back. I have mas
	king tape in my office if you want to use that.\n\n \n\n*Managers\, please
	 double check that your team members have done this by end of business day
	 Monday and Tuesday\, depending on your side. \n\n*If you have team member
	s that are on vacation\, you are responsible for moving their items for th
	em.\n\n \n\nThank you for your cooperation.\n\n \n\n \n\n
