DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin (425-595-7654) & Chris\n\n \n\nScope- At this 
	meeting we will discuss the air barrier testing procedure\, building readi
	ness\, power sources for the fans\, building isolations procedure & respon
	sibility\, and the timeline of events as it pertains to the testing. The a
	ttached document has most of the items we will go over in the meeting. \n\
	n \n\nNote- I had some guys out there today to do some ELD testing (it was
	n’t ready) and they did a quick walk around the building and took a few 
	pictures of areas of concern. Pictures are below\, we will want these item
	s completed prior to performing the air barrier testing.\n\n \n\n    \n\nM
	issing door hardware\, gaskets\, and thresholds.\n\n \n\n     \n\nMissing 
	storefront glass in retail areas.\n\n \n\n\n\nUnfinished opening in the bu
	ilding.\n\n \n\n\n\nMissing Glass.\n\n \n\n\n\nMissing glass.\n\n \n\nCont
