	l><span style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class=Mso
	Normal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>Scope- At this meeting we will discu
	ss the air barrier testing procedure\, building readiness\, power sources 
	for the fans\, building isolations procedure &amp\; responsibility\, and t
	he timeline of events as it pertains to the testing. The attached document
	 has most of the items we will go over in the meeting. <o:p></o:p></span><
	/p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></s
	pan></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>Note- I had some
	 guys out there today to do some ELD testing (it wasn&#8217\;t ready) and 
	they did a quick walk around the building and took a few pictures of areas
	 of concern. Pictures are below\, we will want these items completed prior
	 to performing the air barrier testing.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoN
