DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin (425-595-7654)\, Jesus\, Dave\, Robbie & Chris
	\n\nScope- 2018 WSEC\, ASTM E779 Air barrier testing on a 165-unit Hotel. 
	BEE will arrive onsite at 7:30am and begin setting up test equipment & com
	plete prepping the building (propping doors\, shutting windows\, sealing r
	ooftop HVAC\, ect). Testing will begin at 2pm at which time all personnel 
	not directly involved with the testing must leave the building for the dur
	ation of the test ~ 1.5 hours.\n\nNote- All storefront glass & exterior do
	ors\, hardware\, gaskets\, sweeps\, and thresholds to be installed prior t
	o the testing date. Missing rooftop windows to be temporarily sealed off (
	plywood\, tape\, spray foam) prior to the testing date by the GC if needed
	.\n\nContacts-\n\nRyan Hogan | Project Manager \nSIERRA CONSTRUCTION COMPA
	NY\, INC.\np. 425-487-5200 | c. 206-579-7348 | www.sierraind.com <https://
