DESCRIPTION:Attendees: \n\nBEE Engineers\, Dave Luxmore 425-345-9656\, & Je
	sus Betancourt\n\nScope: \n\nASTM E1105 Window testing. Retest the failed 
	fixed window and test 3 additional fixed windows.\n\nTest Pressure: \n\nWi
	ndows = 4.5 PSF.\n\nNote: \n\nGC recommended to invite window manufacturer
	 to testing date. Test locations to have a completed field of WRB surround
	ing them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barrier sealant in p
	lace. No drywall or siding surrounding the test locations.\n\nOnsite Conta
	ct:\n\nOscar Salas\nSuperintendent\n\n\nC / 253-508-1069\nE / oscar@acgbui
	lds.com <mailto:oscar@acgbuilds.com> \n\n \n\n \n\n
