DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin (425-595-7654) & Chris\n\n \n\nScope- At this 
	meeting we will discuss the air barrier testing procedure\, building readi
	ness\, power sources for the fans\, building isolations/prep procedure & r
	esponsibility (Sealing HVAC\, propping doors\, shutting exterior windows &
	 doors\, ect.)\, and the timeline of events as it pertains to the testing.
	 The attached document has most of the items we will go over in the meetin
	g. \n\n \n\nContact- \n\n <http://www.srmdevelopment.com/> \n\n \n\nJames 
	Wilkins\nGeneral Superintendent\nM:   (425) 772-0107\n\nJobsite: 14343 15t
	h Ave. NE\, Seattle\, WA 98125\n\nMain Office: 111 N. Post Street\, Ste. 2
	00\, Spokane\, WA 99201\n\n \n\n
