DESCRIPTION:\nAttendees:\n\n\nBEE Engineers\, Dave Luxmore 425-345-9656\, &
	 Jesus Betancourt.\n\n\nScope: \n\n\nASTM E1105 Re-testing on mockup windo
	w installation after product failure recorded on test date 7/16/2025.\n\n8
	’ x 6’10”\, REHAU System 4500 Tilt-turn\, Dual-action window\, XO/OO
	\n\n\nTest Pressure: \n\n\n6.0 PSF\n\nNote: \n\nGC recommended to invite w
	indow manufacturer to testing date. Test location to have a completed fiel
	d of WRB surrounding it\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barri
	er sealant in place.\n\n\nOnsite Contact:\n\n\nYoung Kim\n\nProject Manage
	r\n\nShelter Holdings\, LLC\n\n11624 SE 5th Street\, Suite 210\n\nBellevue
	\, WA 98005\n\n425-941-5772\n\n \n\n \n\n
