CREATED:20250730T160554Z
DESCRIPTION:Hello Everyone\,\n\nBEE is hosting our annual Summer Potluck BB
	Q for BEE Employees and their families.\n\n \n\nThis is a potluck event…
	so whip up your favorite side dish\, grab your favorite chips or a special
	 dessert\, and share them with the group.\n\n \n\nLike last year\, please 
	be prepared to take home whatever you bring.  We are not taking leftovers 
	back to the office.\n\n*Or you can choose to bring it in a disposable cont
	ainer so that if you do have to leave early\, people can still enjoy it\, 
	and when it gets tossed then you won’t miss it. 😊\n\n \n\n*Pretty p
	lease\, if anyone has a portable grill\, we could really use a second one 
	this time!!! We have a lot of mouths to feed!\n\n \n\nBEE will be providin
	g:\n\nHamburgers and buns\n\nHot dogs and buns\n\nSliced Cheese\n\nSliced 
	Tomatoes\n\nCondiments\n\nPlates\, napkins\, utensils\n\nPlenty of Bottled
	 water\n\n \n\nHere are some suggestions potluck items you can bring:\n\nM
	acaroni Salad\n\nPotato Salad\n\nPea Salad\n\nPasta salad\n\nCorn on the c
	ob\n\nChips and Dip\n\nVeggie tray\n\nFruit Tray\n\nCheese and meat tray\n
	\nPigs in a blanket\n\nBeans\n\nDESSERTS!!! Cookies\, Brownies\, Cupcakes\
	, Rice Krispie Treats\n\nA cooler full of ice cream treats/bars/popsicles!
	\n\nCrockpot full of meatballs\n\n \n\nThe Edmonds Park has a fantastic Sp
	lash Pad for kids of all ages\, so bring swimsuits and towels too.\n\n \n\
	nThe Edmonds Park is located across Edmonds Way/104 and up just a little f
	rom our business park at:\n\n600 3rd Ave S\n\nEdmonds\, WA\n\nShelter #3\n
	\n \n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20250815T200000
DTSTAMP:20250414T222743Z
