	a3nEAjtCxQw3mdWGRBKIuCmQzGScI&e=> \n2515 Willows RD NE #125 | Kirkland\, W
	A 98034\n\n \n\n Tom Vasilatos \n\nDevelopment Manager / Member\n\n\n\n \n
	\n \n\n2 fixed & 2 SGD\n\n2/3 lab rating\n\nTom & Ryan\n\n
