DESCRIPTION:\nAttendees: \n\n\nBEE Engineers\, Robert Smith 425-344-6997\, 
	Chris Shafer\, & Jesus Betancourt\n\n\nScope: \n\n\nASTM E1105 Window Wate
	r Penetration Resistance Testing. 9 locations total.\n\nUnit 239: W1\, W9\
	, two W3 & an outswing patio door.\n\nUnit 240: W2\, W8\, & an outswing pa
	tio door.\n\nSouth Hallway: W5\n\n\n\n\nTest Pressure: \n\n\n6.0 PSF.\n\n\
	nNote: \n\n\nGC recommended to invite window manufacturer to testing date.
	 Test locations to have a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, head f
	lashing installed\, and interior air barrier sealant in place. No drywall 
	or siding surrounding the test locations.\n\nONSITE CONTACT: Gary Rush (66
	1)-444-0662\n\n
