	2) Sliding Glass Doors (SD01)\n\n(2) X/O Casement Windows (W5 & W2)\n\n(1)
	 OX/O Casement Window (W1)\n\n(2) Fixed Windows (W39 & W44) \n\n \n\nTEST 
	PRESSURE:\n\n6.00 PSF.\n\n \n\nNote: GC to invite window manufacturer to t
	esting date. Test locations to have a completed field of WRB surrounding t
	hem\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barrier sealant in place.
	 No drywall or siding surrounding the additional test locations.\n\n \n\nO
	NSITE CONTACT:\n\nJacob Treen\n\nProject Engineer\n\nCell: 253.886.3068\n\
