	pe- ASTM-E779. Air barrier testing a senior living addition. BEE will arri
	ve onsite at 7:30am and begin setting up test equipment and sealing off th
	e HVAC\, testing will begin at Noon at which time all personnel must leave
	 the building for the duration of the testing ~ 1.5 hours.\n\n \n\nNote- G
	C to have all P traps primed with water\, temporary walls built separating
	 the existing from new building\, & a lift available to apply & remove the
	 exterior plastic sealing the units HVAC.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\nTrent Gray\,
	 Assoc. DBIA\n\nProject Manager\n\n \n\n\n​​www.bayley.net <http://www
	.bayley.net/> \n\nP: (206) 621-8884    C: (509) 202-5931    F: (206) 343-7
	728\n\n \n\n
