DESCRIPTION:\nAttendee(s):\n\nRobbie Smith\n\nBEE Engineers\n\n425-344-6997
	\n\nJesus Garcia\n\nBEE Engineers\n\n425-900-3793\n\n\nScope:\n\n\nASTM E1
	105 - 3 Casements (one with brake metal field mullion)\, 2 Sliding Glass D
	oors\, 1 Awning & 1 Fixed (4 lite).\n\nTest pressure: 6.0 PSF\n\nPressure 
	Cycles: 4 (5 minutes of static pressure with 1 minute of ambient pressure 
	between)\n\n\nNote:\n\n\nGC to invite window manufacturer (VPI) to testing
	 date. All test locations should be installed to detail and have interior 
	air barrier sealant in place.\n\n\nContact:\n\n	\nDan Scheffer\n​​​
	​\nExxel Pacific\, Inc.\n	\nSenior Building Envelope Foreman\nPrimary: (
	360) 410-1508\nOffice: (425) 230-5698\n\n
