	\n\n \n\nScope- ASTM E779 Air Barrier Testing\, 2018 WSEC. 24-unit apartme
	nt building & a clubhouse. BEE will arrive onsite at 8am and begin preppin
	g the building and setting up test equipment. Clubhouse & Building 10 to b
	e clear of all personnel not involved with the testing upon BEE’s arriva
	l until the completion of the test. \n\n \n\nContact- Nate Sinner\n\nWinds
	or Construction Company\n\nOffice: (425) 882-3151\n\nCell: (425) 281-8758\
