DESCRIPTION:\nAttendees: \n\n\nBEE Engineers\, Dave Luxmore 425-345-9656\, 
	& Jesus Betancourt\n\n\nScope: \n\n\nASTM E1105 Window testing. Retest pre
	viously failed horizontal sliding windows (marked in red). Target 6-7 wind
	ows per day.\n\n\n\n\nTest Pressure: \n\n\n4.5 PSF.\n\n\nNote: \n\n\nTest 
	locations to have a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, head flashin
	g installed\, and interior air barrier sealant in place. \n\n\nOnsite Cont
	act:\n\n\nOscar Salas\nSuperintendent\nC / 253-508-1069\nE / oscar@acgbuil
	ds.com <mailto:oscar@acgbuilds.com> \n\n \n\n \n\n
