	cope- ASTM E1105 testing 6 Milgard windows. 1 type W\, 1 type X\, 1 Type Y
	 or Z\, 2 type N (upper levels)\, & 1 type BB or AA.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure
	- 4.0 PSF\, 2.5 PSF on Types Z & N.\n\n \n\nNote- GC to invite window manu
	facturer to testing date. Test locations should have a completed field of 
	WRB surrounding them\, interior air barrier sealant in place\, & head flas
	hing installed. No drywall or siding surrounding the test locations.\n\n \
	n\nBEE Project Number- 2210-1001\n\n \n\nContact- \n\nChristina Wilson\n\n
