DESCRIPTION:\nAttendees: \n\n\nBEE Engineers\, Robert Smith 425-344-6997 & 
	Torin Garner\n\n\nScope: \n\n\nASTM E1105 Window Water Penetration Resista
	nce Testing. Retest the 6 failed locations. Additional locations to be tes
	ted as time allows.\n\nUnit 239: W1\, W3 & an outswing patio door.\n\nUnit
	 240: W3\, & an outswing patio door.\n\nSouth Hallway: W5\n\n\n\n\nTest Pr
	essure: \n\n\n5.25 PSF.\n\n\nNote: \n\n\nGC recommended to invite window m
	anufacturer to testing date. Test locations to have a completed field of W
	RB surrounding them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barrier s
	ealant in place. No drywall or siding surrounding the test locations.\n\nO
	NSITE CONTACT: Gary Rush (661)-444-0662\n\n \n\n
