	n\nScope- ASTM E1105 testing 5 Milgard windows on L5. 1 type N\, 1 type J 
	or K\, & 1 type D or T\, 1 type C\, & 1 type H or G. Some locations may re
	quire suspending the spray rack from the roof or use of pump jacks\, bring
	 harnesses.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 4.0 PSF\, 2.5 PSF on Types Z & N.\n\n \
	n\nNote- GC to invite window manufacturer to testing date. Test locations 
	should have a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, interior air barri
	er sealant in place\, & head flashing installed. No drywall or siding surr
	ounding the test locations.\n\n \n\nBEE Project Number- 2210-1001\n\n \n\n
	Contact- \n\nChristina Wilson\n\n​​​​\n\nExxel Pacific\, Inc.\n\n	
