DESCRIPTION:\nAttendees: \n\n\nBEE Engineers\, Dave Luxmore 425-345-9656\, 
	& Jesus Betancourt\n\n\nScope: \n\n\nASTM E1105 Window testing. Retest pre
	viously failed horizontal sliding windows (marked in red) & additional win
	dows. Target 6-7 windows per day.\n\n\n\n\nTest Pressure: \n\n\n4.5 PSF.\n
	\n\nNote: \n\n\nTest locations to have a completed field of WRB surroundin
	g them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barrier sealant in pla
	ce. \n\n\nOnsite Contact:\n\n\nOscar Salas\nSuperintendent\nC / 253-508-10
	69\nE / oscar@acgbuilds.com <mailto:oscar@acgbuilds.com> \n\n \n\n \n\n \n
	\n
