DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robert Smith (425-344-6997) & Torin Garner\n\n \n\nS
	cope- ASTM E1105 testing 5 Ply Gem windows. 1 type H horizontal slider\, 1
	 type G1 horizontal slider\, & 1 type D1 casement\, 1 type D2 casement\, &
	 1 type F fixed window. \n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 2/3 of rated test pressure
	. \n\nType D1 & D2 Casements DP40 = 4.00 PSF\n\nType G Horizontal Slider D
	P35 = 3.50 PSF\n\nType F Fixed Window DP 35 =3.50 PSF\n\nType H Horizontal
	 Slider Unrated = 1.90 PSF\n\n \n\nNote- GC to invite window manufacturer 
	to testing date. Test locations should have a completed field of WRB surro
	unding them\, interior air barrier sealant in place\, & head flashing inst
	alled. No drywall surrounding the perimeter of the test locations.\n\n \n\
	nContact- \n\nWill Felix – Assistant Superintendent\n\n(425) 891-3449  I
	  will@olsenanderson.com <mailto:%20will@olsenanderson.com> \n\n\n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20250926T153000
