DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654) & Robert Smith\n\n Scope
	- ASTM E1105. Test 1 W02.1B fixed/awning\, 1 W01A casement/fixed\, 1 W03 f
	ixed\, 1 W04A casement\, & 1 UX01L swing door. 5 locations total. See atta
	ched for proposed locations.\n\nTest Pressure- Windows & Swing Doors = 8.0
	7 PSF\, Sliding Glass Doors = 3.06 PSF.\n\n Note- GC to invite window manu
	facturer to this testing date. Please ensure all testing locations are ins
	talled to detail.\n\n Contacts-\n\n	Adam Hissong\n\n | \n\nSenior Superint
	endent\n\n​​​​\n\n \n\n \n\n224-760- 2186 <tel:224-760-%202186>  m
	obile\n\n \n\n	Steve Black\n\n | \n\nQuality Support Director\, BD+C\n\n
	​​​​\n\n \n\n \n\n847-217-1725 <tel:847-217-1725>  mobile\n\n \n\n
