	-US link="#0563C1" vlink="#954F72" style='word-wrap:break-word'><div class
	=WordSection1><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>Attendees-
	 Torin (425-595-7654)\, Robbie\, Chris\, Dave\, &amp\; Jesus</span><span s
	tyle='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span sty
	le='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><spa
	n style='font-size:10.5pt'>Scope- ASTM E779 Air Barrier Testing\, 2018 WSE
	C. 9-unit townhome. BEE will arrive onsite at 8am and begin prepping the b
	uilding and setting up test equipment. Building 1 to be clear of all perso
	nnel not involved with the testing upon BEE&#8217\;s arrival. Testing to b
	egin at 10am\, the duration of the testing is about 1 hour.<o:p></o:p></sp
	an></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p
	></span></p><p class=xxmsonormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt\;font-famil
	y:"Calibri"\,sans-serif'>Contact- Kyle Skow (Intracorp) 206-619-7311</span
	><o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p>&nb
	sp\;</o:p></span></p></div></body></html>
