DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654)\, Robbie Smith\, & Jesus
	 Betancourt\n\n \n\nScope- ASTM E779 air barrier testing in accordance wit
	h 2018 WSEC (credit applied\, 1.5 ACH at 50 Pa allowable) BEE will arrive 
	onsite at 9am and begin prepping the building and setting up the test equi
	pment. At 11 am all personnel not involved with the testing must exit the 
	building for the duration of the testing ~ 1 hour.\n\n \n\nNote- All drain
	 p-traps to be filled with water. All HVAC to be turned off in the buildin
	g upon BEE’s arrival.\n\n \n\nUse the highlighted road to get to the job
	site.\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\nContact-\n\nJared Horrocks\n\nProject Manager\n\nTo
	wn & Country Homes\n\n1 (509) 929-3006\n\njared@tandchomes.net <mailto:jar
	ed@tandchomes.net> \n\n \n\n
