	"#0563C1" vlink="#954F72" style='word-wrap:break-word'><div class=WordSect
	ion1><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>Attendees- Torin (4
	25-595-7654) &amp\; Chris</span><span style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p>
	</span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p>&nbsp\;<
	/o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>Scope- A
	t this meeting we will discuss the air barrier testing procedure\, buildin
	g readiness\, power sources for the fans\, building isolations procedure &
	amp\; responsibility\, and the timeline of events as it pertains to the te
	sting. The attached document has most of the items we will go over in the 
	meeting. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:1
	0.5pt'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-s
	ize:11.0pt'>Contact- </span><b><span style='color:#262626'>Dean Gorby</spa
	n></b><span style='color:#1F497D'> </span><span style='color:#767171'>| </
	span><span style='color:#76923C'>Carrig Construction</span><span style='co
	lor:#1F497D'> </span><span style='color:#767171'>| C. 425.628.8162</span><
	span style='color:#1F497D'> |</span><span style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></
	o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:11.0pt'><o:p>&nbs
	p\;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p
	>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p></div></body></html>
