DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robert Smith (425-344-6997) & Jesus Betancourt\n\n \
	n\nScope- 3 tilt turn/ fixed windows\, 1 fixed window\, & 3 swing doors.\n
	\n \n\nTest Pressure- 4.5 PSF \n\n \n\nNote- GC recommended to invite wind
	ow installer to testing date. Test locations to have interior air barrier 
	sealant in place. No drywall surrounding the interior & no siding surround
	ing the exterior of the test locations.\n\n \n\nContact- \n\nLars Swenson 
	| Assistant Superintendent 206.218.3896\n\nJim Arnett | Senior Superintend
	ent 775.315.3824 \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n
