CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20251002T135502Z
DESCRIPTION:BEE Attendees- Dave Luxmore (425-345-9656) & Torin Garner\n\n \
	n\nScope- ASTM E1105 testing on two fixed windows & a horizontal slider. \
	n\n \n\nTest Pressure- Start at AAMA test minimum of 1.9 PSF (PG15 equival
	ent) if it passes then increase 2/3 of lab rated test pressure (See Below)
	.\n\nFixed Window (CW-PG40 = 8.0 PSF) = 5.33 PSF with 1/3 field reduction\
	n\nHorizontal Slider (LC-PG35 = 5.25PSF) =3.5 PSF with 1/3 field reduction
	\n\n \n\nNote- CW class products lab water penetration resistance test pre
	ssure is 20% PG rating. LC class products lab water penetration resistance
	 test pressure is 15% PG rating. Ratings based off gold AAMA labels on pro
	ducts. Window submittals or a different form of confirming the ratings may
	 change the field test pressures if necessary.\n\n \n\nContacts-\n\nWinson
	 Lam\n\nProject Manager\n\nRainier Building Envelope Consulting\, Inc.\n\n
	206-890-7888\n\n \n\nChris Shafer\, FAPC\n\nTesting Manager | BEE Engineer
	s\nD: 425-678-1728 | C: 425-599-8766 | O: 425-672-3900\n170 W Dayton Stree
	t\, Suite 206\, Edmonds\, WA 98020 <https://www.google.com/maps/place/170+
	W+Dayton+St\,+Edmonds\,+WA+98020/@47.8085673\,-122.3882839\,17z/data=!3m1!
	4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x54901af8f68aa96b:0x8113ceb696fa93b4!8m2!3d47.8085673!4d-12
	2.3857036!16s%2Fg%2F11bw414gj4?entry=ttu> \n\n \n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20251030T140000
DTSTAMP:20251029T191718Z
