DESCRIPTION:Attendees: \n\nBEE Engineers\, Dave Luxmore 425-345-9656\, & Je
	sus Betancourt\n\nScope: \n\nASTM E1105 Window testing on 3 horizontal sli
	ders\, 1 fixed window\, & 2 sliding glass doors.\n\nTest Pressure: \n\n4.5
	 PSF.\n\nNote: GC recommended to invite window manufacturer to testing dat
	e. Test locations to have a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, head
	 flashing installed\, and interior air barrier sealant in place. No drywal
	l or siding surrounding the test locations.\n\nOnsite Contact:\n\nOscar Sa
	las\nSuperintendent\nC / 253-508-1069\nE / oscar@acgbuilds.com <mailto:osc
	ar@acgbuilds.com> \n\n \n\n
