DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robert Smith (425-344-6997)\, Chris Shafer\, & Jesus
	 Betancourt\n\nScope- ASTM E1105. 3 locations in building 1 & 3 locations 
	in building 3. Potential product types XOX HS\, SGD\, XO HS\, & fixed wind
	ow.  Specific types & locations TBD at pretest meeting once access and rea
	diness are confirmed. Will update prior to testing date.\n\nTest Pressure-
	 4 PSF for all products per Telmans approval via email on 10/21. \n\n Note
	- GC to invite window manufacturer to this testing date. Test locations to
	 have a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing installed\
	, and interior air barrier sealant in place. It is preferred that do drywa
	ll or siding surround the test locations if possible.\n\n Contacts-\n\nTod
	d Rankin | Sr. Construction Manager\n\ndir 206.728.6515 | cel 206.854.3944
	 | fax 206.625.9133\n\n411 1st Avenue South\, Suite 650 | Seattle WA  9810
	4 | IntracorpHomes.com <https://linkprotect.cudasvc.com/url?a=http%3a%2f%2
	fwww.intracorphomes.com%2f&c=E\,1\,Fs_W3uCsqXPxu7Fm-7NDbdD5Y6KYn-YN6fCw6zL
	C7BFmby8PXdurJQKzLylVUsv0SvPXZqdIPhrzc9oJ5FSAE_kPu_vsG558Gonjdw58&typo=1> 
	 \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n
