DESCRIPTION:\nAttendees: \n\n\nBEE Engineers\, Robbie Smith 425-344-6997\, 
	& Jesus Betancourt\n\n\nScope: \n\n\nASTM E1105 Window testing. 1 fixed\, 
	1 awning\, 1 casement\, & 1 swing door.\n\n\nTest PressureS: \n\n\n6.0 PSF
	 for storefronts\n\n3.0 PSF for outswing doors\n\n4.5 PSF for sliding glas
	s doors and windows\n\n\nNote: \n\n\nTest locations to have a completed fi
	eld of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air b
	arrier sealant in place. \n\n\nOnsite Contact:\n\n\nTony Abbott\n\nSUPERIN
	TENDENT\n\n775-302-0015\n\ntony@cajames.com <mailto:tony@cajames.com> \n\n
	 \n\n
