	is \n\n \n\nScope- ASTM-E779. Air barrier testing. BEE will arrive onsite 
	at 8am and begin setting up test equipment\, testing will begin at Noon at
	 which time all personnel must leave the building for the duration of the 
	testing ~ 1-2 hours.\n\n \n\nNote- GC to open elevator shaft on L1 commerc
	ial space and the floor above with the car parked on L3 to allow airflow t
	o the commercial space from the building.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\nOscar Salas\
	nSuperintendent\nC / 253-508-1069\nE / oscar@acgbuilds.com <mailto:oscar@a
	cgbuilds.com> \n\n \n\n
