DESCRIPTION:\nAttendees: \n\n\nBEE Engineers\, Robbie Smith 425-344-6997\, 
	& Dave Luxmore\n\n\nScope: \n\n\nASTM E1105 Window testing. 4 sections of 
	storefront ~10’ x 10’ & retesting the failed sliding glass door.\n\n\n
	Test PressureS: \n\n\n6.0 PSF for storefronts\n\n4.5 PSF for sliding glass
	 doors\n\n\nNote: \n\n\nTest locations to have a completed field of WRB su
	rrounding them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barrier sealan
	t in place. \n\n\nOnsite Contact:\n\n\nOscar Salas\nSuperintendent\nC / 25
	3-508-1069\nE / oscar@acgbuilds.com <mailto:oscar@acgbuilds.com> \n\n \n\n
