CREATED:20251013T210914Z
DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin (425-595-7654)\, Robbie\, Dave\, Jesus\, & Chr
	is \n\n \n\nScope- ASTM-E779. Air barrier testing a 271-unit building. BEE
	 will arrive onsite at 7:30am and begin setting up test equipment\, testin
	g will begin at Noon at which time all personnel must leave the building f
	or the duration of the testing ~ 1-2 hours.\n\n \n\nNote- GC to notify Sub
	contractors to not remove the blue plastic covering the HVAC or turn break
	ers on while HVAC is covered. All exterior doors must be installed with ha
	rdware\, gaskets\, and thresholds. All storefronts to be completed with al
	l glass\, gaskets\, and sealants in place. All demising walls that separat
	e conditioned from non-conditioned areas must be completed. Water must be 
	in all drain P-traps to avoid excessive air leakage from the sewers. Pleas
	e let BEE know if you need to reschedule this testing as soon as possible.
	\n\n \n\nContact-\n\nRiley Martin\n\nSuperintendent\n\n <http://stsconstru
	ctionservices.com/> \n\nRileyM@stsconst.com <mailto:RileyM@stsconst.com> \
	n\n206.775.9887 Cell\n\n206.439.6343 Office\n\n \n\n
