DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654) & Chris Shafer\n\n \n\nS
	cope- Air barrier testing a Taco Bell. BEE will arrive at 930am and begin 
	prepping the building and setting up test equipment\, at 1030am all person
	nel not involved with the test must exit the building for the duration of 
	the testing ~45 mins.\n\n \n\nNote- All doors should have gaskets and hard
	ware installed\, all penetrations into the air barrier should be sealed\, 
	water should be in all drains\, & the building envelope should be complete
	d prior to the testing date.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\nBill Robison - Superinten
	dent\n\nCell:    720-205-3880\n\nBill.Robison@KugelConstruction.com <mailt
	o:Bill.Robison@KugelConstruction.com>  \n\n \n\n
