	" content="text/html\; charset=us-ascii">\n</head>\n<body>\n<p class="MsoN
	ormal">Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654) &amp\; Chris Shafer</p>\n<p 
	class="MsoNormal">&nbsp\;</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">Scope- Air barrier tes
	ting a Taco Bell. BEE will arrive at 930am and begin prepping the building
	 and setting up test equipment\, at 1030am all personnel not involved with
	 the test must exit the building for the duration of the testing ~45\n min
	s.</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp\;</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">Note- All d
	oors should have gaskets and hardware installed\, all penetrations into th
	e air barrier should be sealed\, water should be in all drains\, &amp\; th
	e building envelope should be completed prior to the testing date.</p>\n<p
	 class="MsoNormal">&nbsp\;</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">Contact-</p>\n<p clas
	s="MsoNormal"><b>Bill Robison </b>- Superintendent</p>\n<p class="MsoNorma
	l">Cell: &nbsp\; &nbsp\;720-205-3880</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span style
	="color: blue\; background-color: white\;"><a href="mailto:Bill.Robison@Ku
	gelConstruction.com" style="margin-top: 0px\; margin-bottom: 0px\;">Bill.R
	obison@KugelConstruction.com</a></span>&nbsp\;</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">&
	nbsp\;</p>\n</body>\n</html>\n
