DESCRIPTION:ATTENDEES: \n\nBEE Engineers\, Robbie Smith 425-344-6997 Jesus 
	Betancourt\n\n \n\nSCOPE:\n\nASTM E1105\, Retest failed sliding glass door
	 (SD01) in unit 209 & three additional sliding glass doors. See attached.\
	n\n \n\nTEST PRESSURE:\n\n6.00 PSF.\n\n \n\nNote: GC to invite window manu
	facturer to testing date. Test locations to have a completed field of WRB 
	surrounding them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barrier seal
	ant in place. No drywall or siding surrounding the additional test locatio
	ns.\n\n \n\nONSITE CONTACT:\n\nIssac Lazaro 253-221-5237\n\n
