DESCRIPTION:Attendees: BEE Engineers\, Robert Smith 425-344-6997\, Torin Ga
	rner\, & Jesus Betancourt\n\n Scope: ASTM E1105. Retest failed section of 
	storefront\, two remaining sections from initial scope\, & 3 additional ~1
	0’x10’ sections of storefront (similar to failed section). 6 locations
	 total.\n\n Test Pressure: 6.0 PSF.\n\n Note: GC to invite window manufact
	urer to testing date. Test locations to have a completed field of WRB surr
	ounding them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barrier sealant 
	in place. No drywall or siding surrounding the test locations.\n\n Onsite 
	Contact:\n\nRiley Martin\n\nSuperintendent\n\n <http://stsconstructionserv
	ices.com/> \n\nRileyM@stsconst.com <mailto:RileyM@stsconst.com> \n\n206.77
	5.9887 Cell\n\n206.439.6343 Office\n\n \n\n
