CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20251022T230434Z
DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654) & Chris Shafer\n\n \n\nS
	cope- Air barrier testing a Taco Bell. BEE will arrive at 9am and begin pr
	epping the building and setting up test equipment\, at 10:30am all personn
	el not involved with the test must exit the building for the duration of t
	he testing ~45 mins.\n\n \n\nNote- All doors should have gaskets and hardw
	are installed\, all penetrations into the air barrier should be sealed\, w
	ater should be in all drains\, & the building envelope should be completed
	 prior to the testing date.\n\n \n\nContact- Eric Boyd 360-827-3590\n\n \n
	\n
