X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html>\n<head>\n<meta http-equiv="Content-Type
	" content="text/html\; charset=us-ascii">\n</head>\n<body>\n<p class="MsoN
	ormal">Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654) &amp\; Chris Shafer</p>\n<p 
	class="MsoNormal">&nbsp\;</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">Scope- Air barrier tes
	ting a Taco Bell. BEE will arrive at 9am and begin prepping the building a
	nd setting up test equipment\, at 10:30am all personnel not involved with 
	the test must exit the building for the duration of the testing ~45\n mins
	.</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp\;</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">Note- All do
	ors should have gaskets and hardware installed\, all penetrations into the
	 air barrier should be sealed\, water should be in all drains\, &amp\; the
	 building envelope should be completed prior to the testing date.</p>\n<p 
	class="MsoNormal">&nbsp\;</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">Contact- Eric Boyd 360
	-827-3590</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp\;</p>\n</body>\n</html>\n
