DESCRIPTION:Attendees: BEE Engineers\, Dave Luxmore (425-345-9656)\, David 
	Chapman & Jesus Betancourt\n\nScope: Building Envelope Assessment & ASTM E
	1105 Window Testing. Test locations TBD depending on Tenant unit access\, 
	2-3 locations total for the day depending on time and access.\n\nTest Pres
	sure: Start at 0.00 PSF and test until it fails up to 6.0 PSF as follows\;
	 0.00 PSF (15 Mins)\, 2.86 PSF\, 3.0 PSF\, 3.75 PSF\, 4.5 PSF\, 5.25 PSF\,
	 & 6.00 PSF\n\nNote: Client to notify Tenants of entry to units in advance
	 of the testing date\, L1 units preferred. Areas on the interior of the un
	its must be free and clear of furniture and objects 4’ around the window
	s.\n\nBEE Project #: 2510-1020\n\nOnsite Contact:\n\nShawna Sandmire  ssan
	dmire@peninsulapha.org <mailto:ssandmire@peninsulapha.org> \n\nOffice phon
	e 360-374-5604 x212\n\nCell phone 425-321-7604\n\n \n\n
