DESCRIPTION:Attendees: BEE Engineers\, Robert Smith (425-344-6997) & Jesus 
	Betancourt\n\nScope: ASTM E1105. 5 windows\, see pictures below. The last 
	2 pictures we will be testing the lower center windows.\n\nTest Pressure: 
	TBD\, based off direction of window manufacturer for warranty or 2/3  the 
	rating of the products. \n\nNote: Homeowner to invite window manufacturer 
	to testing date. No drywall surrounding the perimeter of the test location
	s (jamb liners\, sill\, and drywall along the head of the window. 3” fro
	m the face of the window to see interior installation).\n\nOnsite Contact:
	 Gerry Zacher 253-380-5615\n\n \n\n     \n\n \n\n\n\n
