DESCRIPTION:Attendees: BEE Engineers\, Robert Smith (425-344-6997) & Jesus 
	Betancourt\n\nScope: ASTM E1105. Swing Door & Fixed Window in unit 414. Sl
	iding Glass Door & Casement/Fixed in unit 408. 4 locations total.\n\nTest 
	Pressure: 2/3 of DP\, not less than 6.0 PSF. Ratings to be confirmed onsit
	e via labels & VPI Rep as they were not included on the window submittal. 
	\n\nNote: GC to invite window manufacturer to testing date. Test locations
	 to have a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing install
	ed\, and interior air barrier sealant in place. No drywall or siding surro
	unding the test locations.\n\nBEE Project #: 2103-1017\n\nOnsite Contacts:
	\n\nPhillip Landress\n\n	\nSenior Building Envelope Foreman\n\n523 Hilltop
	 Jobsite\n\n523 15th Ave E\n\nSeattle\n\n\, \n\nWA\n\n \n\n98118\n\nPrimar
	y: (206) 854-4865 <tel:(206)%20854-4865> \n\n \n\nAlex Grage\n\n​​​
	​\n\nExxel Pacific\, Inc.\n\n	\nSenior Superintendent\n\nPrimary: (206) 
	499-9900 <tel:(206)%20499-9900> \n\nOffice: (425) 230-5698 <tel:(425)%2023
	0-5698> \n\n	\n\n \n\n
