BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20251118T225523Z
DESCRIPTION:Hello\, \nPlease RSVP as soon as possible if you haven’t alre
	ady. Our final headcount will be due very soon.\n*Also\, please be sure em
	ail me your food restrictions/meal requirements right away as I need to ge
	t our menu into the venue.\n \nYou’re invited & this year’s theme is
	…\n \n                       Wild West\nGents\, are you a cowboy\, an ou
	tlaw\, or maybe you’re a Sheriff or his deputy?\nMaybe you’re the town
	 drunk! Or the mystery visitor all in black? The quickest draw in the West
	??? A prospector?\n \nGenteels\, are you a cowgirl\, the mayor’s wife\, 
	or a saloon girl???!! Perhaps a farmer’s wife or a traveling aristocrat 
	or the proprietor of a house of ill repute?!!! Maybe you’re the best fem
	ale gunslinger this side of the Appalachians!\n \nHOTEL ROOMS: If you are 
	interested in booking a hotel room at a discounted rate\, please reach out
	 to me.\n \n \n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20251213T230000
