	Section1\n	{size:8.5in 11.0in\;\n	margin:1.0in 1.0in 1.0in 1.0in\;\n	mso-h
	eader-margin:.5in\;\n	mso-footer-margin:.5in\;\n	mso-paper-source:0\;}\ndi
	v.WordSection1\n	{page:WordSection1\;}\n--></style><!--[if gte mso 10]><st
	yle>/* Style Definitions */\ntable.MsoNormalTable\n	{mso-style-name:"Table
	 Normal"\;\n	mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0\;\n	mso-tstyle-colband-size:0\;\n	m
	so-style-noshow:yes\;\n	mso-style-priority:99\;\n	mso-style-parent:""\;\n	
	mso-padding-alt:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\;\n	mso-para-margin:0in\;\n	mso-pagina
	tion:widow-orphan\;\n	font-size:12.0pt\;\n	font-family:"Aptos"\,sans-serif
	\;\n	mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos\;\n	mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos\;\n	mso-f
	ont-kerning:1.0pt\;\n	mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\;}\n</style><![endi
	f]--></head><body lang=EN-US link="#467886" vlink="#96607D" style='tab-int
	erval:.5in\;word-wrap:break-word'><div class=WordSection1><p class=MsoNorm
	al><span style='font-size:22.0pt\;font-family:"Bernard MT Condensed"\,seri
	f'>Hello\, <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size
	:22.0pt\;font-family:"Bernard MT Condensed"\,serif'>Please RSVP as soon as
	 possible if you haven&#8217\;t already. Our final headcount will be due v
	ery soon.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:2
	2.0pt\;font-family:"Bernard MT Condensed"\,serif'>*Also\, please be sure e
	mail me your <u>food restrictions/meal requirements</u> right away as I ne
	ed to get our menu into the venue.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal
	><u><span style='font-size:22.0pt\;font-family:"Bernard MT Condensed"\,ser
	if'><o:p><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp\;</span></o:p></span></u
	></p><p class=MsoNormal><u><span style='font-size:18.0pt\;font-family:"Ber
	nard MT Condensed"\,serif'>You&#8217\;re invited &amp\; this year&#8217\;s
	 theme is&#8230\;<o:p></o:p></span></u></p><p class=MsoNormal><u><span sty
	le='font-size:18.0pt\;font-family:"Bernard MT Condensed"\,serif'><o:p><spa
	n style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp\;</span></o:p></span></u></p><p class
	=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:16.0pt\;font-family:"Bernard MT Condense
	d"\,serif'>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; &nbsp\
	;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp\;&n
	bsp\;&nbsp\;</span><span style='font-size:72.0pt\;font-family:"Copperplate
	 Gothic Bold"\,sans-serif\;color:#996633\;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt\;p
	adding:0in'>Wild West</span><span style='font-size:72.0pt\;font-family:"Co
	pperplate Gothic Bold"\,sans-serif\;color:#996633'><o:p></o:p></span></p><
	p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:14.0pt\;font-family:"Bernard MT C
	ondensed"\,serif\;color:#747474'>Gents\, are you a cowboy\, an outlaw\, or
	 maybe you&#8217\;re a Sheriff or his deputy?<o:p></o:p></span></p><p clas
	s=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:14.0pt\;font-family:"Bernard MT Condens
	ed"\,serif\;color:#747474'>Maybe you&#8217\;re the town drunk! Or the myst
	ery visitor all in black? The quickest draw in the West??? A prospector?<o
	:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:14.0pt\;font
	-family:"Bernard MT Condensed"\,serif\;color:#996633'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></
	span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span class=SpellE><span style='font-size:14.0
	pt\;font-family:"Bernard MT Condensed"\,serif\;color:#C04F15'>Genteels</sp
	an></span><span style='font-size:14.0pt\;font-family:"Bernard MT Condensed
	"\,serif\;color:#C04F15'>\, are you a cowgirl\, the mayor&#8217\;s wife\, 
	or a saloon girl???!! Perhaps a farmer&#8217\;s wife or a traveling aristo
	crat or the proprietor of a house of ill repute?!!! Maybe you&#8217\;re th
	e best female gunslinger this side of the Appalachians!<o:p></o:p></span><
	/p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:14.0pt\;font-family:"Bernard 
	MT Condensed"\,serif\;color:#C04F15'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class
	=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:14.0pt\;font-family:"Bernard MT Condense
	d"\,serif\;color:#C04F15'>HOTEL ROOMS: If you are interested in booking a 
	hotel room at a discounted rate\, please reach out to me.</span><span styl
	e='font-size:9.0pt\;font-family:"Bernard MT Condensed"\,serif'><o:p></o:p>
	</span></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:16.0pt\;font-family:"
	Bernard MT Condensed"\,serif'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNor
	mal><span style='font-size:12.0pt\;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos\;mso-hansi-
	font-family:Aptos\;mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o
	:p></span></p></div></body></html>
