DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654)\, Robbie Smith\, Dave Lu
	xmore\, Jesus Garcia\, & Chris Shafer\n\n \n\nScope- ASTM-E779. Air barrie
	r testing a 170-unit building. BEE will arrive onsite at 7:30am and begin 
	setting up test equipment\, testing will begin at Noon at which time all p
	ersonnel not directly involved with the testing crew must leave the buildi
	ng for the duration of the testing ~ 1.5 hours.\n\n \n\nContact- Jose with
	 Deacon 206-799-0854\n\n \n\n
