	uxmore\, & Jesus Betancourt\n\n Scope: ASTM E1105. Retest 3 failed section
	s of storefront and 5 additional of similar size.\n\n Test Pressure: 6.0 P
	SF.\n\n Note: GC to invite window manufacturer to testing date. Test locat
	ions to have a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing ins
	talled\, and interior air barrier sealant in place. No drywall (jamb\, sil
	l\, & head liners) or siding surrounding the test locations.\n\n Onsite Co
	ntact:\n\nJustin Thomas\n\nSuperintendent\n\nAmerican Home Builders\, Inc\
	n\np: 206.638-0588 e: jthomas@acg.com <mailto:jthomas@acg.com> \n\n \n\n
