DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654) & Robbie Smith.\n\n \n\n
	Scope- ASTM E779. Air barrier testing 9 individual existing units prior to
	 rehab. BEE will arrive at 6:30am and begin setting up test equipment and 
	prepping the units. All HVAC must be turned off upon our arrival. Testing 
	will start in the 1st unit at 7am at which point all personnel must exit t
	he units for the duration of the test. Duration of testing is ~30 minutes.
	\n\n \n\nContact- \n\nCamryn Schon\n\nProject Manager\n\nInland Group\n\n1
	20 W Cataldo|Spokane\, WA 99201\n\nC: (509) 710-9421\n\ncamryns@inlandcons
	truction <mailto:coreyr@inlandconstruction.com> .com\n\n \n\n
