	&amp\; Robbie Smith.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></
	p><p class=MsoNormal>Scope- ASTM E779. Air barrier testing 9 individual ex
	isting units prior to rehab. BEE will arrive at 6:30am and begin setting u
	p test equipment and prepping the units. All HVAC must be turned off upon 
	our arrival. Testing will start in the 1<sup>st</sup> unit at 7am at which
	 point all personnel must exit the units for the duration of the test. Dur
	ation of testing is ~30 minutes.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nb
	sp\;</o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal>Contact- <o:p></o:p></p><p class=elementt
