CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20251203T225235Z
DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654)\, Dave Luxmore\, & Chris
	 Shafer\n\n \n\nScope- ASTM-E779. Air barrier testing the retail space. BE
	E will arrive onsite at 7am and begin setting up test equipment\, testing 
	will begin at 9:30pm at which time all personnel not directly involved wit
	h the testing crew must leave the retail space for the duration of the tes
	ting ~ 1hours.\n\n \n\nNotes- \n\nAll exterior doors must have thresholds\
	, gaskets\, AB sealant\, & hardware installed. \n\nFans will be placed in 
	the entryway to the retail space.\n\nAll penetrations through walls from c
	onditioned to unconditioned spaces to be sealed (fire caulk or similar). T
	op and bottom plates of these demising wall recommended to be sealed as we
	ll.\n\nAll HVAC in the retail must be off and sealed prior to the test (by
	 HVAC prep sub). \n\nPer 2018 WSEC the target pass fail rate 0.25 CFM/SQFT
	 at 75 Pa\, a failure of over 0.40 CFM/SQFT at 75 Pa will require retestin
	g.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\nJustin Thomas\n\nSuperintendent\n\nAmerican Home Bu
	ilders\, Inc\n\np: 206.638-0588 e: jthomas@acg.com <mailto:jthomas@acg.com
	> \n\n \n\n
