DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654)\, Robbie Smith\, Jesus B
	etancourt\, & Chris Shafer\n\n \n\nScope- ASTM E779. Air barrier testing a
	 ~1850 sqft church addition. BEE will arrive at 8am and begin setting up t
	est equipment and prepping the building. All HVAC must be turned off upon 
	our arrival. Testing will start at 9:30am at which point all personnel mus
	t exit the building for the duration of the test. Duration of testing is ~
	1 hour.\n\n \n\nNote- Please ensure all exterior doors have hardware and g
	askets\, water in in drains\, & the building envelope is completed.\n\n \n
	\nContact- James Baker (Grow Construction) 503-964-3471\n\n \n\n
