DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654)\, Robbie Smith\, Dave Lu
	xmore\, Jesus Garcia\, & Chris Shafer\n\n \n\nScope- Prepping a 170-unit b
	uilding for air barrier testing. BEE will arrive onsite at 7:30am and seal
	ing off HVAC in the units and common areas. ERV breakers will be turned of
	f in all units.\n\n \n\nNote- Please notify any subs working in the buildi
	ng to not remove any blue plastic from the HVAC vents throughout the build
	ing.\n\n \n\nContact- Jose with Deacon 206-799-0854\n\n \n\n
