	mp\; Chris Shafer<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p><
	p class=MsoNormal>Scope- Prepping a 170-unit building for air barrier test
	ing. BEE will arrive onsite at 7:30am and sealing off HVAC in the units an
	d common areas. ERV breakers will be turned off in all units.<o:p></o:p></
	p><p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal>Note- Please
	 notify any subs working in the building to not remove any blue plastic fr
	om the HVAC vents throughout the building.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNorma
	l><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal>Contact- <span style='color:bla
	ck'>Jose with Deacon 206-799-0854</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal>
