DESCRIPTION:\nAttendees:\n\n\nBEE ENGINEERS \n\nRobert Smith\n\n425-344-699
	7\n\nJesus Betancourt\n\n425-595-7654\n\n\nScope:\n\n\nASTM E1105 Window t
	esting. 5 different product types:\n\nCasement\, Picture Window\, Horizont
	al Slider\, Single Hung\, & Sliding Patio Door\n\n\nProducts & Test Pressu
	res:\n\nProduct\n\nProduct Rating\n\nField Adjusted Test Pressure (PSF)\n\
	n1. Plygem Pro Series 700 Casement\n\nPG40\n\n4.04\n\n2. Plygem Pro Series
	 700 Picture Window\n\nPG50\n\n5.01\n\n3. Plygem Pro Series 200 Horizontal
	 Slider\n\nDP30\n\n3.06\n\n4. Plygem Pro Series 960 Sliding Patio Door\n\n
	DP40\n\n4.04\n\n5. Plygem Pro Series 200 Single Hung\n\nDP40\n\n4.04\n\n\n
	Note: \n\n\nGC to invite Window Manufacturer to the day of testing. Test l
	ocations to have a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing
	 installed\, and interior air barrier sealant in place.\n\n\nContact:\n\n\
	nJason Boyce\n\nLENNAR - TEN TRAILS\n\nJason.boyce@lennar.com <mailto:Jaso
	n.boyce@lennar.com> \n\n+1 206-841-7834\n\n
