DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654)\, Jesus Betancourt\, & R
	obbie Smith\n\n \n\nScope- ASTM-E779. Air barrier testing on a school buil
	ding. BEE will arrive onsite at 9am and begin setting up test equipment an
	d sealing off the HVAC\, testing will begin at 10:30am at which time all p
	ersonnel must leave the building for the duration of the testing ~ 1.5 hou
	rs.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\nJeff Bird (Colvos) 253.355.2088\n\n \n\n
