DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654)\, Chris Shafer\, Robert 
	Smith\, Jesus Betancourt\, & Dave Luxmore\n\n \n\nScope- Air barrier testi
	ng 28-unit mixed use building. BEE will arrive at 7:30am and begin preppin
	g the building and setting up test equipment\, at Noon all personnel not i
	nvolved with the test must exit the building for the duration of the testi
	ng ~ 1 hour.\n\n \n\nNote- All doors should have gaskets and hardware inst
	alled\, all penetrations into the air barrier should be sealed\, water sho
	uld be in all drains\, & the building envelope should be completed prior t
	o the testing date. All HVAC in the building should be shut off upon BEE
	’s arrival.\n\n \n\nContact- \n\nEvan Chan\n\nEdge Community Builders\, 
	LLC\n\nP: (206) 900-8635 office\n\nevanc@edgedevelopers.net <mailto:evanc@
	edgedevelopers.net> \n\n \n\n
