CREATED:20251222T190557Z
DESCRIPTION:\nAttendees: \n\n\nBEE Engineers\, Robert Smith 425-344-6997 & 
	Torin Garner\n\n\nScope: \n\n\nASTM E1105 Window Water Penetration Resista
	nce Testing. Retest the 2 failed 4-lite fixed windows in the L4 & L5 Hallw
	ay\, south elevation. 6 additional windows of the same type to be tested a
	s well. 8 locations total.\n\n\nTest Pressure: \n\n\n5.25 PSF for Windows\
	n\n\nNote: \n\n\nGC recommended to invite installer to testing date. Test 
	locations to have a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, head flashin
	g installed\, and interior air barrier sealant in place. No drywall or sid
	ing surrounding the test locations.\n\nONSITE CONTACT: Gary Rush (661)-444
	-0662\n\n \n\n \n\n
