DESCRIPTION:Attendees: BEE Engineers\, Dave Luxmore (425-344-6997)\, Jesus 
	Betancourt\, & Chris Shafer\n\n Scope: ASTM E1105. Retesting 5 failed sect
	ions of storefront and up to 17 additional. (Dependent on how the retestin
	g of the failed locations go.)\n\n Test Pressure: 6.0 PSF.\n\n Note: GC to
	 invite window manufacturer to testing date. Test locations to have a comp
	leted field of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing installed\, and interi
	or air barrier sealant in place. No drywall (jamb\, sill\, & head liners) 
	or siding surrounding the test locations.\n\n Onsite Contact:\n\nJustin Th
	omas\n\nSuperintendent\n\nAmerican Home Builders\, Inc\n\np: 206.638-0588 
	e: jthomas@acg.com <mailto:jthomas@acg.com> \n\n \n\n \n\n
