DESCRIPTION:\nAttendees: \n\n\nBEE Engineers\, Robert Smith 425-344-6997 & 
	Jesus Betancourt\n\n\nScope: \n\n\nASTM E1105 Window Water Penetration Res
	istance Testing. Four ~10’x10’ sections of fixed storefront. See attac
	hed for test areas.\n\n\nTest Pressure: \n\n\n6.0 PSF.\n\n\nNote: \n\n\nGC
	 recommended to invite storefront installer to testing date. Test location
	s to have a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing instal
	led\, and interior air barrier sealant in place. No drywall or siding surr
	ounding the test locations.\n\nONSITE CONTACT: Gary Rush (661)-444-0662\n\
	n \n\n
