	argin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto'>GC recommended to invite s
	torefront installer to testing date. Test locations to have a completed fi
	eld of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air b
	arrier sealant in place. No drywall or siding surrounding the test locatio
	ns.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-m
	argin-bottom-alt:auto'><b><u>ONSITE CONTACT: </u></b>Gary Rush<b> </b>(661
