DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654)\, Chris Shafer\, Robert 
	Smith\, & Dave Luxmore\n\n \n\nScope- Perform ASTM E779 air leakage testin
	g on MFG#1 & MFG#3 Cleanrooms. \n\nHVAC unit target rates at 0.05 INWC (~1
	2.5) Pa below.\n\n \n\nMFG #1\n\n\n\n \n\nMFG #3\n\n\n\n \n\nBEE will arri
	ve onsite at 8am and begin setting up equipment and prepping the rooms (se
	aling off HVAC units). Testing to being at 9am at which time nobody can be
	 in the test area for the duration of the testing ~1 hour. The next clean 
	room will be tested afterwards on a similar timeline.\n\n \n\nNote- HVAC u
	nits to be fully ducted and all dampers on the HVAC system shall be set in
	 the closed position prior to the testing date.\n\n \n\nContact- \n\n\n\nB
	rian Jones\n\nChad Fisher Construction\n\nbrianj@cfisherconstruction.com <
	mailto:brianj@cfisherconstruction.com>  | www.cfisherconstruction.com <htt
	p://www.cfisherconstruction.com/> \n\nOffice 360.757.0580 |Cell 425.314.09
	06\n\n \n\n
