DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654)\, Chris Shafer\, & Jesus
	 Betancourt\n\n \n\nScope- Perform air leakage testing on Large Cleanroom.
	 Target Rate below 3029.4 cfm at 0.05 INWC (~12.5 Pa). Max rate 4000 cfm a
	t 0.05 INWC (~12.5 Pa)\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\nNote- BEE will arrive onsite at 7:
	30am and begin setting up equipment and prepping. Testing to being at 9am 
	at which time nobody can be in the test area for the duration of the testi
	ng ~1 hour. \n\n \n\nContact- \n\n\n\nIan Gibbs\n\nChad Fisher Constructio
	n\n\niang@cfisherconstruction.com <mailto:iang@cfisherconstruction.com>  |
	 www.cfisherconstruction.com <http://www.cfisherconstruction.com/> \n\nMob
	ile 360.739.5174 | Office 360.757.0580\n\n \n\n \n\n
