DESCRIPTION:\nAttendees: \n\n\nBEE Engineers\, Robert Smith 425-344-6997 & 
	Torin Garner\n\n\nScope: \n\n\nASTM E1105 Window Water Penetration Resista
	nce Testing. Retest 2 failed swing doors in units 240 & 340 plus 2 additio
	nal swing doors in units 439 & 440. 4 locations total.\n\n\nTest Pressure:
	 \n\n\n3.0 PSF for Swing Doors\n\n\nNote: \n\n\nGC recommended to invite i
	nstaller to testing date. Test locations to have a completed field of WRB 
	surrounding them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barrier seal
	ant in place. No drywall or siding surrounding the test locations.\n\nONSI
	TE CONTACT: Gary Rush (661)-444-0662\n\n \n\n
