	\n\nRobert Smith\n\n425-344-6997\n\n\nScope:\n\n\nASTM E1105 Window testin
	g. 5 different product types:\n\nCasement\, Picture Window\, Horizontal Sl
	ider\, Single Hung\, & Sliding Patio Door\n\n\nSPECIFICATIONS:\n\nProduct\
	n\nProduct Rating\n\nField Adjusted Test Pressure (PSF)\n\n1. Plygem Pro S
	eries 700 Casement\n\nPG40\n\n4.04\n\n2. Plygem Pro Series 700 Picture Win
	dow\n\nPG50\n\n5.01\n\n3. Plygem Pro Series 200 Horizontal Slider \n\nDP30
	\n\n3.06\n\n4. Plygem Pro Series 960 Sliding Patio Door\n\nDP40\n\n4.04\n\
	n5. Plygem Pro Series 200 Single Hung\n\nDP40\n\n4.04\n\n\n \n\n\nNote: GC
	 to invite Window Manufacturer to the day of testing. Test locations to ha
	ve a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing installed\, a
	nd interior air barrier sealant in place.\n\n\nContact: Jeff Harper 1-253-
	308-5330\n\n\n \n\n
