	Garner\, & Chris Shafer\n\n Scope: ASTM E1105. Retesting 5 failed sections
	 of storefront and up to 17 additional. \n\n Test Pressure: 6.0 PSF.\n\n N
	ote: GC to invite window manufacturer to testing date. Test locations to h
	ave a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing installed\, 
	and interior air barrier sealant in place. No drywall (jamb\, sill\, & hea
	d liners) or siding surrounding the test locations.\n\n Onsite Contact:\n\
	nJustin Thomas\n\nSuperintendent\n\nAmerican Home Builders\, Inc\n\np: 206
	.638-0588 e: jthomas@acg.com <mailto:jthomas@acg.com> \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n
