DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin (425-595-7654)\, Robbie\, Dave\, Jesus\, & Chr
	is \n\n \n\nScope- ASTM-E779. Air barrier testing a 146-unit building. BEE
	 will arrive onsite at 8:00am and begin setting up test equipment and prep
	ping the building\, testing will begin at 11am at which time all personnel
	 must leave the building for the duration of the testing ~ 1 hour.\n\n \n\
	nNote- All drains must have water\, all exterior doors must have hardware/
	gaskets\, all windows must be able to close properly\, & the building enve
	lope should be completed to detail.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\n <https://www.rmil
	lerinc.com/> \n\nANJEL DAVID | Assistant Project Manager\n\nM  425.471.219
	3\n\n \n\n
