DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin (425-595-7654)\, Dave\, Robbie\, Jesus\, & Chr
	is\n\nScope- ASTM-E779\, 2018 SEC. Air barrier testing a 20-unit building.
	 BEE will arrive onsite at 8:00am and begin setting up test equipment and 
	sealing off HVAC in the units & rooftop\, testing will begin at 10:30am at
	 which time all personnel must leave the building for the duration of the 
	testing ~ 1 hour.\n\nNote- Building to have completed building envelope\, 
	water in all P-traps\, storefront completed\, and all gaskets and hardware
	 on exterior entry doors.\n\nContact-\n\n <https://www.belottimchugh.com/>
	 \n\n \n\n
