DESCRIPTION:\nAttendees:\n\nDave Luxmore\n\n425-345-9656\n\nTorin Garner\n\
	n\nScope: ASTM E1105 Window testing. 5 different product types: Casement\,
	 Picture Window\, Horizontal Slider\, Single Hung\, & Sliding Patio Door. 
	GC to confirm with Plygem product types and test pressures listed below ar
	e correct.\n\n\nProducts & Test Pressures:\n\nProduct\n\nProduct Rating\n\
	nField Adjusted Test Pressure (PSF)\n\n1. Plygem Pro Series 700 Casement\n
	\nPG40\n\n4.04\n\n2. Plygem Pro Series 700 Picture Window\n\nPG50\n\n5.01\
	n\n3. Plygem Pro Series 200 Horizontal Slider\n\nDP30\n\n3.06\n\n4. Plygem
	 Pro Series 960 Sliding Patio Door\n\nDP40\n\n4.04\n\n5. Plygem Pro Series
	 200 Single Hung\n\nDP40\n\n4.04\n\n\nNote: GC to invite window manufactur
	er to the day of testing. Test locations to have a completed field of WRB 
	surrounding them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barrier seal
	ant in place. \n\n\nContact:\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\nBart Burson\n\n \n\n \n\nCon
	struction Manager - Seattle\n\n \n\n \n\n33820 Weyerhaeuser Way S #210\n\n
	Federal Way\, WA 98001\n\n \n\n \n\ncell: 253-263-2337\n\n \n\n \n\nBart.b
	urson@lennar.com <mailto:Bart.burson@lennar.com> \n\n \n\n \n\nlennar.com/
	seattle <http://www.lennar.com/seattle> \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n\n\n 
	\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n
