DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654)\, Chris Shafer\, & Jesus
	 Betancourt\,\n\nScope- ASTM E779\, Building 1 air barrier testing.\n\n No
	te- All doors should have gaskets and hardware installed\, all penetration
	s into the air barrier should be sealed\, water should be in all drains\, 
	& the building envelope should be completed prior to the testing date. All
	 HVAC in the building should be shut off upon BEE’s arrival.\n\n Contact
	s-\n\nTodd Rankin | Sr. Construction Manager\n\ndir 206.728.6515 | cel 206
	.854.3944 | fax 206.625.9133\n\n411 1st Avenue South\, Suite 650 | Seattle
	 WA  98104 | IntracorpHomes.com <https://linkprotect.cudasvc.com/url?a=htt
	p%3a%2f%2fwww.intracorphomes.com%2f&c=E\,1\,Fs_W3uCsqXPxu7Fm-7NDbdD5Y6KYn-
