	rmal style='mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto'>&nbsp\;Note- All doors should have
	 gaskets and hardware installed\, all penetrations into the air barrier sh
	ould be sealed\, water should be in all drains\, &amp\; the building envel
	ope should be completed prior to the testing date. All HVAC in the buildin
	g should be shut off upon BEE&#8217\;s arrival.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=Mso
	Normal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto'>&nbsp\;
	Contacts-<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><b><span style='font-size:10.0p
	t\;font-family:"Arial"\,sans-serif\;color:gray'>Todd Rankin | Sr. Construc
	tion Manager</span></b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><span style='font
	-size:10.0pt\;font-family:"Arial"\,sans-serif\;color:gray'>dir 206.728.651
	5 | cel 206.854.3944 | fax 206.625.9133</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoN
	ormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt\;font-family:"Arial"\,sans-serif\;colo
