	n Scope- ASTM E1105.  2 horizontal slider windows\, 2 single hung windows\
	, & 2 sliding glass doors. 6 Locations Total.\n\nTest Pressure- Windows & 
	Swing Doors = 4.5 PSF\n\n Note- GC to invite window manufacturer/installer
	s to this testing date. Please ensure all testing locations are installed 
	to detail with a completed field of WRB\, head flashing\, & interior air b
	arrier sealant in place. No drywall or cladding surrounding the test locat
	ions.\n\n Contacts-\n\nZac Daab | Project Manager\n\nBuchanan General Cont
	racting Company\n\n2200 112th Ave NE\n\nSUITE 160\n\nBellevue\, WA 98004\n
	\nM: 206-595-1181 \n\nO:  425-462-1326 \n\n \n\n
