	the duration of the testing ~45 mins. Testing in Large Office area to take
	 place at approximately 10:30\, all personnel not involved with the test m
	ust exit the building for the duration of the testing ~45 mins\n\n \n\nNot
	e- All doors should have gaskets and hardware installed\, all penetrations
	 into the air barrier should be sealed\, water should be in all drains\, &
	 the building envelope should be completed prior to the testing date. All 
	HVAC in the TI Spaces should be shut off upon BEE’s arrival.\n\n \n\nCon
	tact-\n\nRob Overton\n\nProject Manager\nSIERRA CONSTRUCTION COMPANY\, INC
	.\n\n14800 NE North Woodinville Way\, Woodinville\, WA 98072\no. 425-487-5
	200 | c. 425-219-0997\n\nwww.sierraind.com <http://www.sierraind.com> \n\n
