	'>Attendees- Robert Smith (425-344-6997) &amp\; Jesus Betancourt.<span sty
	le='mso-ligatures:none'><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='ms
	o-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto'>Scope- ASTM E1105.&nbsp
	\;6 locations in building 1. Three additional PlyGem sliding glass doors a
	nd three additional PlyGem XOX horizontal sliders.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=
	MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto'>Test
	 Pressure- 4 PSF for all products per Telmans approval via email on 10/21.
	 <o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto'>&nbs
	p\;Note- GC to invite window manufacturer to this testing date. Test locat
	ions to have a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing ins
	talled\, and interior air barrier sealant in place. It is preferred that d
	o drywall or siding surround the test locations if possible.<o:p></o:p></p
	><p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
	auto'>&nbsp\;Contacts-<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><b><span style='fo
	nt-size:10.0pt\;font-family:"Arial"\,sans-serif\;color:gray'>Todd Rankin |
	 Sr. Construction Manager</span></b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><spa
	n style='font-size:10.0pt\;font-family:"Arial"\,sans-serif\;color:gray'>di
