DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robert Smith (425-344-6997)\, Dave Luxmore\, & Jesus
	 Garcia\n\n \n\nScope- ASTM E1105 & ASTM E783. Air infiltration testing to
	 be performed on the 3’ wide location (right). Water penetration resista
	nce testing to be performed on both locations. \n\n \n\n\n\n \n\nWater Pen
	etration Resistance Test Pressure- 6.96 PSF. No uncontrolled water leakage
	 is permitted.\n\n \n\nAir Infiltration Testing Criteria- Shall not exceed
	 0.09 cfm/sqft at 1.57 PSF.\n\n \n\nNote- All locations should be installe
	d to detail with integral sealants and flashings in place. GC recommended 
	to invite installer to the testing.\n\n \n\nContact- Alex Stedman 360-599-
	4176\n\n \n\n \n\nDennis Altamira\nProject Manager\nP: +1 (206) 778-2132 |
	 E: Dennisa@gencapgc.com <mailto:Dennisa@gencapgc.com> \n\n
