	d on the 3’ wide location (right). Water penetration resistance testing 
	to be performed on both locations.\n</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp\;</p>
	\n<p class="MsoNormal"><img id="image001.png@01DC9FFC.AB7D1AB0" width="907
