DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Dave Luxmore (425-345-9656) Torin Garner\, & Jesus B
	etancourt.\n\n Scope- ASTM E1105. 3 swing doors\, 1 W44 fixed\, & 1 W39 fi
	xed on North elevation.\n\n\n\nTest Pressure- Windows & Swing Doors = 6.0 
	PSF\n\n Note- GC to invite window manufacturer/installers to this testing 
	date. Please ensure all testing locations are installed to detail with a c
	ompleted field of WRB\, head flashing\, & interior air barrier sealant in 
	place. No drywall or cladding surrounding the test locations. \n\n Contact
