DESCRIPTION:\nAttendees:\n\nDave Luxmore\n\n425-345-9656\n\nJesus Betancour
	t\n\n\nScope: ASTM E1105 Window testing. 5 different product types: Caseme
	nt\, Picture Window\, Horizontal Slider\, Single Hung\, & Sliding Patio Do
	or.\n\n\nProducts & Test Pressures:\n\nProduct\n\nProduct Rating\n\nField 
	Adjusted Test Pressure (PSF)\n\n1. Plygem Pro Series 700 Casement\n\nPG40\
	n\n4.04\n\n2. Plygem Pro Series 700 Picture Window\n\nPG50\n\n5.01\n\n3. P
	lygem Pro Series 200 Horizontal Slider\n\nDP30\n\n3.06\n\n4. Plygem Pro Se
	ries 960 Sliding Patio Door\n\nDP40\n\n4.04\n\n5. Plygem Pro Series 200 Si
	ngle Hung\n\nDP40\n\n4.04\n\n\nNote: GC to invite Window Manufacturer to t
	he day of testing. Test locations to have a completed field of WRB surroun
	ding them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barrier sealant in 
	place.\n\n\nContact:\n\n\nJason Boyce\n\nLENNAR - TEN TRAILS\n\nJason.boyc
	e@lennar.com <mailto:Jason.boyce@lennar.com> \n\n+1 206-841-7834\n\n \n\n
