	is \n\n \n\nScope- ASTM-E779. Air barrier testing a 56-unit building. BEE 
	will arrive onsite at 9:00am and begin setting up test equipment and prepp
	ing the building (sealing off HVAC)\, testing will begin at 11am at which 
	time all personnel must leave the building for the duration of the testing
	 ~ 1 hour.\n\n \n\nNote- All drains must have water\, all exterior doors m
	ust have hardware/gaskets\, all windows must be able to close properly\, &
	 the building envelope should be completed to detail.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\n
	 \n\nJMZ Contractors\, LLC\n\nJeremy Speller\n\nSuperintendent\n\n2701 Wet
	more Ave – Suite B\n\nEverett\, WA 98201\n\n206-799-4237\n\nJspeller55@h
	otmail.com <mailto:Jspeller55@hotmail.com> \n\n\n\n \n\n
