	n\nScope- ASTM E1105 window testing. 2 Type B2 windows\, 1 Type C1 window\
	, 1 Type C2 window\, & 2 Type F Doors. 6 locations total\, specific locati
	ons TBD.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 6.0 PSF\n\n         \n\n \n\nNote- GC reco
	mmended to invite window manufacturer to testing date. All test locations 
	to have interior air barrier sealant\, head flashing\, and a completed fie
	ld of WRB. No drywall or cladding surrounding the test locations.\n\n \n\n
	Contact-\n\nJustin Thomas\n\nSuperintendent\n\nAmerican Home Builders\, In
	c\n\np: 206.638-0588 e: jthomas@acg.com <mailto:jthomas@acg.com> \n\n \n\n
