DESCRIPTION:\nAttendees:\n\n\nDave Luxmore               (425-345-9656)\n\n
	Robbie Smith                (425-344-6997)\n\n \n\n\nScope:\n\n\nASTM E110
	5 Water Penetration Testing – Retesting (2) VPI swing doors.\n\nTest Pre
	ssure = 5.25 PSF\n\n\n\n \n\nNote: GC to invite window manufacturer/instal
	lers to this testing date. Please ensure all testing locations are install
	ed to detail with a completed field of WRB\, head flashing\, & interior ai
	r barrier sealant in place. No drywall or cladding surrounding the test lo
	cations. \n\n\nON-Site Contact:\n\nKJ Holmes\n\nSr. Project Engineer\n\nCe
	ll: 206.953.2023 <tel:206.953.2023> \n\n11332 NE 122nd Way Ste. 350\n\n\, 
	\n\nKirkland\, WA\n\n \n\n98034\n\nKJ.Holmes@compass-gc.com <mailto:KJ.Hol
	mes@compass-gc.com> \n\n | \n\nwww.compass-gc.com <http://www.compass-gc.c
	om/> \n\n | \n\n <https://www.linkedin.com/company/compass-general-constru
	ction/> \n\n <https://www.instagram.com/compassgc/> \n\n <https://www.face
	book.com/compassgc/> \n\n \n\n \n\n
