DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin (425-595-7654)\, Robbie\, Dave\, Jesus\, & Chr
	is \n\n \n\nScope- ASTM-E779. Air barrier testing a 191-unit building. BEE
	 will arrive onsite at 8:00am and begin setting up test equipment and prep
	ping the building\, testing will begin at 11am at which time all personnel
	 must leave the building for the duration of the testing ~ 90 minutes.\n\n
	 \n\nNote- All drains must have water\, all exterior doors must have hardw
	are/gaskets\, all windows must be able to close properly\, & the building 
	envelope should be completed to detail.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\n <http://www.c
	ompass-gc.com/> \n\n\n\nRecognized as a Best Workplace — 2023\, 2024 & 2
	025\n\nNate Heppenstall\n\nSuperintendent\n\nOffice: 206.320.8741 <tel:206
	.320.8741> \n\n | \n\nCell: 206.550.0775 <tel:206.550.0775> \n\n11332 NE 1
	22nd Way Ste. 350\n\n\, \n\nKirkland\, WA\n\n \n\n98034\n\nnateh@compass-g
	c.com <mailto:nateh@compass-gc.com> \n\n | \n\nwww.compass-gc.com <http://
	www.compass-gc.com/> \n\n | \n\n <https://www.linkedin.com/company/compass
	-general-construction/> \n\n <https://www.instagram.com/compassgc/> \n\n <
	https://www.facebook.com/compassgc/> \n\n \n\n
