	building readiness\, power sources for the fans\, building isolations proc
	edure & responsibility\, and the timeline of events as it pertains to the 
	testing. The attached document has most of the items we will go over in th
	e meeting. \n\n \n\nContact-\n\nMads Hansen\nSuperintendent\nP: +1 (425) 7
	53-9923 | E: Madsh@gencapgc.com <mailto:Madsh@gencapgc.com> \n\n
