DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin (425-595-7654)\, Robbie\, Dave\, Jesus\, & Chr
	is \n\n \n\nScope- ASTM-E779 Air barrier testing in accordance with 2021 W
	SEC. BEE will arrive onsite at 8:00am and begin testing the building unit 
	by unit (24 total). Each unit that is tested must be empty during the test
	ing ~30 mins. BEE will have two crews testing the units on the building. I
	f the testing goes well and time allows BEE may start testing units on Bui
	lding B once building A is completed.\n\n \n\nNote- All drains must have w
	ater\, all exterior doors must have hardware/gaskets\, all windows must be
	 able to close properly\, & the building envelope and interior walls shoul
	d be completed to detail.\n\n \n\nOnsite Contact- \n\nThomas Bartlett\n\nG
	eneral Superintendent\n\nDayspring Construction\n\n425-529-3900-cell\n\n \
	n\n \n\n
