DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin (425-595-7654)\, Jesus\, & Chris\n\nScope- AST
	M-E779\, 2018 SEC. Air barrier testing a 15-unit building. BEE will arrive
	 onsite at 8:00am and begin setting up test equipment and sealing off HVAC
	 in the units & rooftop\, testing will begin at 10:30am at which time all 
	personnel must leave the building for the duration of the testing ~ 1 hour
	.\n\nNote- Building to have completed building envelope\, water in all P-t
	raps\, storefronts completed\, and all gaskets and hardware on exterior en
	try doors.\n\nContact-\n\nTony Abbott\n\nSUPERINTENDENT\n\n775-302-0015\n\
	ntony@cajames.com <mailto:tony@cajames.com> \n\n
