	7D" style='word-wrap:break-word'><div class=WordSection1><p class=MsoNorma
	l style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto'>Attendees- T
	orin (425-595-7654)\, Robbie\, Dave\, Jesus\, &amp\; Chris<o:p></o:p></p><
	p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:au
	to'>&nbsp\;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:aut
	o\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto'>Scope- Prepping the units (sealing off HVAC
	) in the building for the air barrier testing. BEE will arrive at 7:30am a
	nd begin prepping the building for the air barrier testing.<o:p></o:p></p>
	<p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:a
	uto'>&nbsp\;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:au
	to\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto'>Note- BEE will shut off any breakers in th
	e units for HVAC prior to sealing the vents. <o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNo
	rmal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto'>&nbsp\;<o
	:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin
	-bottom-alt:auto'>Contact- Gary Rush\, ACG<b> </b>(661)-444-0662<o:p></o:p
	></p><p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-
	alt:auto'>&nbsp\;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-a
	lt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto'>&nbsp\;<o:p></o:p></p></div></body></
