	a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing installed\, and 
	interior air barrier sealant in place. GC recommended to invite window man
	ufacturer to the testing. \n\nContacts- \n\n \n\nJohn Weaver\n\nConstructi
	on Manager - Seattle\n\n33820 Weyerhaeuser Way S #210\n\nFederal Way\, WA 
	98001\n\ncell: 253-247-1784\n\n \n\n \n\n
