	cope- Perform ASTM E779 air leakage testing on AFP Cleanroom. \n\nHVAC uni
	t target rates at 0.05 INWC (~12.5) Pa below.\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\nBEE will ar
	rive onsite at 8am and begin setting up equipment and prepping the room (s
	ealing off HVAC units). Testing to being at 9am at which time nobody can b
	e in the test area for the duration of the testing ~1 hour.\n\n \n\nNote- 
	HVAC units to be fully ducted and all dampers on the HVAC system shall be 
	set in the closed position prior to the testing.\n\n \n\nContact- \n\n\n\n
