	@pivotal-gc.com
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260422T223247Z
DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner\, Chris Shafer\, & Jesus Betancourt.\n\
	n \n\nScope- Air barrier testing a Chick Fil A restaurant. The HVAC in the
	 building will need to be powered off upon BEE's arrival. BEE will arrive 
	at 9am and begin setting up test equipment and sealing off the HVAC to the
	 building. At 10:30am the building must be cleared off all personnel for t
	he duration of the testing\, ~1 hour.\n\n \n\nNote- Building must have wat
	er\, power\, and a completed air barrier system. All door harware and gask
	ets should be installed. All drains should have water in them. All penetra
	tions in the air barrier should be sealed including all seams.\n\n \n\nCon
	tacts-\n\n \n\n(Pivot) Kyle Christel 508-654-4438\n\n \n\n(BEE) Chris Shaf
	er 425-599-8766 \n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20260508T130000
DTSTAMP:20260427T171304Z
DTSTART;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20260508T090000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260512T175449Z
