	ndif]--></head><body lang=EN-US link="#467886" vlink="#96607D" style='word
	-wrap:break-word'><div class=WordSection1><div><p class=MsoNormal><span st
	yle='color:#212121'>Attendees- Torin Garner\, Chris Shafer\, &amp\; Jesus 
	Betancourt.<o:p></o:p></span></p></div><div><p class=MsoNormal><span style
	='color:#212121'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p></div><div><p class=MsoNorma
	l><span style='color:#212121'>Scope- Air barrier testing a Chick Fil A res
	taurant. The HVAC in the building will need to be powered off upon BEE's a
	rrival. BEE will arrive at 9am and begin setting up test equipment and sea
	ling off the HVAC to the building. At 10:30am the building must be cleared
	 off all personnel for the duration of the testing\, ~1 hour.<o:p></o:p></
	span></p></div><div><p class=MsoNormal><span style='color:#212121'><o:p>&n
	bsp\;</o:p></span></p></div><div><p class=MsoNormal><span style='color:#21
	2121'>Note- Building must have water\, power\, and a completed air barrier
	 system. All door harware and gaskets should be installed. All drains shou
	ld have water in them. All penetrations in the air barrier should be seale
	d including all seams.<o:p></o:p></span></p></div><div><p class=MsoNormal>
	<span style='color:#212121'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p></div><div><p cla
	ss=MsoNormal><span style='color:#212121'>Contacts-<o:p></o:p></span></p></
	div><div><p class=MsoNormal><span style='color:#212121'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p>
	</span></p></div><div><p class=MsoNormal><span style='color:#212121'>(Pivo
	t) Kyle Christel 508-654-4438<o:p></o:p></span></p></div><div><p class=Mso
	Normal><span style='color:#212121'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p></div><div
	><p class=MsoNormal><span style='color:#212121'>(BEE) Chris Shafer 425-599
	-8766&nbsp\;<o:p></o:p></span></p></div></div></body></html>
