CREATED:20260427T193140Z
DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Dave Luxmore (425-345-9656) & Jesus Betancourt\n\n \
	n\nScope- ASTM E1105 window testing. 2 sliding glass doors\, 1 mulled hori
	zontal slider/fixed\, 1 horizontal slider/fixed\, 1 Awning/fixed . 5 locat
	ions total\, specific locations TBD.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 4.5 PSF\n\n \n
	\n         \n\n         \n\n \n\nNote- GC recommended to invite window man
	ufacturer to testing date. All test locations to have interior air barrier
	 sealant\, head flashing\, and a completed field of WRB. No drywall or cla
	dding surrounding the test locations.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\nJustin Bowen | P
	roject Superintendent \n\nMSRCOMMUNITIES\n\n806A 164th St SW\n\nLynnwood\,
	 WA - 98087\n\nPH: (206) 249-5637\n\nEmail: Justin@msrcommunities.com <mai
	lto:Justin@msrcommunities.com> \n\n \n\n
