	off any breakers in the units for HVAC prior to sealing the vents. GC to n
	otify subs not to remove the plastic or turn breakers back on.\n\n \n\nCon
	tact-\n\n <http://www.compass-gc.com/> \n\n\n\nRecognized as a Best Workpl
	ace — 2023\, 2024 & 2025\n\nNate Heppenstall\n\nSuperintendent\n\nOffice
