CREATED:20260428T173017Z
DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654) & Robbie Smith\n\n \n\nS
	cope- ASTM E779 air barrier testing in accordance with 2018 WSEC (0.25 cfm
	/sqft allowable). BEE will arrive onsite at 8:30am and begin setting up te
	st equipment and prepping the room for testing (sealing off HVAC). At 9am 
	the room will be cleared of all personnel for the duration of the testing 
	~ 1hour.\n\n \n\nNote- All penetrations in the room to be sealed\, doors t
	o have hardware and gaskets in place\, and sealing of the top and bottom p
	lates of the framed walls recommended.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\nBrook Abraham  
	::  Deputy Project Manager\n\n206-666-0517\n\n\n \n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20261119T130000
