DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Dave Luxmore (425-345-9656) & Robert Smith.\n\nScope
	- ASTM E1105. Retest the failed sliding glass door and 3 additional locati
	ons. \n\nTest Pressure- 3.5 PSF. \n\n Note- Test locations to have a compl
	eted field of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing installed\, and interio
	r air barrier sealant in place. No drywall or cladding surrounding the tes
	t locations. GC recommended to invite window manufacturer to the testing d
	ate.\n\nContact-\n\nRory Sovia | Asst. Superintendent | Nucon LLC\n\n206-7
	47-8552   \n\nrory@nucondev.com <mailto:rory@nucondev.com> \n\n \n\n
