	xmore\, & Jesus Betancourt\n\n \n\nScope- ASTM-E779\, 2018 SEC. Air barrie
	r testing a 5th floor addition. BEE will arrive onsite at 8:00am and begin
	 setting up test equipment prepping the building\, testing will begin at 1
	1am at which time all personnel must leave the building for the duration o
	f the testing ~ 60 minutes.\n\n \n\nNote- All drains must have water\, all
	 exterior doors must have hardware/gaskets\, all windows must be able to c
	lose properly\, & the building envelope should be completed to detail.\n\n
	 \n\nContact-\n\n <http://www.compass-gc.com/> \n\n\n\n​​​​\n\nRec
	ognized as a Best Workplace — 2023\, 2024 & 2025\n\nEsteban Reyes\n\nSup
	erintendent\n\nOffice: 206.320.8741 <tel:206.320.8741> \n\n | \n\nCell: 20
	6.578.8940 <tel:206.578.8940> \n\n11332 NE 122nd Way Ste. 350\n\n\, \n\nKi
	rkland\, WA\n\n \n\n98034\n\nestebanr@compass-gc.com <mailto:estebanr@comp
	ass-gc.com> \n\n | \n\nwww.compass-gc.com <http://www.compass-gc.com/> \n\
	n | \n\n <https://www.linkedin.com/company/compass-general-construction/> 
	\n\n <https://www.instagram.com/compassgc/> \n\n <https://www.facebook.com
	/compassgc/> \n\n​​This message contains confidential information and 
