	 &amp\; a laundry room tested individually.\n</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">No
	te- All units should have water &amp\; power.</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal">Co
	ntact-</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><b>Zac Daab | Project Manager</b></p>\n<p
	 class="MsoNormal">Buchanan General Contracting Company</p>\n<p class="Mso
