DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Robert Smith (425-344-6997) & Jesus Betancourt.\n\nS
	cope- ASTM E1105. 1 fixed window on L3\, 1 fixed window on L1\, and 1 sect
	ion of storefront on L1. 3 locations total on the West elevation.\n\n\n\nT
	est Pressure- 4.5 PSF. \n\n Note- Test locations to have a completed field
	 of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barr
	ier sealant in place. No drywall surrounding the test locations. GC recomm
	ended to invite window installer to the testing date. A lift may be needed
	 for the L3 location\, or the spray rack will have to be suspended from th
	e roof.\n\nContact-\n\nAlicia Mahler\, Sr. Project Engineer\n\nSellen Cons
	truction /// C 206.718.0746\n\n \n\n \n\n
