DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654)\, Robbie Smith\, Dave Lu
	xmore\, & Jesus Betancourt\n\n \n\nScope- ASTM-E779\, 2021 WSEC. This test
	 date will only occur if the testing did not pass the day prior. Air barri
	er testing a 110-unit building. BEE will arrive onsite at 8:00am and begin
	 setting up test equipment\, testing will begin at 11am at which time all 
	personnel must leave the building for the duration of the testing ~ 90-120
	 minutes.\n\n \n\nNote- All drains must have water\, all exterior doors mu
	st have hardware/gaskets\, all windows must be able to close properly\, & 
	the building envelope should be completed to detail. GC to remove isolatio
	ns post test.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\n \n\n\n\nJosh Kirch\n\nProject Manager\n
	\nwww.inlandconstruction.com <https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=h
	ttp-3A__www.inlandconstruction.com&d=DwQFAw&c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-
	v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&r=q-1dahOzvdtJa8npn3vvh8iuwuUHsDRJj8E1O_C_bC4&m=bl9IpPFEdU
	MDt_ObtBzlSVCdMntBsqQwNAw1WjDjeSKTMOBeQK3JIJ-GaorkzArf&s=Khx9HaqRvEGD8ZLny
	OEHNjSAXRpIbT6uDjJSp6pJXzY&e=> \n\n120 W Cataldo Ave | Spokane\, WA  99201
	\n\nInland Group  |C:  801.602.7723\n\n \n\n
