	mal><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal>Scope- ASTM-E779\, 2021 WSEC.
	 This test date will only occur if the testing did not pass the day prior.
	 Air barrier testing a 110-unit building. BEE will arrive onsite at 8:00am
	 and begin setting up test equipment\, testing will begin at 11am at which
	 time all personnel must leave the building for the duration of the testin
	g ~ 90-120 minutes.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p
	><p class=MsoNormal>Note- All drains must have water\, all exterior doors 
	must have hardware/gaskets\, all windows must be able to close properly\, 
	&amp\; the building envelope should be completed to detail. GC to remove i
	solations post test.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></
	p><p class=MsoNormal>Contact-<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp\
