DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Dave Luxmore (425-345-9656) Robert Smith\, & Jesus B
	etancourt\n\n \n\nScope- ASTM E1105 window testing. 5 test locations on va
	rious product types\, specific locations TBD.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 6.0 P
	SF         \n\n \n\nNote- GC recommended to invite window manufacturer to 
	testing date. All test locations to have interior air barrier sealant\, he
	ad flashing\, and a completed field of WRB. No drywall or cladding surroun
	ding the test locations.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\nJustin Thomas\n\nSuperintende
	nt\n\nAmerican Home Builders\, Inc\n\np: 206.638-0588 e: jthomas@acg.com <
	mailto:jthomas@acg.com> \n\n \n\n
