DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin (425-595-7654)\, Jesus\, & Chris \n\n \n\nScop
	e- ASTM-E779. Air barrier testing the retails and lobby spaces on L1. BEE 
	will arrive onsite at 8:00am and begin setting up test equipment and prepp
	ing the building\, testing will begin at 9am at which time all personnel m
	ust leave the areas for the duration of the testing ~ 1 hour per test.\n\n
	 \n\nNote- All drains must have water\, all exterior doors must have hardw
	are/gaskets\, all windows must be able to close properly\, & the building 
	envelope should be completed to detail.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\n <https://www.
	rmillerinc.com/> \n\nANJEL DAVID | Assistant Project Manager\n\nM  425.471
	.2193\n\n \n\n \n\n
