DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin (425-595-7654)\, Robbie\, Dave\, & Jesus\n\n \
	n\nScope- Preparing the 110 units in the building for the air barrier test
	ing (sealing off the HVAC). BEE will arrive at 8am and begin prepping the 
	building for the air barrier testing. On 7/23 BEE will test the building a
	t 2PM. No personnel can be in the building during the testing ~ 1 hour.\n\
	n \n\nNote- BEE will shut off any breakers in the units for HVAC prior to 
	sealing the vents. GC to notify subs not to remove the plastic or turn bre
	akers back on. GC to remove isolations post test.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\n\n\n
	Josh Kirch\n\nProject Manager\n\nwww.inlandconstruction.com <https://urlde
	fense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=http-3A__www.inlandconstruction.com&d=DwQFAw
	&c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&r=q-1dahOzvdtJa8npn3vvh8iuw
	uUHsDRJj8E1O_C_bC4&m=bl9IpPFEdUMDt_ObtBzlSVCdMntBsqQwNAw1WjDjeSKTMOBeQK3JI
	J-GaorkzArf&s=Khx9HaqRvEGD8ZLnyOEHNjSAXRpIbT6uDjJSp6pJXzY&e=> \n\n120 W Ca
	taldo Ave | Spokane\, WA  99201\n\nInland Group  |C:  801.602.7723\n\n \n\
	n
