	ion1><p class=MsoNormal>Attendees- Torin (425-595-7654)\, Robbie\, Dave\, 
	&amp\; Jesus<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p><p cla
	ss=MsoNormal>Scope- Preparing the 110 units in the building for the air ba
	rrier testing (sealing off the HVAC). BEE will arrive at 8am and begin pre
	pping the building for the air barrier testing. On 7/23 BEE will test the 
	building at 2PM. No personnel can be in the building during the testing ~ 
	1 hour.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p><p class=Ms
	oNormal>Note- BEE will shut off any breakers in the units for HVAC prior t
	o sealing the vents. GC to notify subs not to remove the plastic or turn b
	reakers back on. GC to remove isolations post test.<o:p></o:p></p><p class
	=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal>Contact-<o:p></o:p></p
