CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260529T185806Z
DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654)\, Robert Smith\, & Chris
	 Shafer.\n\n \n\nScope- ASTM E779 air barrier testing in accordance with 2
	018 WSEC\, 0.25 cfm/sqft at 75 Pa maximum allowable leakage rate (ABT calc
	ulations attached).\n\n \n\nBEE will arrive onsite at Noon and bring prope
	r I.D. to get badged at the office to access the building. At 12:30 BEE wi
	ll begin unloading the testing equipment at the outdoor receiving area. On
	ce the test equipment is unloaded\, BEE will begin setting up the blower d
	oors in the entry doors to the outdoor receiving area and start sealing of
	f the AHU’s throughout the building with guidance from the GC. BEE will 
	setup 3 fans in each doorway  (9 fans total)\, GC to provide 10 separate c
	ircuits to power the fans and test equipment. 4 air pressure references (1
	/8” tubing) will be placed throughout the building near each elevation t
	o monitor the building pressure. The equipment setup and building preparat
	ions will take ~4-5 hours. Once the building is ready for testing BEE will
	 take a lunchbreak before the testing is started. The testing will start a
	t 6pm at which time all personnel shall be cleared from the building for t
	he duration of the testing ~ 90 minutes. Anyone that must stay in the buil
	ding cannot enter or exit the building during the testing\; exceptions can
	 be made if needed but should be minimized and the testing team must be ma
	de aware so they can pause the testing. Upon completion of the testing (~7
	:30pm) BEE will start dismantling the test equipment and removing the plas
	tic from the AHU’s throughout the building\, this will take ~2 hours.\n\
	n \n\n\n\n \n\nNote- All HVAC in the building to be powered off and damper
	s set in the closed position. A boom lift may be needed to access some of 
	the HVAC systems/louvers on the exterior of the building.\n\n \n\nContact-
	 \n\n\n\nBrian Jones\n\nChad Fisher Construction\n\nbrianj@cfisherconstruc
	tion.com <mailto:brianj@cfisherconstruction.com>  | www.cfisherconstructio
	n.com <http://www.cfisherconstruction.com/> \n\nOffice 360.757.0580 |Cell 
	425.314.0906\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20260703T210000
DTSTAMP:20260630T224856Z
