DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Dave Luxmore (425-345-9656) & Robert Smith.\n\nScope
	- ASTM E1105. Retest the 2 of the failed sliding glass doors in unit A (2n
	d floor) & unit C (3rd floor)\; also test the sliding glass door in unit D
	 (3rd floor).\n\nTest Pressure- 3.5 PSF. \n\n Note- Test locations to have
	 a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, head flashing installed\, and
	 interior air barrier sealant in place. No drywall or cladding surrounding
	 the test locations. GC recommended to invite window manufacturer to the t
	esting date.\n\nContact-\n\nRory Sovia | Asst. Superintendent | Nucon LLC\
	n\n206-747-8552   \n\nrory@nucondev.com <mailto:rory@nucondev.com> \n\n \n
	\n
