	6) &amp\; Robert Smith.<span style='mso-ligatures:none'><o:p></o:p></span>
	</p><p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-a
	lt:auto'>Scope- ASTM E1105.&nbsp\;Retest the 2 of the failed sliding glass
	 doors in unit A (2<sup>nd</sup> floor) &amp\; unit C (3<sup>rd</sup> floo
	r)\; also test the sliding glass door in unit D (3<sup>rd</sup> floor).<o:
	p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-
	bottom-alt:auto'>Test Pressure- 3.5 PSF. <o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal
	 style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto'>&nbsp\;Note- 
	Test locations to have a completed field of WRB surrounding them\, head fl
	ashing installed\, and interior air barrier sealant in place. No drywall o
	r cladding surrounding the test locations. GC recommended to invite window
	 manufacturer to the testing date.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal style=
	'mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto'>Contact-<o:p></o:p><
	/p><p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-al
