DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654) & Robbie Smith.\n\n \n\n
	Scope- ASTM E779. Air barrier testing 27 individual existing units prior t
	o rehab\, 9 units per day. BEE will arrive at 7am each day and begin setti
	ng up test equipment and prepping the units. All HVAC must be turned off u
	pon our arrival. Testing will start in the 1st unit at 7am at which point 
	all personnel must exit the units for the duration of the test. Duration o
	f testing is ~30 minutes per unit. \n\n \n\nNote- GC to shut off all HVAC 
	breakers and close all windows upon tenants vacating the units prior to th
	e testing.\n\n \n\nContact- \n\nCamryn Schon\n\nProject Manager\n\nInland 
	Group\n\n120 W Cataldo|Spokane\, WA 99201\n\nC: (509) 710-9421\n\ncamryns@
	inlandconstruction <mailto:coreyr@inlandconstruction.com> .com\n\n \n\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20260612T160000
DTSTAMP:20260527T174704Z
