	SEC. BEE will arrive onsite at 8:00am and begin testing the building unit 
	by unit (24 total). Each unit that is tested must be empty during the test
	ing ~30 mins. \n\n \n\nNote- All drains must have water\, all exterior doo
	rs must have hardware/gaskets\, all windows must be able to close properly
	\, & the building envelope and interior walls should be completed to detai
	l.\n\n \n\nOnsite Contact- \n\nThomas Bartlett\n\nGeneral Superintendent\n
	\nDayspring Construction\n\n425-529-3900-cell\n\n \n\n \n\n
