	Scope- ASTM E1105. Three 2 lite wide sections of storefront\, 1 in each of
	 the areas outlined on the attached document.\n\n\n\nTest Pressure- 6.0 PS
	F\n\nNote- GC to invite window installers to this testing date. Please ens
	ure all testing locations are installed to detail with a completed field o
	f WRB\, head flashing\, & interior air barrier sealant in place. No drywal
	l or cladding surrounding the test locations. \n\n Contact- Shawn Ross 425
	-677-1811\n\n \n\n
