DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Dave Luxmore (425-345-9656) Robert Smith\, & Jesus B
	etancourt\n\n \n\nScope- ASTM E1105 window testing. Three 2-lite wide sect
	ions of storefront window system.\n\n \n\nTest Pressure- 6.0 PSF         \
	n\n \n\nNote- GC recommended to invite window installer to testing date. A
	ll test locations to have interior air barrier sealant\, head flashing\, a
	nd a completed field of WRB. No drywall or cladding surrounding the test l
	ocations.\n\n \n\nContact-\n\nJustin Thomas\n\nSuperintendent\n\nAmerican 
	Home Builders\, Inc\n\np: 206.638-0588 e: jthomas@acg.com <mailto:jthomas@
	acg.com> \n\n \n\n
