DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Dave Luxmore (425-345-9656) & Robert Smith.\n\nScope
	- ASTM E1105. Retest the failed sliding glass doors (I’ll update locatio
	ns when I wrap up the report from the last visit).\n\nTest Pressure- 3.5 P
	SF. \n\n Note- Test locations to have a completed field of WRB surrounding
	 them\, head flashing installed\, and interior air barrier sealant in plac
	e. No drywall or cladding surrounding the test locations. GC recommended t
	o invite window manufacturer to the testing date.\n\nContact-\n\nRory Sovi
	a | Asst. Superintendent | Nucon LLC\n\n206-747-8552   \n\nrory@nucondev.c
	om <mailto:rory@nucondev.com> \n\n \n\n \n\n
