CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260616T163539Z
DESCRIPTION:Attendees- Torin Garner (425-595-7654)\, Chris Shafer\, Robert 
	Smith\, Dave Luxmore\, & Jesus Betancourt\,\n\nScope- ASTM E779\, Building
	 9 air barrier testing.\n\n Note- All doors should have gaskets and hardwa
	re installed\, all penetrations into the air barrier should be sealed\, wa
	ter should be in all drains\, & the building envelope should be completed 
	prior to the testing date. All HVAC in the building should be shut off upo
	n BEE’s arrival.\n\n Contacts-\n\nKyle Skow | Construction Manager\n\n \
	n\nCell - 206.619.7311\n\nEmail - Kskow@intracorphomes.com <mailto:Kskow@i
	ntracorphomes.com> \n\nINTRACORP NW\, LLC | 411 1st Avenue South\, Suite 6
	50 | Seattle WA 98104 | IntracorpHomes.com <http://www.intracorphomes.com/
	> \n\n \n\n \n\n
