	cope- Investigational window testing on a fixed window and a door with sig
	ns of water damage.\n\n \n\nTest Pressures- Limited Water 0.0 PSF\, 1.9 PS
	F\, & 2/3 rating.\n\n \n\nContact- Simrin Parmar (Homeowner)\n\n
